window.FWN_PRODIGIOUSLY_AMAZING_WEAPONSMITH_CHAPTERS=(window.FWN_PRODIGIOUSLY_AMAZING_WEAPONSMITH_CHAPTERS||[]).concat([{"number":4201,"title":"Chapter 4201 Became The Young Matriarch (1)","paragraphs":["1 Became The Young Matriarch (1)","He raised his foot to kick the beggar down.","“Let go of her!”","Li Moying kicked out her feet extremely fast, and there was a sharp whistling sound, which made everyone who heard it tremble.","If he is kicked for real by this kick, half of this person’s life will be lost if he doesn’t die!","However, this is what he deserves.","Everyone knows that Young Master Li is most nervous about his fiancée. If this beggar dares to touch Young Miss Li, isn’t he courting death?","However, at this moment, a streak of profound energy flew across the air, just blocking Li Moying’s feet.","“Hey, wait, Moying, don’t be so impulsive!”","Huang Yueli stopped him in time.","Li Moying frowned, and looked at her in surprise, “Little Li’er, you are... the finals are about to start, we don’t need to waste time for a beggar.”","Huang Yueli shook her head, “No, I always feel that something is wrong. The profound energy fluctuations emanating from this person give me a familiar feeling.”","“Mysterious power fluctuations?!” Li Moying asked strangely.","It is true that this beggar has some fluctuations in his profound strength, but that is too weak!","Any of the guards present is stronger than him.","I don’t know if this person only has such a poor cultivation base, or because of a serious injury, his cultivation base plummeted.","But no matter what, it’s none of their business.","Huang Yueli said: “Just ask and you will find out. You all let him go and let this old man get on the carriage.”","Hearing this, Li Moying frowned, obviously unwilling.","However, he never refuted the decision made by his wife.","As soon as the car curtain fell, this person became agitated again, and almost threw himself on Huang Yueli.","The profound force came out through the body, and the beggar couldn’t bear it, and almost vomited blood on the spot.","Huang Yueli hurriedly said: “Moying, sit down first, don’t worry so much, you can see that his cultivation level is not high, so he can’t hurt me. Let me ask a few words first, alright?”","Hearing this, Li Moying glanced at the beggar coldly, and gave him a warning look.","Then she sat down beside Huang Yueli.","Only then did Huang Yueli smile, and said: “This old man, I don’t know why, but I always feel that we should know each other.”","“Ah... ah...” The beggar opened his mouth, eager to say something, but he could only make a vague cry.","Huang Yueli thought for a while, took out a pen and paper from the space, and pushed it in front of him.","“Do you have something you want to tell me? It doesn’t matter if you can’t say it. You can write, right? It’s the same when you write it down.”","The beggar took the pen and paper, and immediately buried his head in writing impatiently.","Huang Yueli sat aside and watched, noticing that several nails on his fingers had been pulled out, she couldn’t help frowning.","Although I don’t know this person, it’s too miserable to see him being tortured like this, right?","Although she is not a very sympathetic person and usually kills demons and enemies without mercy, she also resents using this method to torture others.","It is obviously difficult for the beggar to pinch the pen.","However, he still worked hard to express his meaning.","The first sentence made Huang Yueli gasp."]},{"number":4202,"title":"Chapter 4202 Became The Young Matriarch (2)","paragraphs":["2 Became The Young Matriarch (2)","“I am Huang Tianhao, the Patriarch of the Sacred Phoenix Clan...”","Huang Yueli stared at this line of words, but did not respond for a while.","Because she thought she was hallucinating!","However, when she subconsciously turned her head to look at Li Moying, she found that her always aloof and calm husband also had a shocked expression on his face.","“You...you are Huang Tianhao?! How is it possible?”","The beggar made a whooping sound from his throat, as if he was smiling wryly, and the pen in his hand began to move again.","“I know, you are Huang Yueli, the god-level genius of the Sacred Phoenix Clan.”","Seeing these words, Huang Yueli and Li Moying looked at each other, and their expressions became extremely serious.","Huang Yueli frowned, “What nonsense are you talking about? I am a human clan, not a Sacred Phoenix Clan at all! I don’t believe you are the Patriarch of the Sacred Phoenix Clan either! Huang Tianhao is a strong man at the peak of the Dao Profound Realm. Floating Sea, unless the Island Master takes action himself, otherwise, it is impossible to be caught and tortured like this!”","“Besides, if you were Huang Tianhao, would you go to the Cloudy Qilin Clan to stop the carriage? Huang Tianhao would rather die than do this kind of thing?” Li Moying folded his hands on his chest and said lightly.","It was impossible for them to easily admit Huang Yueli’s identity.","This is their biggest secret. If someone cheats them casually and they get out, what’s the deal?","However, beggars have long expected that they would answer like this.","The pen in his hand didn’t stop for a moment, and he continued to write quickly.","“I mistakenly believed in the elder Huang Sanbai. A few days ago, he came to me to discuss with me under the pretense, but secretly murdered me, sealed my meridians, tied me up, and even tried to kill me, so that he could ascend to the position of Patriarch. However, the Patriarch’s seal and the key to the clan treasury are with me, in order to obtain these things, he didn’t kill me, he just tortured me repeatedly.”","“Fortunately, I also saved a hand. Since yesterday, his restraint has been loosened, but I didn’t let him notice. Today, he took the Holy Phoenix cultivators to the finals, and I found a chance to escape. ”","“I don’t want to come to the Cloudy Qilin Clan, but Huang Sanbai told me that you, Huang Yueli, are not dead, but are with Li Moying. I had no choice, so I came here.”","These few paragraphs are quite clear.","The cause and effect can all confirm each other.","The expressions of Huang Yueli and Li Moying were a little loose.","However, Huang Yueli still did not let go, but asked, “Then... what about the evidence? What evidence do you have that can prove your identity?”","Huang Tianhao wrote: “The Patriarch’s seal... Huang Sanbai doesn’t know that the Patriarch’s seal is also an ancient magic weapon, which has been fused in my sea of consciousness, so he can’t find it no matter how hard he looks, only I can Force the seal out of the body.”","He put down his pen, closed his eyes in front of Huang Yueli and Li Moying, and began to exercise.","Apparently, his current condition is really bad. Even such a small movement as mobilizing a magic weapon is very difficult for him.","Huang Tianhao’s face was flushed red, and it took a lot of effort for a small seal-shaped thing to appear in front of the two of them.","“This is... the seal of the Patriarch of the Sacred Phoenix Clan?” Huang Yueli raised her eyebrows and asked, “Can I take a closer look?”","Huang Tianhao nodded, and threw it towards her.","Huang Yueli caught the seal, held it in front of her, and observed it carefully."]},{"number":4203,"title":"Chapter 4203 Became The Young Matriarch (3)","paragraphs":["3 Became The Young Matriarch (3)","Li Moying was worried that there was something wrong with the seal and would hurt Huang Yueli, so she stood by her side with a serious expression all the time, not even daring to blink her eyes.","Huang Yueli read the seal letter several times, and said, “This is really a magic weapon, it’s the first time I’ve seen a real magic weapon! I just don’t know how to use it. Every magic weapon has a unique driving method, if you don’t recognize the owner, you can’t drive it at all.”","She said, and handed the seal to Li Moying, “Moying, have you ever seen the seal of the Patriarch of the Cloudy Qilin Clan, does it look like this?”","Seeing that Huang Yueli didn’t even think about it, she handed over the township treasure of the Sacred Phoenix Clan to the Young Master of the Cloudy Qilin Clan, Huang Tianhao almost fainted from anger!","If Huang Sanbai hadn’t sworn several times that Huang Yueli had betrayed his family and was about to marry Li Moying, he would have thought that he had admitted to the wrong person!","It took tens of thousands of years for the Sacred Phoenix Clan to produce such a god-level genius. How could he be abducted by the Cloudy Qilin Clan brat without staying in the family for a day?","Moreover, it is obvious that the elbow is turned outward!","Huang Yueli didn’t pay attention to him at all, but Li Moying saw Huang Tianhao’s expression.","However, he had no intention of restraining himself at all. Instead, he unceremoniously signed the letter and held it in his hand for a while.","He thought for a moment, and said, “I’ve seen the seal of the Cloudy Qilin Clan family. It’s a little different from this one, and the driving method is probably different. But it’s indeed a magic weapon, and it should be used as a family seal.”","After hearing his words, Huang Yueli was relieved.","She handed back the seal letter to Huang Tianhao, and said at the same time: “Alright, now I believe you are Huang Tianhao. However, I really can’t imagine that you are a strong person at the peak of the Dao Profound Realm anyway, and you are actually a strong person at the peak of the Dao Profound Realm. Huang Sanbai, that old man who is full of lies, is playing around, no wonder the Sacred Phoenix Clan has been reduced to this in the past few years!”","Hearing this unceremonious complaint, Huang Tianhao almost vomited blood on the spot!","Huang Sanbai also said this to him a few days ago.","But now, when Huang Yueli said it, it felt completely different, and it was even more shocking.","If it was different from normal times, Huang Tianhao might have to refute even if this is the god-level genius of the family.","However, at this moment, he no longer wanted to justify anything.","Huang Tianhao knew clearly that Huang Yueli in front of him was the only hope for the family now!","His goal is to bring Huang Yueli back. He cannot let her marry Li Moying and become the young wife of the Cloudy Qilin Clan for the rest of her life!","Thinking of this, Huang Tianhao quickly lowered his head and continued to write vigorously.","“I don’t think I can live long in my current state. Even if I can survive by chance, my cultivation base is not as good as before, and I can’t fully drive this magic weapon to fight. So, why don’t I pass it on to you first. I have already cut off the magic weapon. The spiritual connection on this seal, if you hold it and drop your blood on it, you can recognize the Lord.”","Seeing these words, even Huang Yueli couldn’t help being surprised.","She and Li Moying looked at each other in blank dismay.","Huang Tianhao wrote: “Huang Sanbai has already revealed that you have Sky Phoenix Ring on your body, plus your talent is so heaven-defying, becoming the Patriarch is only a matter of time.”"]},{"number":4204,"title":"Chapter 4204 Became The Young Matriarch (4)","paragraphs":["4 Became The Young Matriarch (4)","“It doesn’t make any difference if this seal is delivered to you first.”","Hundreds of years ago, when he got this seal from his father, he was so happy and excited.","I also made an oath to bring the Sacred Phoenix Clan to the peak and become the most powerful family force in the entire God Realm.","At that time, he never dreamed that in the end he passed on the seal, it would be under such circumstances.","Huang Yueli was speechless for a moment.","Because, what Huang Tianhao said was not wrong at all.","If he fails, then Huang Yueli is definitely the most suitable candidate to inherit the position of Patriarch no matter what the conditions are.","The only disadvantage may be that she is too young, and her cultivation time is too short. As a result, her cultivation is still not strong enough, and she has not yet broken through to the Dao Profound Realm.","However, in the current situation, there is no way to think too much about it.","Anyway, it will be a matter of time before Huang Yueli breaks through the Dao Profound Realm, and when the time comes, she will naturally become stronger.","If it was a hypocritical person, I’m afraid I would have to be modest and evade a few words at this time.","But Huang Yueli didn’t take this effort.","She took the seal, looked at it carefully, turned to Li Moying and said, “Husband, you seem to have sat on the throne of the Patriarch’s wife before me!”","Li Moying smiled, but did not speak.","But I was thinking in my heart, after the game is over, I will go back to the room and let this little girl know who is the “Madam”!","Huang Tianhao looked at the two of them lovingly and affectionately, and felt a burst of despair in his heart.","For a moment, I didn’t know whether my decision was right or not.","This brat of the Cloudy Qilin Clan, relying on his good looks, actually seduced their god-level genius! Shameless, shameless!","Forget it, let’s trap Huang Yueli now, and it won’t be too late to drive this unsightly man away later.","Huang Yueli used her profound strength to force out a few drops of blood from her fingertips, which dripped on the seal.","The blood dripped on the surface of the seal, and immediately turned into a red light, wrapping the entire seal in it.","She quickly calmed down, stabilised her soul with willpower, and pulled the seal towards her instead.","That’s right, Yin Xin turned around and flew towards her eyebrows.","In the end, it merged into her forehead and disappeared.","Huang Tianhao was stunned watching from the side.","Only those who have personally experienced it can understand how dangerous it is to fuse a magic weapon forged by a strong man in the Life Profound Realm. If you are not careful, you will be destroyed physically and mentally.","Therefore, when each Patriarch succeeds to the throne, even one or two elders who hide from the world will appear to protect the Dharma and ensure that they can successfully integrate.","He just handed the seal to Huang Yueli just to express his sincerity, and didn’t mean to ask her to integrate on the spot.","He never imagined that Huang Yueli would be so courageous to fuse the magic weapon in the carriage.","The key is that she successfully merged so easily!","A god-level genius is really too perverted, too perverted!","However, after the shock, Huang Tianhao became a little excited again.","With such a powerful genius here, no matter how insidious Huang Sanbai is, he might fall into her hands."]},{"number":4205,"title":"Chapter 4205 There’s Definitely Something Shady!(1)","paragraphs":["5 There’s Definitely Something Shady!(1)","After Huang Yueli integrated Yinxin, she originally wanted to ask Huang Tianhao for advice on how to use it.","Although she could figure it out on her own, Huang Tianhao, the former master, must be more experienced and save her a lot of detours.","Unfortunately, before Huang Tianhao could slowly write out the driving method, the carriage stopped.","Li Tianyi said respectfully outside the carriage: “Young Master, Young Madam, the final match has arrived, please get off the carriage.”","When Huang Tianhao heard the words “Young Madam”, his face twisted again.","Just because he was temporarily blinded by Huang Sanbai, their god-level genius almost died!","People are alive and kicking now, but they were all abducted by the brats of the Cloudy Qilin Clan!","It really couldn’t be more frustrating.","Huang Yueli raised her voice and told Li Tianyi and the others to wait a while, then turned her head and said to Huang Tianhao: “Patriarch, we are going to participate in the God Realm’s Grand Meet. It is obvious that you are not suitable to enter the competition. Huang Sanbai will definitely come today, if he recognizes you, there will be some trouble.”","“You’d better wait here for us, I will let Moying leave a few guards to guard you. Thinking about it, Huang Sanbai didn’t expect you to run into the team of the Cloudy Qilin Clan, so your safety should be no problem.”","Huang Tianhao nodded, but when Huang Yueli turned around and was about to leave, he stopped her with a few hoo hoo.","He wrote furiously: “You must be careful, Huang Sanbai will definitely not allow you to expose his true colors, maybe you have already prepared. He has vicious methods, you must be careful!”","Huang Yueli smiled, “Don’t worry, I know he won’t wait to die so easily. No matter what means he has, I’ll just wait!”","Huang Sanbai even dared to murder the Patriarch in order to achieve his ulterior motives. What else could he not do?","However, Huang Yueli is confident that she is strong enough and has her husband backing her up.","No matter what kind of conspiracy or trick, in the face of powerful strength, its effect is actually very limited.","Huang Yueli lifted the curtain and got out of the car with Li Moying.","Seeing Liu Buyan getting off from another carriage, she thought of something and stopped him.","“Senior Brother, can I trouble you to help me get to the carriage to see the man’s injury. If it can be cured, don’t miss the best time for treatment.”","Liu Buyan was stunned for a moment, “What? You said... that beggar just now? You actually let him into your carriage and asked me to see a doctor for him? What’s the origin of this guy?”","Huang Yueli looked around and saw that no one was paying attention to them, so she sent a message to Liu Buyan: “This is Huang Tianhao, the Patriarch of the Sacred Phoenix Clan!”","“What? What did you say?! How is it possible?” Liu Buyan couldn’t help crying out.","Huang Yueli quickly glared at him, motioned him to shut up, and then said: “Anyway, I’ll explain the details to you after the God Realm’s Grand Meet meeting is over. Now you go and give him a diagnosis and treatment. Anyway You didn’t make it to the final either, so you can’t delay.”","Liu Buyan was obviously reluctant, “He is Huang Sanbai’s accomplice, he almost killed you several times! What can you do? Besides, today is the final battle of the God Realm’s Grand Meet! I specially went to Floating Sea Come, just to watch this game, alright? If you are like this, what else should I watch?”"]},{"number":4206,"title":"Chapter 4206 There’s Definitely Something Shady! (2)","paragraphs":["6 There’s Definitely Something Shady! (2)","Huang Yueli glared at him angrily, “Isn’t it just a few games? The final will be held for a whole day, and it may not be finished by night. You can only see a doctor for an hour at most, so what’s the matter? The games are definitely not exciting, just don’t miss the final championship and runner-up finals.”","I also know that the final match must be between Huang Yueli and Li Moying.","Does Li Moying dare to compete with his wife for the first place?","Certainly not.","In a game without suspense, the world is full of dog food.","He refused!","Huang Yueli kicked him in the back, “Stop rambling, go!”","Seeing Liu Buyan got into the carriage, Huang Yueli followed the large army of the Cloudy Qilin Clan and entered the final competition.","The circular arena is very large, surrounded by densely packed seats, and many seats are suspended in mid-air. It is not a problem to accommodate 200,000 people.","But right now, there wasn’t even a single vacant seat in the auditorium.","Even the outside of the arena was crowded with spectators who were not qualified to enter the infield, wanting to sneak in and take a look.","As one of the most powerful forces in the God Realm, the Cloudy Qilin Clan was arranged in a suspended private seat with a very good view.","And the best seat in the middle of the private seat was deliberately vacated and reserved for this young couple.","Huang Yueli and Li Moying sat in the middle. Not long after, they saw the Right Protector appearing in the middle of the arena.","The the Right Protector is the spokesperson of the Island Master. He made a brief speech on behalf of the Island Master, and then announced the official start of the God Realm’s Grand Meet Finals.","The rules of the final are very simple, it’s just a knockout match.","Everyone already knew it very well in their hearts, and the Right Protector didn’t bother to explain.","The official competition will begin immediately.","Under the organization of the referee, the contestants will enter the competition one after another according to the order of drawing lots. Those who win will enter the next round, and those who lose will be eliminated.","Huang Yueli sat in the private seat, watching every game seriously.","As a result, after watching the finals, many talented cultivators had their shining points that caught her attention.","Huang Yueli pondered secretly.","Just then, the referee called Li Moying’s name.","All the audience at the scene immediately turned their heads in unison, and looked towards the seat of the Cloudy Qilin Clan’s private seat.","During this period of time, the only god-level genius in the God Realm has been rumored to be miraculous and completely invincible.","If there were still doubts about his strength before the God Realm’s Grand Meet, at this stage, Li Moying has already proved that he is a well-deserved strongman with practical actions step by step.","In response, he jumped off the seat and landed firmly on the ground.","Suddenly, there was a burst of screams and exclamations from around.","However, it’s not because it’s difficult for him to jump down. Any cultivator above the Mind Profound Realm can do it so well.","It’s because his floating grace is really outstanding!"]},{"number":4207,"title":"Chapter 4207 There’s Definitely Something Shady!(3)","paragraphs":["7 There’s Definitely Something Shady!(3)","The first geniuses of the major protoss, including Huang Beicheng, saw this scene and felt sour in their hearts.","but now...","Come on, they have all become cannon fodder under Li Moying’s light, so why fight?","Li Moying’s opponent had already stood in the center of the arena.","However, facing such a formidable opponent, he actually never thought of winning.","As soon as he saw Li Moying, he cupped his fists, “Young Master Li, it’s really an honor for me to fight against you this time. I hope you will be merciful and give me some advice.”","Li Moying didn’t say anything, but just nodded.","Reach out and don’t hit the smiling person.","Besides, with so many people watching, Li Moying was more or less scruples about the image of the Cloudy Qilin Clan, so she patiently went through several tricks with this person.","After seeing that the performance was almost done, they were swept away from the stage.","This game of 32 to 16 was easily won!","There was admiration all around.","Li Moying, however, acted as if she hadn’t heard anything, and immediately returned to the private seat, and sat down next to his family’s Little Li’er.","Next, several more games were played.","“The next game is Li Yuehuang, a cultivator from the human clan, and Li Guangxuan, a cultivator from the Cloudy Qilin Clan.”","The name Li Yuehuang is extremely unfamiliar to most people.","Besides, the word human clan was added in front of the name.","The human cultivators who can enter the finals of the God Realm’s Grand Meet can definitely be counted on one hand.","For a while, many people showed doubts on their faces.","“What’s the situation? Who is this Li Yuehuang?”","“It’s strange. Is this a genius from a major force in the human clan? Or a closed disciple secretly cultivated by a hidden powerhouse?”","Everyone was taken aback when they saw her graceful figure floating down from midair like a cloud.","Then suddenly realized, “Damn it, it turns out that Li Yuehuang is Li Moying’s fiancée, the legendary Young Miss Li!”","Rumors about Huang Yueli have been circulating in Floating Sea recently.","Unfortunately, not many people know her real name.","Seeing her appear on the stage, many people showed a bit of ridicule.","“Hehe, it turned out to be her! She still dared to appear in the finals! The match depends on Young Master Li’s help in order to successfully qualify.”","“Could that rumor be true? In order for her to qualify, Young Master Li took the initiative to lose a match to her?”","“Of course it’s true! Otherwise, with her strength, how could she qualify?”","“That’s right, she’s just a human clan, and she doesn’t come from those big powers. How could she compete with the god clan cultivators?”","Everyone cast contemptuous glances at Huang Yueli.","“Actually, there’s no need to cheat like this to get out of the semi-finals! Wait a minute, and being beaten into a mess isn’t embarrassing enough!”","“That is, since Young Master Li can marry her and come in, she just hugs the man’s thigh tightly and it’s over. Why come out and pretend to be a genius?”","“Wait a minute, there will be a good show!”","Some people shook their heads in response to this argument, “That’s not necessarily the case, don’t you see who her opponent is!”","When everyone heard this, they all froze for a moment."]},{"number":4208,"title":"Chapter 4208 There’s Definitely Something Shady!(4)","paragraphs":["8 There’s Definitely Something Shady!(4)","Everyone turned their heads and found that Huang Yueli’s opponent was actually from the Cloudy Qilin Clan.","Li Guangxuan is also a very outstanding god-level genius of the Cloudy Qilin Clan, but compared with Li Leyun and Huang Beicheng, he is still a lot worse.","With his strength, people in the original family did not think highly of him.","Being able to enter the finals this time is definitely an extraordinary performance and has become a dark horse.","As a god-level genius of the Cloudy Qilin Clan, Li Guangxuan naturally knows better than outsiders what kind of a heaven-defying existence their future Patriarch’s wife is!","Seeing her end, Li Guangxuan shivered involuntarily.","Huang Yueli saw that he was nervous, so she quickly smiled, “Well, I know you. You performed well this time, and you made it to the finals! It’s a pity that the lottery was not drawn well... hey, don’t be so nervous, I I won’t eat you again!”","“Ahem, I... I’m not nervous.”","Li Guangxuan didn’t want to be so nervous, but he couldn’t control his body at all.","This is the natural reaction of an ordinary cultivator when facing a strong one, and it is the same when he meets the Young Master.","Huang Yueli said helplessly: “Alright, I won’t say anything. Let’s compare quickly, don’t waste other cultivators’ time.”","Hearing this, Li Guangxuan quickly took a deep breath, intending to adjust his breathing and start the official competition.","However, the more he wanted to calm down, the more he couldn’t calm down.","Seeing him like this, Huang Yueli sighed inwardly.","It’s no wonder that Li Guangxuan couldn’t enter the first echelon of the heavenly genius team. This psychological quality will definitely be a huge obstacle in actual combat in the future!","It was useless for Li Guangxuan to calm down for a long time. In the end, he simply bowed abruptly.","“That...Young Miss Li, I don’t think I’m your opponent. There’s no need to compete in this match. I’ll just admit defeat!”","After speaking, he hurriedly ran off the arena with his head covered in cold sweat.","“Oh? Wait, don’t run away! Just compare, I won’t really beat you!”","Huang Yueli was stunned for a moment, and by the time she realized that she wanted to stop him, it was already too late.","As long as both feet step out of the field area, it is considered a loss.","The referee also stared at this scene dumbfounded. In the end, he could only raise his hand to signal, “The thirteenth match of the first round, the winner: Li Yuehuang, a human cultivator!”","The corner of Huang Yueli’s mouth twitched.","This is indeed more time-saving, but I always feel that something is not right!","Her intuition was not wrong.","Because of this sudden abandonment, the audience in the audience were stunned.","However, after a short period of silence, fierce opposition and doubts followed.","“Damn, this...what’s going on? Can this be considered a win?”","“Shadow, there is definitely a shady here! Li Guangxuan is one of the top ten strengths of the Cloudy Qilin Clan after all, and he has also made meritorious service in the coalition forces. How could he not be able to defeat such a waste?”","“Of course it’s not that you can’t beat him, but you dare not beat him! That’s the favorite of the Young Master of the Cloudy Qilin Clan. Li Guangxuan is just a heavenly genius. Can you afford to offend him?”","“How could such a thing happen? First, relying on the fiancé to enter the finals, and now forcing fellow cultivators to abstain to enter the second round! This is simply a shame for the cultivators!”","Only then did Li Guangxuan realize that he had done something stupid.","He wanted to explain, but no one would listen to him anymore."]},{"number":4209,"title":"Chapter 4209 She Is That Young Miss Li!(1)","paragraphs":["9 She Is That Young Miss Li!(1)","Huang Yueli frowned slightly upon hearing these discussions.","For this kind of thing, even if you talk about it, it is not as effective as showing your real strength.","There are still several games to come, and she can always show her normal level.","Suddenly, she thought of something, and hurried back to the private seat of the Cloudy Qilin Clan.","Sure enough, her husband was already on the verge of fury. He had already stood up and was about to jump off.","Huang Yueli hugged his arm and whispered, “Alright, Moying, don’t be as knowledgeable as these ignorant people, they will know my strength after the next round of competition!”","Li Moying’s complexion was still very ugly.","Huang Yueli looked around and secretly kissed him on the cheek.","Li Moying’s complexion turned cloudy.","Liu Buyan, who had just trotted over to watch the game after Huang Tianhao’s diagnosis and treatment, happened to see this scene in his eyes, and was speechless for a while.","Before seeing the match, someone stuffed him with dog food again?","Why is he the one who gets hurt every time?","The voices condemning Li Yuehuang continued for a while.","However, no matter what the onlookers said, everything Huang Yueli did in this game was completely in line with the rules of the game, and there was no violation of the rules.","Among the cultivators, they feel that the difference in strength between each other is too great, so they will be ashamed and give up the competition...","This kind of thing is actually very common.","Because of this, no one can say that Huang Yueli is not eligible for the competition.","Therefore, everyone can do nothing but gossip.","As the next game started, the discussion gradually subsided.","The God Realm’s Grand Meet Contest continued to proceed in an orderly manner.","After more than an hour, the 16 matches of the first round were all over.","The competition was suspended for half an hour.","There are a total of eight games in the second round, sixteen to eight, and eight people to be eliminated.","It can be seen that the second round of competition is several times more exciting than the first round just now, because the strength of the cultivators who can get here is one level higher than that of the top thirty-two.","Huang Yueli became more focused on watching.","Li Moying’s match was still the same as last time, without any suspense.","The cultivators who got Li Moying were in a state of giving up. Like the cultivators in the previous round, they asked Li Moying for advice very politely.","Li Moying played another teaching match, and then calmly returned to sit beside Huang Yueli.","It attracted bursts of admiration from the girls in the stands.","Huang Yueli pursed her lips, raised her eyes and glanced at the man beside her, a little sour, “Why are there so many girls who adore you when you leave the stage, even those men praise you! And as soon as I play, so many people scold me? It’s simply too abnormal!”","Li Moying raised her eyebrows, her dark starry eyes fell on her arrogant little face, and there was a slight smile in her eyes.","“Why do you want so many people to worship you? I just need to worship you.”","Huang Yueli’s face turned red all of a sudden, “You... When did you become so good at talking?”"]},{"number":4210,"title":"Chapter 4210 She Is That Young Miss Li!(2)","paragraphs":["0 She Is That Young Miss Li!(2)","“It’s always been like this. When I see you, I know everything.” Li Moying curled his lips.","However, he only had her in his eyes.","From the beginning to the end, there was only her.","Huang Yueli was stunned for a long time, she didn’t even notice that the referee called her name.","Li Moying gently pushed her, “Get down quickly, it’s your turn!”","Huang Yueli suddenly came back to her senses, and quickly jumped down from the private seat.","At this moment, because she was in a daze just now and delayed the time, the audience was full of curses again.","Many people thought that Huang Yueli knew that this match would definitely be embarrassing, so she didn’t dare to play at all.","“This time, the opponent is not from the Cloudy Qilin Clan. Even if her fiancé is Li Moying, it’s useless!”","“She knows she’s going to wear clothes, so she’s hiding, right?”","“Hey, what’s the use of hiding? It’s really naive! If we hide, won’t we know her true strength?”","Everyone talked enthusiastically, so when Huang Yueli suddenly fell from the sky, they couldn’t recover.","Even Huang Yueli’s opponent felt that she would not make an appearance, and had already begun to rejoice in her heart for her good luck.","Unexpectedly, she suddenly appeared on the field again.","“You...you...” The other party was tongue-tied.","Huang Yueli gave him a strange look, “Lin Yongfei, right? Are you a stammer?”","“Who is stuttering?” Lin Yongfei’s face froze for a moment, “I mean, if you want to give up the game, you can tell the referee right now! I shot very fast, if you say it again at the start of the game, I may not have time to close it Hand. At that time, it would be bad to hurt you! We are all human, and I don’t want to hurt a beauty like you.”","Lin Yongfei was born in a powerful force of the human clan – Qiankun Palace.","The number of heaven-level geniuses in the human clan is very rare, and each of them is the wealth of the entire human clan, so they are still united with each other.","Especially Huang Yueli was so beautiful, which aroused his feelings of pity and pity.","But who knows, after hearing this, Huang Yueli looked surprised, “What did you say? You asked me to forfeit the match? After finally making it to the second round of the final, why should I forfeit the match?”","“Well, I’ve already said the ugly things I said earlier. If you don’t give up the game now, I won’t be responsible for being injured by me later. The fiance of your Young Master of the Cloudy Qilin Clan can’t come to trouble me either. .”","Huang Yueli was speechless for a while, “You can hurt me before you talk! Alright, don’t waste time, let’s do it!”","However, Lin Yongfei remained motionless, and said, “You’re a girl, I’ll let you make the first move!”","Don’t men like to pretend to be gentlemen in front of beautiful women?","This thought flashed across Huang Yueli’s mind, but she didn’t push it any further.","Anyway, it was Lin Yongfei who wanted to let her get beaten up by her, and he asked for it himself.","She stepped forward abruptly, clenched her right hand into a fist, and powerful profound energy gathered towards her fist, forming a dazzling ray of light.","Then, she swung it towards Lin Yongfei’s chest without hesitation!"]},{"number":4211,"title":"Chapter 4211 She Is That Young Miss Li! (3)","paragraphs":["1 She Is That Young Miss Li! (3)","Lin Yongfei still had a smile on his face when he saw her make a move.","Although the physical talent of the human clan is much lower than that of the god race, they also have other advantages.","The understanding of the human clan is generally a level higher than that of the god race!","Therefore, although the cultivation base of human geniuses is slightly inferior, they are all good at various fighting skills, and various mysterious skills emerge in endlessly, and they can often achieve unexpected results in battle.","Lin Yongfei is the best at all kinds of dodging skills, and he just wanted to show off to the people on the opposite side.","But he never dreamed that Huang Yueli’s speed would be so fast once he made a move!","It’s so fast it’s unimaginable!","At the moment when Lin Yongfei was still in a daze, her profound strength had already gathered together, surrounded by an ear-piercing whistling sound, and struck towards his chest!","Only now did he realize that something was wrong, and he was so frightened that the hairs all over his body lost.","However, it was only at this point that he wanted to dodge. With his strength, there was nothing he could do.","Lin Yongfei received the punch abruptly, was sent flying by Huang Yueli, and fell below the arena.","The whole stand was silent for a while.","Even the referees on the field stared wide-eyed and couldn’t say a word for a long time!","Lin Yongfei is one of the best talented cultivators in the human clan, even compared to the top heavenly geniuses of the Protoss, he is not inferior.","In the eyes of everyone at the scene, Li Yuehuang must not even be able to compare with Lin Yongfei’s finger as he is also a human clan.","But who would have thought that the match had just started, and before everyone could even blink, Lin Yongfei had already been sent flying by Huang Yueli!","This accident happened too fast.","Until Lin Yongfei landed, many people were still discussing how embarrassing Huang Yueli would be if she waited a while!","Even, seeing someone being knocked into the air on the field, many people thought it was Huang Yueli who fell!","It wasn’t until they took a closer look and found that Huang Yueli was still standing in the middle of the arena that they realized... the result of the match was completely opposite to what they had imagined!","“Damn it, I feel like I must be hallucinating! Could it be Lin Yongfei who flew out just now?”","“Did she think of a way to deal with Lin Yongfei again? Speaking of which, Lin Yongfei and her are both human...”","“human clan shit! Even if it’s the same race, who would give up the ranking in such a field? It’s not a fool! Lin Yongfei doesn’t need to be afraid of Li Moying!”","Everyone was discussing and talking about everything.","However, even though they racked their brains and came up with all kinds of weird arguments to prove that Huang Yueli used improper means to win the victory, in the end, they still couldn’t convince themselves no matter what.","Everyone clearly saw the match just now!","Huang Yueli really knocked Lin Yongfei away with one move!","It’s impossible to say it’s fake.","However, if this is true... then it would be even more unbelievable!","Even a genius like Lin Yongfei couldn’t stop her move...","How strong is this Young Miss Li? !","Not necessarily, is it really a god-level genius?"]},{"number":4212,"title":"Chapter 4212 She Is That Young Miss Li!(4)","paragraphs":["2 She Is That Young Miss Li!(4)","On the stands, in the private seat of the Xuanwu clan, an old man stood up from his seat in shock, staring at Huang Yueli’s position without blinking.","The Patriarch of the Xuanwu clan turned his head back in surprise, and looked at the old man, “Elder Nine Ling, what’s wrong with you? You also know Li Moying’s fiancée?”","Xuan Jiuling is one of the most prestigious elders of the Xuanwu clan, and also has a high status in the coalition army, holding the post of god general.","It can be said that he is a pivotal figure in the family, second only to the Patriarch in influence.","He has always been known for being calm and steady, and it is rare to see him lose his composure like this.","Could it be...the identity of Young Miss Li, is there any other great secret?","Xuan Jiuling regained his composure, sat down again, and thought flashed in his eyes.","“That’s right, it turned out to be her... I should have remembered it earlier, but, after hearing that Young Master Li was attacked by the Sacred Phoenix Clan and fell into a coma, he woke up and betrothed the doctor who treated him. I thought that he Divorced his wife and married another... and I sighed quite a bit, it turns out...”","The cultivators of the Xuanwu clan all looked blank, “Elder Jiu Ling, what are you talking about?”","Xuan Jiuling calmed down, and then recalled: “I met this Young Miss Li in You’an City. At that time, Young Master Li and Young Master Jun had just returned from the front line of the demon clan and killed the demon Ruize. The God General’s Mansion held a celebration banquet for them. At that time, Young Master Li brought a woman over, saying that this was his wife. At that time, Jing Shaoyuan and Li Moying were a little at odds, and even asked his fiancée Lan Mengqing Provoked Young Miss Li, but in the end, she easily defeated her!”","The elders of the Xuanwu clan had a shocked look on their faces.","“Lan Mengqing?! I have the impression that she is also a very outstanding genius in the Tianhu clan, a second-class genius! It turns out that she had easily defeated a god-level genius so long ago? However, Elder Nine Ling, why didn’t you get Young Miss Li out? Even I almost thought that she really relied on Young Master Li to enter the finals!”","Xuan Jiuling shook her head, “Because this Young Miss Li looks completely different from what I saw last time!”","“What?! How is it possible?”","Xuan Jiuling said: “That’s true. Not only is her appearance different, but even the aura of profound energy on her body seems to be very different from last time. Even if the same person can use the Disguise Technique to change his appearance, he still wants to hide himself. The aura of profound strength is not so easy! Therefore, I didn’t think about it at all! Now that I think about it, Young Miss Li must have a Spirit Armament that is more than a treasure, used to cover up her identity and aura.”","“In addition, the news from the Cloudy Qilin Clan that Li Moying was engaged to a female doctor also misled me. I remember that this girl Li is a very good spirit weapon master! Why did she suddenly change? Became a doctor? If this is true, what can she do wrong? Martial arts talent is so high...”","After hearing Xuan Jiuling’s explanation, the cultivators present understood.","At the same time, he was even more shocked than before!","It turns out that not only is she not the waste they imagined, but she is also such a perverted genius.","It’s no wonder that Young Master Li fell under her pomegranate skirt.","Xuan Jiuling was not the only one who recognized Huang Yueli."]},{"number":4213,"title":"Chapter 4213 She Is That Young Miss Li!(5)","paragraphs":["3 She Is That Young Miss Li!(5)","At that time in You’an City God General’s Mansion, several young cultivators who participated in the celebration banquet also came to Floating Sea to watch the battle.","However, they don’t have Xuan Jiuling’s knowledge and cultivation, so they are not sure that their guess is correct.","Therefore, I can only think about it silently in my heart.","Although not many people knew Huang Yueli’s real identity, it didn’t affect the warm atmosphere at the scene.","Just a quarter of an hour ago, everyone thought that Huang Yueli must be in trouble, that she would definitely make a fool of herself.","But in the blink of an eye, the situation was instantly reversed!","There is nothing more shocking than this!","For a moment, everyone looked in the direction of the Cloudy Qilin Clan’s Yajian, and their hearts were extremely shocked!","“So that’s it! Let me just say, how could such an astonishingly talented person as Young Master Li find a vase to be his wife?”","“That’s right, that’s right, who said just now that Young Master Li is obsessed with women? Is this a slap in the face?”","“By the way, I remember there were rumors that Young Master Li’s fiancée was also a god-level genius. Could it be true?”","“Hehe, you’re overthinking this! How can there be so many god-level geniuses? It’s not bad to have one in every ten thousand years! Don’t think about it! However, this Young Miss Li is at least a top heaven-level genius, plus With such a beautiful face, it is not surprising that Young Master Li can fall in love with her.”","While everyone was shocked, their evaluation of Huang Yueli was much higher.","It’s just that almost no one thinks that she is really a god-level genius.","Two god-level geniuses appeared at the same time, and they were still husband and wife?","This kind of thing is too outrageous, most people don’t even think about it, they just intuitively think it’s impossible!","Huang Yueli didn’t listen to what others said, because she could guess it just by thinking about it.","Today, she came to the God Realm’s Grand Meet Finals to express herself and to return to the Sacred Phoenix Clan with the strongest posture.","Therefore, she has no intention of concealing her strength.","Defeating a mere Lin Yongfei is just the beginning!","The perimeter of each private room is covered by a defensive array, so that people outside cannot clearly see the situation inside.","However, there is one thing she is sure of, Huang Sanbai and the others must be here!","Moreover, Huang Sanbai has come to this point where even the Patriarch of the family has been arrested and tortured by him. He will definitely not allow himself to return to the family easily.","I don’t know, what else can he do in the finals?","Huang Yueli squinted her eyes, and sat down beside Li Moying again.","Although there were only eight games in the second round, it took much longer than the sixteen games in the first round combined!","The top sixteen contestants are closer in strength to each other.","Except for the two games between Li Moying and Huang Yueli, who were quick and quick to decide the winner, out of the remaining six games, four of them were tug-of-war.","The strength of the two sides is equal, each has a chance to win, and various methods emerge in endlessly.","In the end, the winner was successfully decided.","And Li Moying’s bodyguard commander, Li Tianyi, was unfortunately defeated in this round of competition.","Li Zijun, on the other hand, narrowly won the promotion with a very slight advantage."]},{"number":4214,"title":"Chapter 4214 She Is That Young Miss Li!(6)","paragraphs":["4 She Is That Young Miss Li!(6)","After the second round, there was another half-hour break as usual.","At this moment, Li Shihong was overjoyed with a smile on his face.","When the competition enters the third round, it is already eight to four!","Among the top eight young cultivators in the entire God Realm, there are actually three cultivators from the Cloudy Qilin Clan!","You must know that among some ancient protoss, none of them entered the top eight or even the top sixteen.","And their Cloudy Qilin Clan... Not only are they destined to win the first and second places, but now Li Zijun is so competitive that he has taken the third place all of a sudden!","This time, the Cloudy Qilin Clan is definitely the biggest winner of this God Realm’s Grand Meet!","Li Shihong walked over purposely and greeted the three finalists.","“Moying, Young Miss Li, and Zijun, you are really outstanding, the whole family is proud of you! Haha, I am so happy, our Cloudy Qilin Clan has not been so elated for many years pass!”","And all of this was brought by Li Moying.","The influence of a god-level genius on the family should not be underestimated!","“Wait until the game, don’t be nervous. Being in the top eight is already a great thing. At this time, the pressure should not be too great, and a little relaxation may have a miraculous effect. You must not rush for success. do you know?”","Li Shihong couldn’t help exhorting repeatedly.","However, he mainly said these words to Li Zijun.","In his opinion, Huang Yueli and Li Moying had nothing to tell them. In the face of absolute strength, any skill would appear insignificant.","Therefore, the two of them... will surely win the first and second places for the Cloudy Qilin Clan!","Huang Yueli listened to Li Shihong without saying a word, and said nothing from the beginning to the end.","To be honest, Li Shihong treated her fairly well, especially after knowing that she had a god-level talent, he wanted to confess her.","It’s just a pity... After today, Li Shihong will probably be very, very disappointed.","I hope that the old man will be able to withstand such a blow when the time comes!","...","The rest period ended, and the game entered the third round.","The remaining eight cultivators will compete for the four spots in the semi-finals.","The competition has entered a fierce stage. Both the participating cultivators and the audience in the stands are full of enthusiasm and passion.","Huang Yueli looked at the match arrangement, and couldn’t help being slightly taken aback.","Li Moying looked over, “Little Li’er, what’s wrong with you?”","Huang Yueli pointed to the underline next to her name, “Look, according to the tournament arrangement, my opponent in the next round...is it Jing Shaoyuan?”","The order of the competition is determined according to their ranking in the semi-final group stage.","Li Moying thought for a moment, then nodded, “That’s right. Jing Shaoyuan seems to be the number one master of the White Tiger Clan. We met him last time in You’an City.”","Huang Yueli said with a smile: “I just said, this one seems to be an acquaintance! By the way, during the preliminary round, I even beat up his younger brother and knocked him out of the game! Tell me, will he be new?” Combined with old hatred and old hatred, the attack is particularly vicious, isn’t it?”","Li Moying glanced at her, “From your tone, you seem quite excited? Are you afraid that the world will not be chaotic?”","Huang Yueli pouted, and twisted hard on his arm.","“What are you talking about! It’s as if I’m deliberately going to bully others! It’s too much!”"]},{"number":4215,"title":"Chapter 4215 Could It Really Be God-Level? (1)","paragraphs":["4215 Could It Really Be God-Level? (1)","Li Moying raised her eyebrows amusedly, “Isn’t it?”","Soon, Li Moying was gone.","This time, his opponent was a bit special, a cultivator from the Chaos race.","The Chaos Clan is the most special branch of the ancient gods, because their main attribute is the dark attribute.","The dark attribute, because of its special nature and astonishingly destructive power, was once a taboo for the Protoss for a long time.","Because of this, the Chaos Clan was not recognized, and even like the Demon Clan, they became a powerful race that everyone called out to fight.","However, later, in the face of the demon race’s pressing force, a peace treaty was signed between the major god races, and the Chaos race was also united, sitting at the negotiating table for the first time.","Since then, the Chaos Clan has developed tremendously, becoming stronger rapidly, and there are more and more masters in the Clan.","However, the dark attribute is still very dreadful. Therefore, the Chaos race is relatively low-key and rarely walks outside.","Because of this, before the God Realm’s Grand Meet, the major god clans did not know who the Young Masters of the Chaos clan were.","This time, there were also four cultivators from the Chaos Clan that entered the finals. If Huang Yueli was not counted, they would be on the same level as the Cloudy Qilin Clan. This is quite remarkable.","However, three of the four had already been eliminated in the previous two rounds.","There is only this last person left, and the opponent he faces is Li Moying...","It seems that it is impossible to enter the semi-finals.","When the Chaos cultivators saw Li Moying, they looked stern, but they didn’t immediately admit defeat like the cultivators who faced Young Master Li in the previous two rounds.","On the contrary, he cupped his hands and said: “I am Xiao Yacheng, Chaos Clan. I know that Young Master Li is powerful, but our Chaos Clan’s skills are not ordinary. Your Excellency, please be careful and fight with me with all your strength!”","Li Moying raised her eyebrows and couldn’t help but look at him more.","In front of him, he has not seen such a confident martial artist of his generation for a long time.","However, he doesn’t dislike such people, on the contrary, he still has a bit of appreciation for them.","After all, the Chaos Clan’s skills are weird, if Xiao Yacheng chooses to attack secretly, maybe he might be caught off guard.","However, this person still wanted to sound a reminder.","Li Moying nodded, “Alright, then I will fulfill your wish.”","As soon as the game started, he started to attack.","The cultivators in the stands were full of anticipation, waiting to see Xiao Yacheng’s performance.","As a result, as soon as the game started, he was slapped away by Li Moying!","However, the Chaos Clan’s skills are indeed a bit weird. After his body flew out, he seemed to be supported by a force, and fell in time. He fell to the corner of the arena, and did not fall out immediately.","In this way, although his landing posture was a bit ugly, at least he was not eliminated immediately.","Li Moying was a little surprised, raised her eyebrows and looked at him a few more times.","He paused for a while, and shot again.","This time, Xiao Yacheng learned his lesson and didn’t dare to accept his tricks at all, so he simply dodged around the arena desperately.","Relying on the profound skills of the Chaos Clan, he narrowly escaped danger time and time again. A few times, he was even about to be photographed out of the arena by an inch."]},{"number":4216,"title":"Chapter 4216 Could It Really Be God-Level? (2)","paragraphs":["4216 Could It Really Be God-Level? (2)","At first, the audience in the stands were amazed.","After all, being eliminated by Young Master Li without a move is already a great achievement for the younger generation of cultivators.","However, after three or five moves, everyone couldn’t stand it anymore.","“This...what’s the matter? Why has Xiao Yacheng been hiding around?”","“Your question...wasn’t too deep? Facing a strong man like Young Master Li, what else can he do besides hide? Are you going to attack him? That will definitely kill you faster!”","“I know it too! The question is, what’s the point of him hiding like this? This is a competition, and the winner must be determined, so he will definitely lose! Why don’t you waste time and step off the stage quickly? What is this? Not only is it impossible to win the game, but there are a lot of ugliness, which is not worth it!”","Indeed, Xiao Yacheng was beaten into the air several times by Li Moying, and his landing posture became uglier each time.","It would be considered light to throw a dog and eat shit.","Going on like this is nothing more than embarrassment.","Who can enter the top eight, who is not the most outstanding genius of the Protoss, who has a very high status in the family, who can afford to lose this person?","Huang Yueli sat in the private seat in mid-air, resting her cheeks, and was also seriously watching the game.","At first, she also thought it was a bit funny, but after a few more glances, she suddenly widened her eyes and let out a “huh”.","Liu Buyan who was beside her heard it and looked over, “What’s wrong?”","“This Xiao Yacheng seems to be quite capable!”","“What ability? The wrestling posture is particularly creative?”","Huang Yueli smiled without saying a word.","And Li Moying on the field also sensed something was wrong.","He respected the opponents who dared to challenge him, so, several times when Xiao Yacheng fell to the ground and insisted on getting up stubbornly, he didn’t take the opportunity to knock them down, but showed mercy and gave him a chance to stand up again.","But after a few strokes, he felt that the surrounding air seemed to become extremely stagnant.","When he made a move, he could have easily mobilized the profound energy of heaven and earth in the surrounding environment, but now, the speed of absorbing profound weapons has obviously slowed down...","Although this change is still very weak, it made Li Moying alert.","He immediately let go of his consciousness and looked around.","In the sea of consciousness, a faint black mist floated around the arena and gradually gathered towards him.","Li Moying shuddered suddenly!","This is the energy of the dark attribute!","The dark attribute does not exist in ordinary heaven and earth profound energy. Therefore, it is necessary for Chaos cultivators to use their own profound energy as an introduction to gather it from the void.","Li Moying has never encountered a dark attribute cultivator before, so although she has heard rumors about the dark attribute, she has never experienced it personally.","Only now did he understand.","The reason why the dark attribute is considered very strange is precisely because it is silent and invisible, and will quietly invade the meridian and spiritual consciousness of the cultivator.","After being eroded by the dark attribute, the cultivator’s reaction ability will gradually slow down, and even hallucinations will appear in the brain. This process is very slow, and many cultivators can’t react at all. In the end, they lose their minds and become the defeat of the dark attribute cultivator. .","Even a god-level genius like Li Moying almost fell for the first contact.","Fortunately, he quickly reacted."]},{"number":4217,"title":"Chapter 4217 Could It Really Be God-Level? (3)","paragraphs":["4217 Could It Really Be God-Level? (3)","After taking precautions, Li Moying began to consciously circulate the profound energy in her body, trying to force these dark attribute energies out of her body.","However, with the flow of profound energy, he suddenly had a strange feeling.","The dark attribute energy that first invaded his body has already entered his dantian along his meridians.","After staying for a while, it quickly mixed with the evil qi in his dantian.","Li Moying’s whole body was shaken. She only felt that at the moment when these two energies merged, a tingling sensation came from her dantian and spread throughout her body instantly.","This caused his movements to freeze for a moment.","Originally, Xiao Yacheng was forced into a corner by him, so he had to run for his life.","At this time, Li Moying suddenly found that his movements slowed down, thinking that he was being entangled by his own dark attribute energy, and he was overjoyed.","He reacted extremely quickly, immediately stood up from the ground, and struck out with both palms!","The dense dark attribute energy formed a stream of black energy, which erupted suddenly, covering the arena with a layer of dark mist. cultivators who sat far away could not even see clearly what was happening on the arena.","However, just looking at this astonishing aura, everyone knew that Xiao Yacheng had launched a full blow!","And what about Li Moying?","Li Moying, the majestic god-level genius, and the Young Master Li, who seemed too strong to be defeated, seemed to be immobilized at this time, unable to move at all.","Xiao Yacheng’s speed was very fast, and the palms he struck out with all his strength quickly pressed on Li Moying’s chest.","Two groups of dense dark attribute energy bombarded into his body.","Li Moying was actually tricked!","Moreover, it was the front that was hit by such a powerful energy!","Not to mention that he is only at the late stage of the Mind Profound Realm, even if he is a martial artist at the Dao Profound Realm, if he has no defense at all and takes these two palms abruptly, he will definitely be seriously injured!","For a moment, there was an uproar in the stands.","“What’s going on? Why is this happening?”","“Young Master Li was actually hit! What happened to him? He won’t capsize in the gutter and lose to Xiao Yacheng, right?”","“I’m going, this Chaos Clan is really evil! Even Young Master Li was defeated by him!”","Almost all the audience couldn’t sit still anymore. They stood up one after another, staring at the arena with wide-eyed eyes, trying to see clearly what happened on the arena through the thick black fog.","In the private seat of the Cloudy Qilin Clan, the clansmen of Li Moying were in a mess.","Li Shihong and the others were all pale, full of disbelief.","“It’s over, it’s over! Moying lost to this kind of guy!”","“It’s all my fault. Although Chaos people are rare, they are indeed very difficult to deal with once encountered. I should have warned Moying earlier!”","“Patriarch, don’t blame yourself. Even if the Young Master loses, it’s alright. As long as he doesn’t suffer any fatal injuries, he will not be afraid of the Chaos Race after he learns his lesson.”","“Well, even though that’s the case, that Xiao Yacheng hit him so hard just now, I’m really worried about Moying...”","Among the waves of anxious discussions, only Huang Yueli remained calm.","Seeing Li Shihong and the others running around in a hurry, she thought for a while, and said aloud, “Lord Patriarch, elders, you really don’t have to worry, I believe Moying will be fine.”","Seeing her like this, Li Shihong thought she was comforting them, and hurriedly said: “I know, Moying won’t be seriously injured, and the people in Floating Sea are watching!”"]},{"number":4218,"title":"Chapter 4218 Could It Really Be God-Level? (4)","paragraphs":["4218 Could It Really Be God-Level? (4)","Huang Yueli shook her head, “That’s not what I meant. Lord Patriarch, don’t you believe in Moying’s strength? There is no way he will lose!”","No matter how difficult the moment is, he can miraculously turn defeat into victory.","What’s more, in such an arena, facing an opponent whose strength is far inferior to his?","It’s impossible for Li Moying to fall here, but it’s a fact that he was hit, but I don’t know what this man is paying attention to...","Just as Huang Yueli rested her chin in thought, another exclamation came from the crowd.","Suddenly, a figure flew out of the black mist.","Everyone’s eyes were immediately attracted, and they rushed forward, wanting to see who the person who fell off the field was!","If it’s really Young Master Li, then they have really witnessed history!","It’s a pity that there are too many people in the stands. Most of the people sitting in the back row can’t see anything even if they push forward as hard as they can.","And the black mist on the field finally dissipated at this time, revealing the man standing in the middle of the stands.","“Li...Young Master Li! The winner is Young Master Li!”","“What? What’s going on? I saw him being hit by Xiao Yacheng just now? Why was Xiao Yacheng flying out instead when he was fine?”","“How do I know this? But, how could Young Master Li lose to a heaven-level genius of his generation?”","Everyone was discussing, and they were all at a loss.","Not to mention the spectators, even the referee, who had been sitting in the corner of the arena, was already the closest person to both sides of the match, so he didn’t understand what happened just now.","The only thing that could be seen was that after being hit by Xiao Yacheng, Li Moying was indeed sluggish for a while.","However, just when Xiao Yacheng was about to make persistent efforts and knock him out of the arena, Li Moying suddenly moved.","With this movement, his figure was like a ghost, and it was astonishingly fast.","Xiao Yacheng didn’t react at all, so he flew out directly.","Until he fell to the bottom of the arena, he still had a dazed expression on his face.","Although there are too many puzzles, this match did end with Li Moying’s victory.","Hearing these words, Li Moying didn’t say anything, and returned to the private seat with a flicker of her figure, and sat next to her wife.","However, when he returned to the private seat, he couldn’t clean himself up. Li Shihong and others immediately surrounded him and greeted him with care. At the same time, they couldn’t help asking curiously why he suddenly turned defeat into victory.","Li Moying narrowed his eyes slightly, as if he was thinking about something, and said slowly: “This...it’s the first time I came into contact with dark attribute energy, and it was indeed affected. However, Xiao Yacheng’s cultivation base is somewhat different from mine, so his Mysterious strength didn’t seriously injure me, instead it made me wake up. Then I defeated him easily, um, that’s it.”","These words always sounded a lot unreasonable, but Li Shihong and the others couldn’t think of a more reasonable explanation, so they could only accept it.","However, Huang Yueli knew very well that her husband was not telling the truth, so she couldn’t help but secretly glared at him."]},{"number":4219,"title":"Chapter 4219 Could It Really Be God-Level? (5)","paragraphs":["4219 Could It Really Be God-Level? (5)","Seeing this, Li Moying curled his lips slightly, and winked at her, “There are many people here, I will tell you when I get back.”","Li Moying couldn’t help chuckling, and said in the same voice transmission: “As expected, the person who knows me best is my wife. Dark attribute energy should be related to evil qi. Let’s talk about it when there is no one else.”","Huang Yueli pursed her lips and did not speak again.","Although sound transmission is secret, in theory others cannot hear it.","But, after all, in today’s arena, there are too many people with higher cultivation than the two of them.","No one can say for sure, whether someone has mastered some secret technique and can eavesdrop on other people’s sound transmission. This kind of secret technique exists in Soaring Heavens Continent, let alone God Realm.","Although there was no further discussion, Huang Yueli’s thoughts drifted a long way along this point.","Now they already know that the poisonous energy of Floating Sea has the same origin as the evil qi, and it should be evil qi with relatively serious impurities. Now, Li Moying also said that the dark attribute energy is related to evil qi...","I always feel that behind this, there are some secrets waiting for them to discover.","Just as she was thinking, someone called her name suddenly.","“In the fourth match of the third round, Li Yuehuang from the human race faced Jing Shaoyuan from the white tiger race!”","Huang Yueli nodded towards Li Moying, then flew down to the arena below.","Jing Shaoyuan soon appeared on the field.","Seeing the appearance of both sides of the battle, the audience in the stands were all excited.","After entering the quarterfinals, every game is very interesting, and this one is no exception.","One side is the long-established number one genius of the White Tiger Clan, Jing Shaoyuan, a young powerhouse who was once thought to have a chance to compete for the champion of the martial arts championship in the God Realm!","Jing Shaoyuan not only performed well in various God Realm’s Grand Meets, but also, among the younger generation of cultivators, he was the most experienced in the army, and made countless military exploits.","Although he doesn’t have Li Moying’s mid-term record of killing demons, he has been in the army for many years and has very rich actual combat experience. It is definitely more than enough to deal with other heavenly geniuses.","The other side of the competition is the only god-level genius in the God Realm, the fiancee of Young Master Li of the Cloudy Qilin Clan!","The name Li Yuehuang is very unfamiliar to most people. Even before the end of the second round, everyone thought that she was just an idiot who relied on men to get her position.","After she easily defeated Lin Yongfei, the peerless genius of the human race, her strength surfaced in an instant.","Therefore, regarding the outcome of this match, the audience present had their own guesses and opinions.","“You can’t say that? Lin Yongfei is not an ordinary genius. Young Miss Li slapped him away. How strong is that? I don’t think Mr. Shaoyuan has the strength to defeat Lin Yongfei.”","“The scene with Lin Yongfei was obviously due to luck! If her previous behavior was not too confusing, Mr. Lin wouldn’t underestimate the enemy, would he?”"]},{"number":4220,"title":"Chapter 4220 Could It Really Be God-Level? (6)","paragraphs":["4220 Could It Really Be God-Level? (6)","“You’re right, I think so too! Mr. Shaoyuan already knows that Young Miss Li is a master, and he will definitely take it seriously. In this way, it is impossible for Young Miss Li to take advantage of it.”","“That’s right. Both parties should be in the middle stage of the Mind Profound Realm, but Mr. Shaoyuan has rich experience, so there should be no suspense about the outcome.”","The vast majority of cultivators are on Jing Shaoyuan’s side.","This is because they really couldn’t imagine Huang Yueli’s strength, and in the end they could only attribute everything to luck.","But Jing Shaoyuan, who was standing in the center of the arena, had a serious expression on his face.","Because, after Huang Yueli’s last match, he also recognized Huang Yueli’s identity!","He was definitely impressed by this beauty who disgraced him at the celebration banquet of the General’s Mansion!","Of course, in You’an City, Huang Yueli’s real strength was still not as good as Jing Shaoyuan’s.","However, she easily made fun of Jing Shaoyuan’s fiancée Lan Mengqing, and later revealed that she also had the record of killing demons!","Jing Shaoyuan has been on the battlefield for a long time, so he naturally knows how dangerous the demon battlefield is, and the situation will change every moment. No matter how powerful a cultivator is, he dare not say that he is absolutely in a safe state.","It’s not easy to survive, not to mention, this little girl can kill demons with her cultivation at the Yixuan Realm at the time!","No matter what method she used, as long as she did it, it would be very terrifying.","It’s worth his 12 minutes to deal with it mentally.","“Young Miss Li, I didn’t expect that we would meet again. I heard that Young Master Li had another marriage. I thought you guys...hehe, I didn’t expect it to be you!”","Huang Yueli saw that he had guessed her identity and didn’t bother to hide it. She shrugged and said calmly: “After we returned to the Cloudy Qilin Clan, some things happened. In short, being able to see our old friends on the field made me happy.” Very pleasantly surprised.”","Jing Shaoyuan snorted coldly, and said: “Actually, I would rather fight Young Master Li than to fight you, but now it seems that if I don’t beat you, it is impossible to meet Young Master Li. In that case, Young Miss Li, please be careful!”","Although Jing Shaoyuan was very wary of Huang Yueli, he didn’t think at all that Huang Yueli could really defeat him.","After all, the last time Huang Yueli killed Tianmo Ruixuan, she mainly relied on the poison prepared by Xia Yunxi, so her frontal strength was absolutely insufficient.","Even though her cultivation base is advancing by leaps and bounds now, Jing Shaoyuan believes that he has also worked hard recently, and his strength has also improved a lot!","Moreover, since he came to participate in the God Realm’s Grand Meet, he came for Li Moying from the very beginning.","After being humiliated by Li Moying in You’an City last time, he has been trying to win back! I’ve been waiting for this opportunity to fight in the God Realm!","And Huang Yueli... was not in his consideration at all.","Even if Huang Yueli defeated Lin Yongfei, Jing Shaoyuan thought he also had this strength, so he didn’t take it seriously.","Looking at his contemptuous eyes, Huang Yueli understood in her heart, and she couldn’t help but curl her lips.","“Alright, then... let’s get started!”","Jing Shaoyuan nodded, “I’m as famous as your husband, and I’m a martial artist of the same generation. When I see his wife, I can’t bully you, so I’ll let you take the lead!”","Huang Yueli almost laughed angrily.","There is such a thick-skinned person who dares to say that she is a martial artist of the same generation as her husband!","“Then I won’t be polite, let’s see!”"]},{"number":4221,"title":"Chapter 4221 Could It Really Be God-Level? (7)","paragraphs":["4221 Could It Really Be God-Level? (7)","Huang Yueli shot extremely fast.","Jing Shaoyuan said it very grandly, but in fact, he was still somewhat wary of Huang Yueli in his heart.","Therefore, I have long raised my spirits and waited.","However, Jing Shaoyuan never expected that Huang Yueli’s speed could be so fast!","Even though he had made some preparations, at such a lightning-fast speed, nothing could be done at all.","The fierce and overbearing fire attribute energy broke through his defense in an instant!","In an instant, Jing Shaoyuan broke out in a cold sweat, and the hairs all over his body stood on end.","Fortunately, his basic skills are fairly solid, and he reacted in time at the last moment, and pulled back suddenly.","This time, he barely missed the vital part of his chest, but his shoulder was directly pierced by the phantom of the fire sword that Huang Yueli condensed with the fire attribute!","A stream of blood gushed out immediately, and sprinkled on the ground in front of the arena!","The blood on Jing Shaoyuan’s face disappeared in an instant, and he stretched out his hand to cover his shoulder, but he couldn’t stop the bleeding so quickly, and the blood continued to overflow from between his fingers.","His eyes widened, his face full of disbelief, “You...you...”","The fight between the two happened extremely quickly, in the blink of an eye.","The many fighters in the stands didn’t even have time to react.","There are quite a few people who are still talking freely, discussing Jing Shaoyuan’s record, analyzing the reason and probability of his victory.","Unexpectedly, just halfway through the conversation, such a scene happened on the field!","“I’m going! What’s going on? What did I see just now!”","“Blind, I’m really blind! How is this possible? Young Miss Li actually beat Jing Shaoyuan to serious injury just by meeting him?!”","“It seems that Mr. Jing is also underestimating the enemy! He thought the other party was a woman, and he was not famous before, so he took it lightly!”","“Why take it lightly! It’s clearly because you’re not as skilled as others, right? Otherwise, even if you’re not cautious, you can’t just be beaten like this casually?”","After a short period of silence and silence, the stands erupted in an uproar, and everyone was shocked by the scene.","Li Yuntao couldn’t help laughing and said, “Tsk tsk, look at Jing Shaoyuan’s shocked expression! Look how frightened he is! As I said a long time ago, our Cloudy Qilin Clan has two god-level geniuses. Everyone thought we were lying! Alas! These days, no one will believe the truth!”","“Hahaha, good! That’s great! Young Miss Li’s attack, who else can doubt her strength? Let these cultivators see how strong our Cloudy Qilin Clan is!” Li Shihong laughed even more. I couldn’t keep my mouth shut.","Li Yunhai said: “However, these fighters still don’t seem to believe that Young Miss Li is a god-level talent?”","“What does it matter if you don’t believe it now? After a few more games, you have to believe it if you don’t believe it! The strength is here, and you can’t deny it!”","Li Shihong turned to Li Moying, “Moying, you really found a good wife!”"]},{"number":4222,"title":"Chapter 4222 Could It Really Be God-Level? (8)","paragraphs":["4222 Could It Really Be God-Level? (8)","When Li Shihong looked at Huang Yueli, he became more and more satisfied day by day.","As long as he thinks that the Cloudy Qilin Clan has two god-level geniuses now, and that their babies will probably be god-level in the future, he will wake up laughing at night from his dreams.","Li Moying looked at the overjoyed expression on Li Shihong’s face, and couldn’t help but secretly sighed inwardly.","It is estimated that soon, everyone in the Cloudy Qilin Clan will stop laughing.","Although I feel sorry for the family members, there are some things that must be done.","He and Huang Yueli have made a lot of preparations for today, and he can imagine how chaotic the scene will be and what kind of frenzy will be set off when the truth is revealed.","Jing Shaoyuan covered his wound and stood there blankly, unable to recover for a long time.","Seeing that he was not moving, Huang Yueli couldn’t help but frowned, and urged: “What are you still doing? If you want to fight, hurry up. If you don’t fight, just admit defeat! Don’t waste everyone’s time.”","Hearing this, Jing Shaoyuan’s brows twitched, and a look of humiliation appeared on his face.","He never dreamed that he would be defeated by a girl who looked so delicate in front of him with one move, and even suffered such serious injuries!","Words can’t even describe the feeling he felt the moment he saw Huang Yueli make a move.","quick! too fast!","Isn’t this girl a human race?","Human cultivators have poor physical talent, how could they be so fast?","Hearing the buzzing discussions in the stands and sensing the strange gazes of the audience, Jing Shaoyuan thought of the big words he had just said, and wished he could find a hole in the ground and go down there!","He also said that he would let others do a trick, but in the end...","This move almost killed him!","Jing Shaoyuan forced himself to calm down, gritted his teeth and said, “I...Of course I can’t admit defeat! Let’s continue the competition!”","According to the competition rules of the God Realm’s Grand Meet Finals, only those who are knocked out of the competition area, or who take the initiative to admit defeat, can be regarded as a real loser and will be eliminated.","Otherwise, even if his whole body is bruised and his seven orifices are bleeding, as long as the contestant is still conscious and refuses to admit defeat, he still has the qualifications to stand up and continue fighting.","“Then come on!” Huang Yueli shrugged, completely indifferent.","Jing Shaoyuan gritted his teeth, mustered all his strength, and made another move.","Intense metallic profound energy rushed towards him frantically, and behind him, a phantom of a white tiger was formed!","Moreover, this white tiger is different from ordinary tigers. In addition to its white body, it also has a pair of large wings with a wingspan of more than 20 meters on its back.","With the appearance of wings, Jing Shaoyuan’s body also rose into the air.","The cultivators in the stands couldn’t help but gasp in amazement.","“Such a clear phantom of the white tiger! It’s not much different from the real one! Mr. Shaoyuan can actually cultivate the phantom of the white tiger to such a level!”","“I’m also a cultivator of metal nature. The moment Mr. Shao Yuan shot, I felt that the profound energy in my body was about to be taken away by him! His energy-gathering skills must be very extraordinary!”","“It’s amazing! You really deserve to be the number one master of the White Tiger Clan!”","“Now, Young Miss Li is probably going to be miserable. Oh, such a beautiful girl, don’t be beaten too badly!”","Seeing Jing Shaoyuan’s power, the onlookers who thought Huang Yueli might win changed their minds and supported Jing Shaoyuan.","However, Jing Shaoyuan, who was present in the field, was suffering at this time."]},{"number":4223,"title":"Chapter 4223 Could It Really Be God-Level? (9)","paragraphs":["4223 Could It Really Be God-Level? (9)","Chapter 4223 Is it really god level? (9)","Once used, more than 90% of the profound energy in the body will be consumed!","So, after running out, it means that it is almost impossible for him to win the next few games.","Jing Shaoyuan originally planned to hold back his big move and wait until the finals or when he met Li Moying to use it, so that he could catch the unexpected and seal the victory.","How would you know, now that he has neither entered the finals nor met Li Moying, he used this trick in front of a delicate little beauty!","Even if they win, there is no glory, and they will stop at the semi-finals.","But if he didn’t use it, he didn’t have much confidence in defeating Huang Yueli.","In a dilemma, he could only choose to win this match first.","Jing Shaoyuan was condescending and swooped down from mid-air!","As he fell, the phantom of the white tiger transformed into metallic energy let out a roar towards the sky, raised its strong claws, and swooped down on Huang Yueli’s head.","“I’ll go, what a powerful force!”","“Miss Li, run away! The metal is so strong that it can’t be blocked!”","“It’s over, it’s over, I can’t bear to watch anymore!”","“If someone is really killed, Mr. Jing will be disqualified from the competition even if he commits a foul. Isn’t it worth it?”","Amid the bursts of exclamation, the expression on Huang Yueli’s face did not change. Even when she saw the mighty giant flying white tiger, she didn’t blink a second.","Seeing that the white tiger had already rushed in front of her, Huang Yueli swayed, stepped forward, and jumped up!","Her body seemed to be extremely light. With a light jump, she flew into the air, and even passed directly by Jing Shaoyuan’s side, and came directly behind him.","When Jing Shaoyuan saw this scene, his expression changed in horror and he turned around hastily.","Just in time to see a fire dragon rolling towards his head!","Jing Shaoyuan stretched out his hand to block it, but was shocked and flew backwards!","He quickly stabilized his body and drove the white tiger shadow to rush towards Huang Yueli!","However, Huang Yueli only raised his eyebrows slightly, and the fire attribute energy around him suddenly surged!","Although the metal attribute is famous for its powerful attack power, the fire attribute is not far behind.","Both types of energy were mainly used for attack. They suddenly collided together, causing a deafening violent explosion!","When the energy collided, the force shot out was too much for many weaker warriors to bear, and they covered their chests with pale faces.","After the strong light receded, a figure staggered down from the air like a kite with its string broken.","The spectators in the stands stood up excitedly and looked down.","“...It’s Young Master Shao Yuan! It was Young Master Shao Yuan who fell!!”","“What? How could this happen? His offensive was so powerful just now, but he was defeated head-on like this...?”","“Strong attack against strong attack, the only one who can completely suppress Mr. Shao Yuan is the Thunder attribute young master Li! Miss Li was able to confront him and win!”","“Oh my God, my God, it’s terrible!”","Everyone was feeling chills behind their backs as they recalled the scene just now."]},{"number":4224,"title":"Chapter 4224 Could It Really Be God-Level? (10)","paragraphs":["4224 Could It Really Be God-Level? (10)","If they were the ones who were attacked by Jing Shaoyuan just now, they would have been cut into pieces by now.","Most importantly, he directly defeated Jing Shaoyuan!","“That’s right! Where’s Young Miss Li? Why didn’t I see anyone?!”","Everyone suddenly became nervous again.","The explosion just now was so violent, it didn’t seem like a contest between the martial artists of the Mind Profound Realm, it made people tremble with fear.","Could it be that although Young Miss Li severely injured Jing Shaoyuan, something happened to herself too...?","However, such a guess was quickly proven to be unreasonable.","Huang Yueli’s figure gradually emerged from the smoke, she leaped down from mid-air lightly, and landed at Jing Shaoyuan’s feet.","Jing Shaoyuan failed to attack her. At this time, there was nothing good about his whole body. There were wounds all over his body, and blood flowed non-stop.","However, the most serious injury to him was not his body, but his mind.","When he came to participate in the God Realm’s Grand Meet, he always aimed at Li Moying himself. He made so many preparations, and even practiced such a powerful nirvana, all in order to face Li Moying.","But now?","Before he even met Li Moying’s people, he was defeated by Li Moying’s woman!","Still, he was defeated head-on by the opponent when he used all his unique moves!","Even the powerful attack he was most proud of was no match for that little beauty’s attack, and was directly defeated by her strong attack!","How did that happen?","Huang Yueli didn’t bother to care what he was thinking.","She came here today to target Huang Sanbai and the Sacred Phoenix Clan. She didn’t intend to hate the other protoss cultivators so much.","But who made Jing Shaoyuan ignorant? First of all, with an arrogant look, how dare you look down on her husband!","Later, he used such a fierce and vicious ultimate move!","To put it bluntly, Jing Shaoyuan just wanted to kill her out of embarrassment.","However, Jing Shaoyuan is also very fateful. He seems to be wearing some very precious treasure, and his defense is astonishingly strong.","Even in the violent explosion just now, he managed to protect his heart veins, leaving him with a sigh of relief.","Now Jing Shaoyuan’s people have all fallen in the middle of the arena, under the watchful eyes of everyone, Huang Yueli can’t do anything to him.","She curled her lips, walked to Jing Shaoyuan, and said, “Master Shaoyuan, you are still on the field. According to the rules of the competition, you have not been eliminated. Do you admit defeat?”","Hearing this, Jing Shaoyuan’s blood boiled for a while, and he vomited several mouthfuls of blood on the spot.","If he could make a sound, he must have yelled and surrendered at this time!","After all, although winning or losing a game is important, it is not as important as his life!","If the fight continues now, it is obvious that Huang Yueli can kill him with just a casual wave of his hand.","He only continued to fight when he had a brain twitch.","But the problem is, the meridians in his chest are all shattered, and he can’t even make a sound when he wants to speak!","This woman is still asking such obvious questions from the sidelines!","This is... Could it be that he was deliberately trying to kill him?"]},{"number":4225,"title":"Chapter 4225 Could It Really Be God-Level? (11)","paragraphs":["4225 Could It Really Be God-Level? (11)","Huang Yueli glanced at him and muttered to herself, “If you don’t admit defeat, then I will...”","Jing Shaoyuan’s hairs all stood on end, terrified.","At this moment, a sharp voice suddenly came from midair.","“Young Miss Li, stop! Are you speechless without seeing Shao Yuan? What else do you want to do to him?”","Hearing the sound, Huang Yueli frowned slightly. When she looked up, she found that Jing Huabin, the Patriarch of the White Tiger Clan, couldn’t sit still anymore. He stood up suddenly and glared at her condescendingly.","There was no panic on Huang Yueli’s face, and she said slowly: “But, according to the rules of the competition...”","“What rules of the game? Isn’t it just admitting defeat? I admit defeat on behalf of Shao Yuan! I am his elder, so it should be alright, right?”","Jing Huabin saw that Huang Yueli would not enter, so he could only turn to the referee sitting beside him.","The referee hesitated for a moment.","It was originally against the rules to do so, but in the current situation, there seems to be no other way...","Fortunately, the Right Protector said in time: “Forget it, this match will be considered as Jing Shaoyuan’s loss, and the match is over.”","The Right Protector has already spoken, if Huang Yueli tries to force her to do so, it will be her fault.","She shrugged and stepped aside.","Anyway, she is not a bloodthirsty person, and she has no intention of killing Jing Shaoyuan. Being able to make him lose such a big person in front of everyone has already taught him a lesson that he will never forget, and he has achieved his goal.","From the private seat of the White Tiger Clan, several cultivators jumped out, lifted Jing Shaoyuan who had fallen to the ground like a puddle of mud, and left the arena in despair.","There was a silence in the stands.","It wasn’t until Jing Shaoyuan was rescued by members of the White Tiger Clan that the audience came back to their senses.","The scene just now was really shocking!","No one thought that a heaven-level genius like Jing Shaoyuan, who had just entered the late stage of the Mind Profound Realm, would be able to explode with such a powerful strength!","However, what is even more unexpected is that Jing Shaoyuan is so strong that there is still someone who can defeat him!","Just by raising his hand, he defeated Jing Shaoyuan head-on and seriously injured him to such an extent!","As for Huang Yueli herself, although she didn’t know the extent of her injury, at least on the surface, she was still very calm and could move freely, so she definitely didn’t suffer any serious fatal injuries.","This kind of strength comparison is really astonishing!","The cultivators present thought about it carefully, and they couldn’t help feeling chills behind their backs.","Because, many people suddenly realized what the strength of Huang Yueli meant!","“Oh my god, wasn’t I really dreaming just now? Young Miss Li actually defeated Mr. Shaoyuan. How is this possible?”","“Mr. Shaoyuan’s strength has far surpassed that of ordinary heaven-level geniuses. It can be said that he is the strongest heaven-level genius I have seen since the beginning of the God Realm’s Grand Meet. However, Young Miss Li still defeated him, and it seemed that she was not affected. What kind of injury. Could it be that she is actually...”","“What is it? I can be sure that Young Miss Li is also a god-level genius!”","“Ahem, this...how is this possible? Didn’t you say that only one god-level genius emerges in tens of thousands of years? How could two appear at the same time?”","“It’s not impossible, is it? It’s not like the two god-level geniuses of the same generation have never appeared in history? Besides, do you still remember the rumours on the day when you signed up for the God Realm’s Grand Meet?”"]},{"number":4226,"title":"Chapter 4226 Could It Really Be God-Level? (12)","paragraphs":["\"On the day of registration...? By the way, it is said that Young Miss Li and Young Master Li went to the registration site to register, and they both filled in that they were god-level talents. The manager at the registration site didn't believe it at all. It's all ruined!\"","\"That's right, it seems to be true! However, at the time, everyone thought that Young Master Li loved his wife too much, so he allowed her to lie and wanted to protect her face. Thinking about it now, is it true?\"","\"Damn, if this is true, it would be too scary! I feel like a fool! And on the last day of the match, Young Master Li carried his wife to the stage and asked her to beat him to advance. How many people said that he Bewildered by womanizing? Now think about it, that Young Miss Li is a god-level talent, so what's wrong with being too lazy to fight with these trash?\"","\"No wonder, no matter what bad things we say about Young Miss Li, the people of the Cloudy Qilin Clan will firmly defend her. I said, Li Shihong and the others are not stupid, how could they accept such a young lady! Look now, the Cloudy Qilin Clan is too shrewd ! Without making a fuss, you have surrounded the two god-level geniuses in your own clan!\"","Up to now, the facts are in front of my eyes.","All knowledgeable cultivators have to admit that Huang Yueli should really be a god-level genius.","None of the things she said before were exaggerated, they were all true!","And these mortals, the reason why they think it's impossible is because they are too weak!","Waste materials limit their imagination!","After figuring this out, looking back at the storm that Huang Yueli and Li Moying created in the Floating Sea, everyone was amazed!","I finally understand that whether it is Li Moying, Huang Yueli, or the Cloudy Qilin Clan, they are all winners, but they, the people who think they are smart, are all stupid!","The scene was very chaotic, and the competition stopped for a while.","Because even the referee was stunned by this accident, unable to recover, naturally forgot about the next game.","At this moment, the most proud people are not Li Moying and Huang Yueli.","The two of them have long been used to being amazed and admired by others. Today's situation is also expected, but they don't feel much.","The most excited ones are actually the members of the Cloudy Qilin Clan.","Especially Li Shihong and the elders, don't mention how proud they are now.","A group of elders surrounded Li Shihong, all kinds of compliments.","\"Patriarch, you are so wise! If you hadn't managed to keep Young Miss Li, how could our Cloudy Qilin Clan be where we are today?\"","\"Haha, those guys without eyes actually scolded Young Miss Li before, they are so stupid!\"","\"Congratulations to the Patriarch. Now that Young Miss Li's identity has been revealed to the world, after this God Realm's Grand Meet is over, she should be able to organize a wedding with Young Master, right?\"","\"Isn't it? You have to hurry up! Even if you don't get married right away, at least you have to make a formal engagement!\"","Several people discussed excitedly, and their joy was beyond words.","Li Shihong was proud of himself, but he also retained a bit of reason, realizing that something was wrong.","\"Just now... When Young Miss Li fought Jing Shaoyuan, she seemed to be using a mysterious skill of the fire attribute? But, isn't she a cultivator of the wood attribute? How could this be?\"","Last time he was instigated by a traitor, thinking that Young Miss Li was a spy of the Sacred Phoenix Clan, and even went to spy on her practicing."]},{"number":4227,"title":"Chapter 4227 Who Is The Real Traitor? (1)","paragraphs":["In order to be able to confirm her attributes, Li Shihong had a brain twitch for a moment, and secretly did something embarrassing.","In the end, the two god-level geniuses almost ran away from home.","This incident left a deep psychological shadow on Li Shihong, which is still fresh in his memory.","At that time, he was very sure that Young Miss Li majored in the wood attribute, and those who reached the god-level talent were also wood attributes.","But now, she unexpectedly exploded with fire attribute talent!","It is true that Young Miss Li is a Spirit Medicine Master, and it is very normal to cultivate both fire and wood, so it is not worth being surprised.","However, her fire attribute strength is a bit too strong, right?","Being able to use fire attribute profound skills to attack Jing Shaoyuan and defeat the attack of metal cultivators head-on, this must be a god-level talent!","Young Miss Li's fire attribute is also god-level? !","If this is the case, wouldn't the words that the steward said that day become true?","But why before this, she never saw Young Miss Li fight with fire-attributed black power?","However, at such an exciting moment, it was naturally impossible for Li Shihong to think deeply.","These thoughts just flashed through his mind, and he secretly decided to find an opportunity to ask Li Moying, then put this question aside, and excitedly discussed it with several elders.","Li Moying sighed secretly, and returned her gaze to the arena.","The third round of competition is over.","However, his Little Li'er had no intention of returning to the private seat.","He is the one who knows Huang Yueli's next plan best, and he also knows what earth-shattering things will happen today.","So, even though he trusted the strength of his family's Little Li'er very much, at this moment, he couldn't help feeling a little more nervous. He didn't even dare to blink, and looked at Huang Yueli with all his body on guard.","Always ready to help her in case of accidents.","Even though he knew that his Little Li'er probably didn't need it, as her husband, he really couldn't rest assured.","On the field, finally, the quietness gradually returned.","Seeing Huang Yueli still standing on the field, the referee cleared his throat, and said cautiously, \"Ahem, Young Miss Li, your match is over, the next match is Young Master Li vs...\"","\"Don't be so troublesome, isn't there only two games in the fourth round?\"","Huang Yueli interrupted the referee, \"Since I'm already on the field, it would be too troublesome to go back, so let's compete against me first! My opponent should be Huang Beicheng from the Sacred Phoenix Clan, right?\"","The referee was stunned for a moment, \"Uh, yes, that's right, it is indeed Huang Beicheng. But... ahem, the order of the competition is also arranged in advance, so there is no need to change it? You have just experienced such a big battle, take a break Wouldn't it be better to go on to the next game?\"","Huang Yueli said: \"There is no need to rest, I think the current state is just right.\"","The referee didn't know how to persuade her for a while.","It's not a big deal for the two games to be reversed. However, he has never encountered it before. Someone would make such a request.","Seeing that he was silent, Huang Yueli simply walked to the center of the arena, raised her head in the direction of the Sacred Phoenix Clan's seat, and said, \"Huang Sanbai, have you come today? How is it? How do you feel when you see me? Or What the hell are you planning again? Has the genius of the Sacred Phoenix Clan arrived? If he arrives, don't waste time and let him come down to compete!\""]},{"number":4228,"title":"Chapter 4228 Who Is The Real Traitor? (2)","paragraphs":["Hearing Huang Yueli's words, all the cultivators present turned their heads in unison, and looked towards the private seat of the Sacred Phoenix Clan.","Huang Yueli would challenge the Sacred Phoenix Clan, and none of the cultivators present were surprised.","In their view, as Li Moying's fiancée, Huang Yueli is already equivalent to a member of the Cloudy Qilin Clan.","Given the relationship between the Cloudy Qilin Clan and the Sacred Phoenix Clan, it is quite normal for the god-level geniuses of the Cloudy Qilin Clan to despise the cultivators of the Sacred Phoenix Clan.","When the cultivators of the Sacred Phoenix Clan heard this, they were filled with righteous indignation, wishing they could jump down to fight in person.","\"Damn it, what are you? Even if you are a god-level genius? Are we still afraid of you?\"","\"That's right, we're still pretending to be provocative! Even if we lose, we, the Sacred Phoenix Clan, won't be timid!\"","\"Master Beicheng, hurry down and show her some color!\"","Huang Beicheng nodded solemnly, and was about to end.","In fact, he had already fought against Huang Yueli in the preliminary round, and he lost at that time!","However, at that time, he didn't have too many entanglements, he didn't think that he was really worse than Huang Yueli, because at that time he was attacked by Li Zijun and others and got injured, he always felt that Huang Yueli was lucky, will win him.","It wasn't until now that he realized that he had once fought against a god-level genius!","It is quite normal for Huang Yueli to defeat her.","Of course, in today's situation, he would still lose 90% of the time. Fortunately, he has the skills to stimulate potential given to him by Elder Sanbai...","If you're lucky, you might be able to beat that Young Miss Li by surprise.","Defeating a god-level genius... that is definitely a remarkable achievement.","You can even slap the Cloudy Qilin Clan in the face severely, extinguishing their arrogance!","Just as Huang Beicheng got up, Huang Sanbai suddenly grabbed him.","\"Wait, Beicheng, I have something to tell you.\"","Huangbeicheng was stunned, \"Elder Sanbai, what's the matter with you? Let's talk about it after the match is over? Now is the critical moment, and that Young Miss Li is shouting from below. If I hurry up to fight, our Sacred Phoenix Clan will lose face.\" It's gone!\"","Huang Sanbai insisted on pulling him, walked to the corner, and then lowered his voice and said: \"I have to tell you a secret. That is... that Young Miss Li on the field, she is actually not someone else, but our Sacred Phoenix Clan The god-level genius Huang Yueli!\"","\"Huang Yueli?\"","Huang Beicheng didn't react for a while. After repeating the name, he was startled and almost screamed, \"Elder Sanbai, what did you say?! Who do you say she is?!\"","\"Hush!\" Huang Sanbai sealed the surroundings with profound strength, preventing the sound from coming out.","At the same time, he glared at Huang Beicheng, \"Calm down!\"","Huang Beicheng then lowered his voice, but his eyes were still full of shock and confusion, \"How can this make me calm? Elder Sanbai, are you making a mistake? Hasn't Huang Yueli already been given by Li Moying?\" Was she killed? Why is she still alive? Even if she escaped by chance, how could she be in the Cloudy Qilin Clan?\"","Huang Sanbai had already thought up his speech, and at this time he avoided the seriousness and said lightly: \"Oh, this is all a scandal of our Sacred Phoenix Clan, and I only found out a few days ago! It turns out that Huang Yueli is not only not dead, but has become a The traitor of the family has joined the Cloudy Qilin Clan. By the way, have you noticed that the Patriarch has been missing for several days?\""]},{"number":4229,"title":"Chapter 4229 Who Is The Real Traitor? (3)","paragraphs":["Hearing this, Huang Beicheng was stunned for a moment.","Of course he noticed that the Patriarch was missing, not only him, most of the clan must have noticed this.","However, even Huang Sanbai kept acting as if nothing had happened, so the others didn't worry much at all.","After all, Huang Sanbai is the most respected elder in the clan. If the clan leader is not around, he is the backbone of everyone.","Since he behaved so naturally, it means that the Patriarch must have left for some urgent business, and there is nothing serious about it.","Now, hearing Huang Sanbai say such words, Huang Beicheng was puzzled.","\"Elder Sanbai, what... do you mean? The Patriarch is missing, is it related to... is it related to the Cloudy Qilin Clan?\"","Huang Sanbai's face was full of anger, \"Yes, this matter is of course related to the Cloudy Qilin Clan, to be precise, it is related to Huang Yueli!\"","\"What?! How could this happen?\"","Huang Beicheng thought of something in his mind, couldn't help shivering, and looked at Huang Sanbai in disbelief.","Huang Sanbai said quickly: \"Now that the matter has come to an end, I can't hide this matter from you. A few days ago, the Patriarch secretly talked to me and told me that he found Huang Yueli, the missing god-level genius of our Sacred Phoenix Clan! It's just that Huang Yueli seems to have something in the hands of the Cloudy Qilin Clan and cannot leave, so I asked him to go to a secret place to talk.\"","\"I felt something was wrong at the time. How can a majestic genius fall into the hands of others? Moreover, it is obviously abnormal to ask our Patriarch to go out to a secret meeting as soon as he opens his mouth? This is too dangerous! If this is Cloudy Qilin Clan The trap set by the clan, isn't it the end of the Patriarch?\"","After Huangbeicheng listened, he also became anxious.","\"Isn't it? What is the Patriarch thinking? Did he really go?\"","Huang Sanbai nodded, \"That's right, the Patriarch refused to listen to my dissuasion, and went his own way. In fact, I still understand him very well. After all, Li Moying put too much pressure on our entire family. We There is an urgent need for a god-level genius to sit in the town. The news of Huang Yueli is too important to our Sacred Phoenix Clan! So, even though he knew it was risky, he still went and told me that if he did not come back, he must host Good clan affairs.\"","Having said that, he listened for a while, and the expression on his face became more serious.","The more Huangbeicheng heard it, the more flustered he became, and he couldn't help but ask: \"What happened next? Elder Sanbai, what happened afterwards? The Patriarch didn't even appear in the finals of the God Realm's Grand Meet, so something really happened, right?!\"","Huang Sanbai sighed heavily, \"I'm not sure yet, but he hasn't shown up for so long, it must be a bad luck. Even if he didn't die, he was caught in the trap of the Cloudy Qilin Clan! Moreover, this matter is definitely related to that Huang It's related to Yueli! She betrayed the family! Not only did she help Li Moying deal with the geniuses in our clan, but now, she actually murdered the Patriarch! She is really vicious and vicious!\"","After hearing this, Huang Beicheng couldn't help but gasped.","There was a burst of panic and anger in my heart!","\"How could this happen? How could there be such a vicious woman in the world! Even if she didn't grow up in the clan, she still has the blood of the Sacred Phoenix Clan in her body! How could she betray the clan and do such a thing?\" ? What the hell is she thinking!\"","Huang Sanbai sighed."]},{"number":4230,"title":"Chapter 4230 Who Is The Real Traitor? (4)","paragraphs":["\"The old man couldn't figure it out at first, but later, after contacting the various rumors in Floating Sea, I roughly guessed it. As the saying goes, girls are not allowed to stay. Young girls are dazzled by emotions. It's not surprising to do anything!\"","\"I have to admit that the Young Master Li of the Cloudy Qilin Clan is indeed extremely talented, and he is also handsome and has an extraordinary bearing. It is not a miracle for any woman to fall in love with him. Huang Yueli is only twenty years old. Not until she fell in love with Young Master Li at first sight, and was coaxed by his sweet words, would she betray the family.\"","What he said was actually all speculation without any evidence.","However, there are too many rumors circulating in Floating Sea during this period.","It's all about how loving Li Moying and his fiancée really are.","Even today, Huang Yueli and Li Moying showed their affection in front of everyone.","Anyone with eyes can tell how good the relationship between the two of them is.","So, after Huang Beicheng thought about it, he easily accepted Huang Sanbai's words, and felt that what he saw was believing, and he did not wrong the other party at all.","\"Damn it, women are too superficial, even if they are god-level talents, they betrayed their own family for a man?! I don't understand, what good is it for her to stay in the Cloudy Qilin Clan? Go back to the Sacred Phoenix Clan Come on, she can also get all the resources of the family, and be cultivated by the Patriarch! Isn't it much better than looking at a man's face?\"","Huang Sanbai smiled wryly and said: \"Then how do I know? Young Master Li must have some means to keep her. We have sent so many people and searched for her for so long, if Huang Yueli really wanted to come back, it would be easy She can return to the family, but she has concealed her identity until now, which has already shown her determination, she has no intention of repentance at all, and she only wants to listen to that man's command!\"","What Huang Sanbai said was extremely ingenious.","Obviously, he set up a net to hunt Huang Yueli everywhere to prevent her from returning to the family.","However, he first pinned the matter of Huang Tianhao's disappearance on Huang Yueli, and poured a large basin of dirty water on her, and then he told the matter of Huang Yueli and Li Moying.","With these two things as the foreshadowing, the reason why Huang Yueli has not returned to the family can be successfully attributed to her relationship with Li Moying, completely cleansing himself, and eliminating the last trace of Huang Beicheng. doubt.","Huang Beicheng was so angry that he slapped the table and stood up, \"Damn it! I'll go down now and expose her true colors! Why does this kind of woman show off her might in front of cultivators from the God Realm? There are still so many people chasing her!\"","\"Wait! Oh, why are you so impulsive? Can you calm down?\"","Huang Sanbai hastily pulled him back.","\"You have to figure it out, what's the benefit of us exposing Huang Yueli's identity now? She can also get the protection of the Cloudy Qilin Clan, without any loss at all! The Cloudy Qilin Clan must be even more proud, their tails are going to the sky! Even if it is Ordinary cultivators from the God Realm would only laugh at our Sacred Phoenix Clan's incompetence, and they couldn't even keep god-level geniuses, so they were taken advantage of by the Cloudy Qilin Clan!\"","\"Exposing her now, besides making our Sacred Phoenix Clan the laughing stock of the entire God Realm, what good will it do?\"","Huang Beicheng was startled, but after thinking about it, he had to admit that what Huang Sanbai said was quite right."]},{"number":4231,"title":"Chapter 4231 Who Is The Real Traitor? (5)","paragraphs":["He barely suppressed his anger, stopped, and turned to look at Huang Sanbai.","\"Elder Sanbai, what should we do then? Are we just going to swallow this breath like this?! Isn't that too aggrieved? I can't help it even if I am beaten to death! Besides, the whereabouts of the Patriarch is unknown. Whether or not he is alive is also unknown. Only by falling on Huang Yueli can we find him!\"","Huang Sanbai said repeatedly: \"How can I not know these things? So, we must pay attention to strategy!\"","Huang Beicheng hurriedly asked: \"What strategy? What should we do now? I have to seek Elder Sanbai for advice.\"","Huang Sanbai had laid the groundwork so much before, and what he was waiting for was his words.","Seeing that Huang Beicheng had completely fallen into his trap, a smug look flashed across his eyes, he coughed twice, and then spoke slowly.","\"Ahem, let's face it, whether it's difficult or not, it's all going to fall on you.\"","Huang Beicheng was stunned, \"On me? This... How can this junior have such a strong ability?\"","\"Let's put it this way, right now, the only chance for our Sacred Phoenix Clan gain some pride is in your hands. Wait for you to end, first defeat Huang Yueli, and then announce her identity. In this way, our Sacred Phoenix Clan will regain our dignity. Because you have proved with your strength that you are stronger than a god-level genius! Our Clan is not obsessed with flattering god-level geniuses, but disdain such indiscriminate tricks that only pick up what we don't want.\"","\"Of course, if you are stronger and can kill Huang Yueli in one fell swoop after proclaiming her crime, it will be even better!\"","\"We should let all cultivators of the God Clan see how powerful and united our Sacred Phoenix Clan is! Even a god-level genius, as long as one betrays the Clan, we will definitely execute that person according to the clan rules!\"","Huang Sanbai's words were sonorous and forceful.","Huang Beicheng seemed a little hesitant, \"Do I... really kill Huang Yueli? She is a god-level genius! Besides, how could I defeat a god-level genius?\"","Huang Sanbai snorted, and patted him on the shoulder encouragingly.","\"You don't have the heart to kill her? I know, you are a pity, but think about it, how innocent the Patriarch was killed by her! Our Sacred Phoenix Clan is about to be destroyed by her hands!\"","\"Besides, don't underestimate yourself. Don't forget that you have already learned the set of exercises I taught you to stimulate your potential. With your current strength, when you stimulate your potential three times, you will be able to reach the cultivation level in the middle stage of the Dao Profound Realm. Wouldn't that be easy to kill her?\"","Seeing that Huang Beicheng was silent, Huang Sanbai added another sentence.","\"If you can kill the Clan traitor, you will become the greatest hero of our Sacred Phoenix Clan! Besides you, is there another candidate for the position of our Clan's Young Master? What if the Patriarch has encountered a disaster, then you will directly become the Patriarch!\"","Hearing such words, no one can not be moved.","Anticipation inevitably welled up in Huang Beicheng's heart, and his blood boiled with enthusiasm.","That's right, he worked hard to cultivate, not just for today's occasion.","Under the eyes of everyone, defeat a powerful opponent and win honour for the whole Clan!","If he could do it, everyone in the clan would follow him.","Such an opportunity was usually impossible to appear.","He must seize the opportunity!"]},{"number":4232,"title":"Chapter 4232 Who Is The Real Traitor? (6)","paragraphs":["\"Sacred Phoenix Clan's Huang Beicheng, the match between you and Human Clan's Li Yuehuang is about to start. This is the third reminder.\"","\"If you don't appear within ten seconds, you will be judged to have surrendered in this match.\"","\"The countdown begins: ten, nine, eight...\"","Because Huang Beicheng and Huang Sanbai spent a lot of time talking, the referee had urged him several times on the field, and gradually became impatient.","The audience in the stands were also discussing, guessing the reason why Huang Beicheng refused to leave.","\"It's not necessarily true. Is it because you are scared when you see a god-level genius? Is this going to admit defeat? But, it's too ugly to admit defeat without even being able to compare?\"","\"That's right! Didn't the cultivators who met Young Master Li before have all gone up to compete? I think it's an honour to lose! God-level geniuses don't bother to hurt people intentionally. In fact, it doesn't matter if you compete, right?\"","\"Hey, other people have no problem competing with god-level geniuses, but the Sacred Phoenix Clan is different! They are sworn enemies with the Cloudy Qilin Clan, and maybe the god-level geniuses of the Cloudy Qilin Clan took advantage of the opportunity of the competition to kill them. Then they have no place to cry!\"","\"Because they are mortal enemies, they can't avoid fighting, right? Otherwise, the Sacred Phoenix Clan will lose all face!\"","\"...Three, two, one...\"","The referee counted down to the last breath, and Huang Beicheng suddenly jumped down from midair.","The audience at the scene immediately became excited and let out an exclamation.","Huang Beicheng stood opposite Huang Yueli, his expression was full of resentment, his eyes were full of bloodshot eyes, he stared at her viciously, looking extremely ferocious.","Huang Yueli was a little surprised and raised her eyebrows.","\"Tsk tsk, why do you look so bitter?\"","Although she did hurt Huang Beicheng's self-esteem during the first round, but for the sake of being her fellow clansman, she didn't beat him to death, did she?","As for this?","At this moment, Huang Beicheng said suddenly, \"I already know all the things you did! Don't think that you are a god-level genius and do such shameless things without paying the price! Today, I will let everyone see the strength and dignity of our Sacred Phoenix Clan!\"","Huang Yueli was confused, \"What are you talking about?\"","Could it be that Huang Sanbai was playing tricks again?","A thought flashed through Huang Yue's heart.","However, Huang Beicheng didn't intend to talk too much to her, the aura on his body suddenly rose, and the strong fire attribute energy rushed towards his body!","Behind him, a huge manifestation of a Phoenix gradually formed.","There was another exclamation from the stands.","Being able to use energy to condense into phantoms of ancient divine beasts to fight was a talent unique to all the Ancient God Clans.","Looking at the lifelikeness of the Phoenix behind Huang Beicheng, it was no worse than Jing Shaoyuan's white tiger just now!","\"This is amazing. With this move alone, Huang Beicheng's strength seems to be stronger than Jing Shaoyuan's!\"","\"Isn't it? But, he just wanted to defeat Young Miss Li with just this one hand, isn't he a little too naive? Young Miss Li just defeated Jing Shaoyuan head-on, which shows that there is a huge gap in strength between the two! Jing Shaoyuan's strength is limited, after all, isn't he going to lose?\"","\"Maybe they just want to show off before losing... Wait, something's wrong, look at that Phoenix Phantom!\"","Everyone looked in the direction of Huang Beicheng and gasped."]},{"number":4233,"title":"Chapter 4233 Who Is The Real Traitor? (7)","paragraphs":["In this short moment when everyone was discussing, the manifestation of the Phoenix behind Huang Beicheng unexpectedly rose again.","Moreover, the surrounding fire energy fluctuations had also intensified.","The fiery air radiated from the centre of the arena and spread towards the stands, making the audience a little overwhelmed.","After this, the energy condensed by this Phoenix has clearly surpassed Jing Shaoyuan's manifestation of the white tiger!","\"Oh my god, it's amazing!\"","\"I've heard people say that Huang Beicheng is also in the mid-stage of the Heart Profound Realm, but judging from this posture, at least it can be achieved by cultivators in the late stage of the Heart Profound Realm! Could it be that he has advanced again recently?!\"","\"Now, it depends on how Young Miss Li responds. This suspense is so thrilling!\"","The surrounding discussions did not have any impact on Huang Beicheng.","At this moment, because he had just listened to Huang Sanbai's provocation, his inner anger had reached its peak.","Therefore, his only goal was to quickly kill Huang Yueli, the traitor, and show off for the Clan!","Huang Beicheng knew very well in his heart that he was at the middle stage of the Heart Profound Realm, and Huang Yueli was also at the middle stage of the Heart Profound Realm.","With the same cultivation base, it was obviously impossible for him to defeat a god-level genius.","Therefore, he didn't hesitate at all, and directly performed the set of exercises that Huang Sanbai taught him as soon as he came up, and completed the first potential stimulation.","In this way, his cultivation has been directly advanced from the middle stage of the Heart Profound Realm to the late stage of the Heart Profound Realm.","At the same time, he unreservedly used his most powerful profound technique.","With the combination of the two, once he made a move, it was indeed so powerful that the entire sky seemed to be melted by his flames!","Huang Beicheng's eyes were full of crimson bloodshot eyes, and he stared at Huang Yueli coldly.","The cultivators in the stands were all shocked by such momentum, they didn't even dare to take a breath, and stared at the two on the field.","Even Li Shihong and the others, who knew Huang Yueli's strength well, were a little apprehensive.","And right in the middle of the arena, Huang Yueli, who was facing Huang Beicheng, was still very calm.","The fire attribute energy she could conceive was a hundred times stronger than others, and the impact was astonishingly powerful.","If this was lightning or metal profound power, it was indeed quite threatening to her.","However, this was the fire attribute.","After merging with Sky Phoenix Ring, the damage of the fire attribute to her has been much smaller. Unless the strength was more than one level higher than hers, otherwise, it would be difficult to hurt her.","Therefore, facing the attack from Huang Beicheng, she didn't have any worries.","She reached out her hand directly, and calmly condensed the fire attribute energy.","Unlike Huang Beicheng's manifestation of a Phoenix, which was astonishingly powerful at first glance, in Huang Yueli's hands, there were only two small balls of fire attribute energy appearing in her palm like a cluster of flames.","It seems that it was really ordinary.","It wasn't until the manifestation of a Phoenix rushed in front of her that Huang Yueli raised her hand and blasted the two small flames towards the Phoenix figure!","One was a huge existence with a wingspan of 50 to 60 metres while the other was just two small flames.","However, the moment the two came into contact, the Phoenix Phantom seemed to be scalded by something, and a hole appeared in the middle.","Immediately afterwards, the phantom began to melt rapidly at a speed visible to the naked eye.","\"What?! What's going on?\"","Huang Beicheng's face changed in horror, and he quickly increased his strength, trying to re-condense the Phoenix Phantom."]},{"number":4234,"title":"Chapter 4234 Who Is The Real Traitor? (8)","paragraphs":["However, all this was in vain.","Under Huang Yueli's casual swipe, the Phoenix Phantom gradually disintegrated, and turned into fire attribute energy in the air again, gradually drifting away.","\"You...how is it possible?!\"","Huang Beicheng stared wide-eyed, watching this scene in disbelief.","As soon as he gritted his teeth, he didn't care about any skills or what not. He directly condensed a fire dragon and it swept towards Huang Yueli.","Huang Yueli had been prepared for a long time, and summoned a similar fire dragon to attack him.","Huang Beicheng persisted for a while, then was defeated, flew back more than ten metres, fell to the ground, as blood trickled out from the corner of his mouth.","\"Oh, he still lost!\"","\"A god-level genius is a god-level genius. Even if Huang Beicheng is at the late stage of the Heart Profound Realm, he's still far behind!\"","\"However, Huang Beicheng is already very strong, it's just a pity that the lottery was not drawn well.\"","From the stands, there was a voice of regret.","No one was surprised that Huang Beicheng would lose.","After seeing Li Moying's physical strength, everyone already had the impression that a god-level genius was invincible.","Although this god-level genius was a delicate-looking little girl, she cannot be any weaker than Li Moying.","Huang Yueli was not as relaxed as she appeared on the surface.","She was secretly relieved when she saw Huang Beicheng vomit blood and flew out while clutching her chest.","Actually, she was not willing to hurt Huang Beicheng too much.","In any case, Huang Beicheng was also from her clan, the top heaven-level genius of the Sacred Phoenix Clan, and even able to enter the top four in the God Realm's Grand Meet.","After she returns to the Sacred Phoenix Clan, if she can subdue Huang Beicheng, it will definitely be a great help.","If she wants to be the Matriarch, it was not enough to rely on her strength alone. She doesn't necessarily have to do everything by herself, right?","A young generation of genius fighters like Huang Beicheng was still very valuable.","However, after Huang Beicheng's potential was stimulated, his strength was no small matter. It was not easy to defeat him without seriously injuring him.","Even Huang Yueli had to spend a lot of effort to do it.","She even suffered a little internal injury because of this.","Huang Yueli stood in the middle of the competition field, turned her head to look at the referee, \"I won this competition, right? Then let's end like this!\"","\"Wait!\" The referee quickly stopped her, \"Young Miss Li, this is against the rules!\"","\"Why is it against the rules?\"","The referee said: \"According to the rules of the competition, either your opponent admits defeat, or you knock him out of the arena, otherwise, he cannot be counted as a loss! If you leave the arena at this time, you will be eliminated! \"","Huang Yueli suddenly remembered this rule, and laughed twice.","\"Ahem, this... I almost forgot. Huang Beicheng, admit defeat!\"","She felt that she had shown mercy, but any cultivator who wanted to save face would quickly go down the steps and immediately admit defeat.","Anyway, it's not shameful to lose to a god-level genius. She had shown her prowess just now, and it was best to admit defeat here.","But who knew, Huang Beicheng raised his head, stared at her coldly, and coughed a few times: \"Ahem, I... I can't admit defeat! If... if you have the ability, you can kick me off!\"","Hearing this, Huang Yueli couldn't help frowning.","It was obvious that Huang Beicheng couldn't beat her, but he was still stubborn and refused to admit defeat.","The enmity between the Sacred Phoenix Clan and the Cloudy Qilin Clan was really deep!"]},{"number":4235,"title":"Chapter 4235 Who Is The Real Traitor? (9)","paragraphs":["Even in such a formal competition arena, they were unwilling to admit defeat to the opponent...","Huang Yueli hesitated for a moment, then shrugged, \"Since you insist on letting me beat you up again, then I'll do it!\"","Anyway, Huang Beicheng had already fallen to the ground, and it didn't take much effort to knock him farther away.","After Huang Yueli finished speaking, she walked towards Huang Beicheng.","When the distance between the two was only one metre, Huang Yueli kicked up, trying to kick Huang Beicheng who was on the ground away.","But at this moment, a sudden change happened!","Suddenly, a powerful energy erupted from Huang Beicheng's body, bombarding towards Huang Yueli!","This energy was even stronger than the energy contained in the Phoenix's manifestation just now, and its momentum was even more fierce!","Moreover, due to the sudden attack at such a close, Huang Yueli hardly had any room for buffer and defence!","The flames suddenly exploded from around the two of them and shot straight into the sky!","A smug sneer flashed across Huang Beicheng's eyes.","Just now, he pretended to be weak, refused to admit defeat and deliberately provoked, just to lure Huang Yueli to him.","Once Huang Yueli approached, he immediately raised his potential for the second time, directly reaching the strength of the early stage of the Dao Profound Realm, and then exploded suddenly!","Under such circumstances, Huang Yueli will undoubtedly die!","The cultivators present all let out a cry of shock at the same time!","No one thought that Huang Beicheng would make a move at this time, nor did they expect that he would be so powerful as soon as he made a move, like a thunderbolt!","Huang Yueli, who was beside her, was completely covered by flames, so she couldn't see at all.","It was as if she had been engulfed by the flames of the explosion.","\"Damn, what's going on here?! Why did you suddenly... suddenly do it?\"","\"It's obvious that Huang Beicheng made a sneak attack!! How despicable and shameless, isn't it? In such a formal competition, you actually still make a sneak attack?\"","\"And he should have hidden his strength! When he made the first attack just now, his strength was not that strong, and now he shows his true strength in a sneak attack. This is... to put the opponent to death on purpose!\"","Cultivators with a higher vision, such as the elders of the major Ancient God Clan, had already seen through the trick.","For a moment, everyone turned pale in horror.","Xuan Jiuling's complexion changed, \"This...the enmity between the Sacred Phoenix Clan and the Cloudy Qilin Clan is endless! How dare you kill someone on such an occasion! It's over now, Young Miss Li won't really fall in the hands of Huang Beicheng? This is a loss for the entire God Realm!\"","A talented cultivator like Huang Yueli who has high strength and is good at Spirit Armaments and array techniques is exactly what the Allied Forces need most.","Xuan Jiuling was still thinking about finding an opportunity to catch up with her and let her join the Allied Forces.","As a result, just as soon as this idea appeared, Huang Yueli was ambushed by someone.","On the side of the Cloudy Qilin Clan, it was even more chaotic.","Even Liu Buyan couldn't sit still any longer, and moved to Li Moying's side, panicking, \"Li Moying, you... why are you still sitting here? Junior Sister, she...she can't die, right? What should I do? ?\"","\"Shut your crow's mouth!\" Li Moying gave him a cold look, \"Little Li'er will be fine.\"","With his eyesight, he has actually seen through Huang Yueli's actions.","The moment she approached Huang Beicheng, she moved her fingers slightly, gathering her profound strength quietly."]},{"number":4236,"title":"Chapter 4236 Who Is The Real Traitor? (10)","paragraphs":["Obviously, Huang Yueli had already prepared herself for a surprise attack from Huang Beicheng.","Few of the cultivators present, including those at the peak of the Dao Profound Realm, could see through this point.","Only Li Moying, who was connected with Huang Yueli, could easily see through her little tricks.","However, even though he knew that his Little Li'er had a careful mind and would not fall here casually, Li Moying's heart was still left hanging, fearing that something might happen.","At this moment, Liu Buyan leaned close to his ear and yelled, which annoyed him even more. Oh, how he wished he could slap this guy away!","The flames formed a beam of light, which stayed in the air for a while before gradually dissipating.","Everyone became nervous, stood up and looked towards the centre of the arena.","Although a god-level genius was very strong, but... in the face of such a close sneak attack, could she really survive?","The final result did not disappoint everyone.","Huang Yueli still stood in place.","Although the clothes on her body were burnt in several places and she looked a little embarrassed.","But, after all, she was still alive and well, and it seems that her injuries are not serious.","On the other hand, Huang Beicheng is much more miserable.","Many parts of his body were severely burned. With his hands pressed against his chest, his expression was full of pain. At first glance, he had serious internal injuries, possibly even his meridians.","Only then did the cultivators present feel relieved.","At the same time, he couldn't help but hiss in contempt.","\"Shameless, this is so shameless! The Sacred Phoenix Clan unexpectedly did a sneak attack!\"","\"Even if you're an enemy, you can't do this in an official competition, right? Otherwise, where's the fairness of the competition?\"","\"This was also self-inflicted. Originally, Young Miss Li wanted to let him go, and he wanted to seek his own death! Now, he has been so badly retaliated that he can only be slaughtered by Young Miss Li.\"","\"You deserve it, you really deserve it! The Sacred Phoenix Clan is really too shameless, no wonder only the Cloudy Qilin Clan has god-level geniuses!\"","Huang Beicheng was lying on the ground, listening to these messy discussions, he felt aggrieved in his heart, and a breath of depression accumulated in his chest, making him unable to breathe.","He was defeated by Huang Yueli, and even injured, even if he died because of it, it's nothing.","However, these onlookers dared to say that their Sacred Phoenix Clan was shameless!","Such an evaluation simply made him hard to listen to.","Shameless? Who was shameless?","Even if he was killed by Huang Yueli, let the world know the true face of this witch!","Thinking of this, Huang Beicheng couldn't bear it anymore, and yelled out loudly, \"Huang Yueli, you are a traitor of the Sacred Phoenix Clan! You think you have a god-level talent and extraordinary strength, and you can do so many shameless things. Delving to murder to silence me, do you think no one will know the scandal you have done? I am going to die today, and I will expose your true colours!\"","Huang Beicheng suddenly spoke out, still saying such nonsensical words.","The scene was silent for a moment, and then chaos immediately broke out.","\"What do you mean? A traitor from the Sacred Phoenix Clan? What's going on?\"","\"The name he called just now was...Huang Yueli? Who is that?\"","\"What's the matter? What's the real face? There seems to be some big secret?\"","Huang Yueli was also taken aback.","She originally wanted to wait until the finals were over before finding Huang Sanbai to settle the score.","Because Floating Sea was the Island Master's territory after all, she doesn't disrupt the normal progress of the competition, but to give the Island Master face, so as not to cause the Island Master's displeasure and intervene.","But who knows, something unexpected happened in the middle of the competition."]},{"number":4237,"title":"Chapter 4237 Shocking Secret (1)","paragraphs":["Even Huang Yueli didn't think that Huang Beicheng actually knew her true identity.","Moreover, in the middle of the competition, he would suddenly divulge her true identity.","How did Huang Beicheng know about this?","Could it be that Huang Sanbai told him?","However, Huang Sanbai was not a fool, how could he casually tell this secret to others? Moreover, he was still the number one genius of the younger generation in the clan, isn't he courting death?","No, there must be something wrong!","Before Huang Yueli could figure it out, Huang Beicheng continued to shout loudly.","\"What? Are you speechless? You are a god-level genius of the Sacred Phoenix Clan, but you were coaxed by the Young Master of the Cloudy Qilin Clan with a few words, betrayed the Clan, not only helping the people of the Cloudy Qilin Clan to deal with their own people, Moreover, he also killed the Patriarch!\"","\"Everyone, please tell me. Should such a shameless and lewd woman deserve to be killed?\"","As soon as this remark came out, the scene immediately became even more chaotic.","Every word Huang Beicheng uttered was so shocking, completely beyond everyone's imagination.","The fiancee of the Young Master of the Cloudy Qilin Clan was actually a god-level genius of the Sacred Phoenix Clan?","In order to be able to marry Li Moying, she betrayed her Clan?","Moreover, she also killed Huang Tianhao?","Any one of these accusations was explosive, not to mention that the source was Huang Beicheng.","All of a sudden, the stands were in an uproar.","\"My God, what's going on? Is it true?\"","\"I don't believe there will be such a thing!\"","\"However, I also heard some time ago that the Sacred Phoenix Clan also had a god-level genius, but disappeared later. Now, the Cloudy Qilin Clan has a second god-level genius. How can there be such a coincidence in the world? What's the matter? God-level geniuses are not chinese cabbages that are so commonly found, one or two is not enough, and there is a third?\"","This was exactly the question most people have.","Everyone focused their eyes on Huang Yueli and perked their ears, wanting to hear her explanation.","Thoughts flashed quickly in Huang Yueli's mind.","At this point, if she denied it, it wouldn't make any sense.","She will tell the truth herself later. At this time, she has no other choice but to nod.","It's just that Huang Beicheng's sudden disclosure of her identity completely disrupted her original plan.","Huang Yueli narrowed her eyes, nodded and said, \"Yes, I am indeed a cultivator of the Sacred Phoenix Clan, and my real name is Huang Yueli. But...\"","\"Alright, it really is you! You bloody traitor! I'm going to kill you!\"","Hearing Huang Yueli's confirmation, Huang Beicheng became agitated all of a sudden, and before she could finish speaking, he yelled and interrupted her.","At the same time, he got up from the ground all of a sudden, frantically waved the sharp sword in his hand, and stabbed towards her.","Huang Yueli dodged, frowned and said: \"Calm down first, listen to me!\"","\"Clan traitor, you deserve to die! It's useless for you to argue any longer!\"","Huang Beicheng roared angrily.","In the stands, all cultivators were completely shocked by the news.","No matter how righteous and stern Huang Beicheng had accused before, it was not as shocking as Huang Yueli's nod of confirmation.","This astonishing news was actually true...it was true!","Among them, the most shocked ones were the cultivators of the Cloudy Qilin Clan.","They never dreamed that the future Young Madame who had been offered up as a treasure by their Clan was actually a cultivator from their old enemy, the Sacred Phoenix Clan!"]},{"number":4238,"title":"Chapter 4238 Shocking Secret (2)","paragraphs":["This was no different from a bolt from the blue!","Li Shihong clutched his chest, as he felt a mouthful of blood rise up his throat.","If he hadn't been determined, he would have sprayed out blood by now.","He took several breaths in a row before he managed to calm down a bit. He turned his head and faced Li Moying, his voice trembling.","\"Mo...Moying, Young Miss Li is really...really...is...\"","He couldn't even finish a sentence.","Li Moying looked as usual, and nodded calmly, \"That's right, she's not Young Miss Li, she should be... Young Miss Huang.\"","\"You, you, you... Did you already know?! Why didn't you tell us earlier?\"","Looking at Li Moying's expression, Li Shihong finally understood.","Daring, Li Moying has always known everything, but has been keeping it from them!","Reminiscent of the last time the steward exposed Huang Yueli's identity, he purposely went to Li Moying's yard to peep, trying to verify the authenticity, but in the end, he was tricked miserably, Li Shihong couldn't bear it anymore, and finally He spat out the blood that was stagnant in his chest.","Not only Li Shihong, but at this moment, all the cultivators of the Cloudy Qilin Clan were staring intently at Li Moying.","They couldn't imagine that Huang Yueli was actually from the Sacred Phoenix Clan! There was no sign at all?","Moreover, their Young Master actually fell in love with a woman from a hostile force, and even concealed her identity for her, letting her hide in the Clan...","It's not that Li Moying didn't notice these suspicious gazes, but the expression on his face didn't change at all. It seemed that everyone's doubts couldn't affect him at all.","\"If I tell you that Little Li'er belongs to the Sacred Phoenix Clan, will you still agree with my marriage with her?\"","Li Shihong choked for a moment, \"This...even if there is no grass in the end of the world, you can find any woman, even if from a Human Clan, you can discuss it, but the Sacred Phoenix Clan... no, absolutely not!\"","Li Moying showed a look of \"see,it's true\", snorted coldly, and didn't speak again.","Seeing his arrogant yet defiant attitude, Li Shihong was shocked.","He suddenly remembered Li Moying's frightening behaviour when Huang Yueli was trapped in the array on Paradise Island a few days ago.","For that woman... he could die without hesitation! He could challenge cultivators who were much stronger than him, and he could personally take risks for her and enter the poisonous mist!","Does that mean... he would also leave the Clan for that woman? !","Thinking of this, Li Shihong suddenly felt a burst of panic, and was about to say something more, to test Li Moying.","At this moment, exclamations suddenly came from the stands.","\"Oh my god! Look at Huang Beicheng! What's going on with him?\"","\"It's such a powerful energy fluctuation! Damn, I... I can't even breathe! Is this really a level that cultivators in the Heart Profound Realm can achieve?\"","\"It's not right, it's really not right! Huang Beicheng's eyes... seem to be bleeding!\"","\"Hiss, that's so terrifying!!\"","Li Moying frowned, immediately ignored Li Shihong, and turned to look at the arena.","Huang Beicheng thought he had exposed Huang Yueli's true face, so he slashed at her several times in an attempt to kill her.","But it's a pity that he couldn't do anything to Huang Yueli during the sneak attack. Now that the opponent was prepared, he couldn't even touch Huang Yueli's hair.","Huang Beicheng was angry and anxious, gritted his teeth fiercely, and stimulated the potential in his body again without hesitation!"]},{"number":4239,"title":"Chapter 4239 Shocking Secret (3)","paragraphs":["This was the third time that his potential has been stimulated!","Huang Beicheng really used the Devil skills taught to him by Huang Sanbai to the limit!","The moment he activated the skill, he immediately felt a tearing pain emanating from every meridian in his body.","The profound energy in his body seemed to be completely drawn out of his body in an instant.","But a lot of energy poured into his dantian, and it was constantly expanding outwards, feeling like it might explode at any time.","The unspeakable pain made Huang Beicheng's face instantly distorted, and the expression on his face became extremely ferocious.","The skin on his body turned a strange blueish-purple colour, his eyes became more and more red to the extent that some blood started to flow the corners of his eyes.","Huang Yueli sensed something was wrong the moment he activated the skill and was startled.","She immediately yelled, \"Huang Beicheng, stop, stop quickly!! What are you doing? This is too dangerous, stop quickly!\"","The state of Huang Beicheng was really strange.","Based on Huang Yueli's experience, it can be seen at a glance that this is an obvious sign of Qi Deviation. If this state cannot be stopped immediately, it may take less than a quarter of an hour for him to completely backfire on himself and explode to death.","However, Huang Beicheng couldn't listen to her words at all.","From his point of view, Huang Yueli, a traitor, was definitely afraid, because she was shocked by his strength that had been raised to a whole realm!","Although he felt extremely painful physically, Huang Beicheng could clearly feel... strength!","Incomparably powerful!","Before this, he had never had the opportunity to experience such a powerful force!","With the help of the power of the Devil Clan's skills, his strength instantly entered the middle stage of the Dao Profound Realm, and the fire attribute energy around him seemed to flow continuously towards him.","The Devil Clan's exercises blurred his consciousness and sanity, preventing him from hearing the exclamations of the audience in the distance, and he didn't know how terrifying he looked now.","All he knows is that he was very powerful now, unprecedentedly powerful!","Even if the person in front of him was a god-level genius, she will definitely not be able to resist one of his moves!","Seeing his appearance, Huang Yueli was extremely horrified, \"Huang Beicheng, you are crazy! Stop!\"","She rushed forward, trying to seize the last bit of time, seal Huang Beicheng's meridians, and forcibly stop him from going berserk.","There were only a few talented fighters in the Sacred Phoenix Clan. She doesn't want one of them to die inexplicably the moment she takes the position of Matriarch.","If Huang Beicheng died in such a place, it would be meaningless.","However, Huang Yueli still underestimated the domineering power of the Devil Clan's skills.","Although her agility skills were already at their peak, she still couldn't catch up. Huang Beicheng successfully activated his skills as if in the blink of an eye.","\"Huang Yueli, you traitor! Go to hell!!\"","Huang Beicheng let out a roar, and swung the long sword towards Huang Yueli.","A flame fell from the sky, attached to his sword, and shot straight at Huang Yueli's chest!","Huang Yueli's posture of rushing towards him now was equivalent to directly rushing towards the flames of Huang Beicheng.","It was already too late to change her moves to dodge.","In an instant, she made a decisive decision.","Between her eyebrows, a phoenix totem suddenly lit up. Immediately afterwards, a monstrous heat wave radiated towards the surroundings. The dazzling light made it difficult to open one's eyes."]},{"number":4240,"title":"Chapter 4240 Shocking Secret (4)","paragraphs":["\"Oh my god, what's going on? Why... can't see anything?!\"","\"In the end what happened?!\"","\"It's so...so hot...so terrifying...\"","It took a long time for this strong light to gradually dissipate, and the intense heat wave around it also became milder.","Among the audience, the stronger ones barely opened their eyes and looked towards the center of the arena.","Seeing this, they gasped on the spot, with horror in their eyes.","Just behind Huang Yueli, a huge phoenix was waving its huge wings, staying in mid-air.","This phoenix is much larger than the phantom of the phoenix summoned by Huang Beicheng at the beginning.","The energy in the whole body should also be several times stronger.","However, this is not the main reason why these powerhouses were surprised.","The real reason why they changed their colors in shock was that this was... a real phoenix, not a phantom formed by condensing energy!","Although Xiao Wangcai in Huang Yueli's Sky Phoenix Ring is a spirit body, as a phoenix that can be reborn from ashes and nirvana, the difference between the spirit body and the real phoenix is not that big, and this is also one of the forms of the Phoenix clan. One, it can exert 80% of the power of the entity.","The current Xiao Wangcai has already evolved a lot compared to when he was in Soaring Heavens Continent, especially after Huang Yueli obtained a lot of inarray on taming divine beasts and treasures of heaven and earth in the secret realm of Saint Iniquitous Shadow, Xiao Wangcai was cultivated from infancy to adolescence.","This allowed Little Phoenix's strength to make great progress.","And now, the little phoenix still uses the secret method of the phoenix family to forcibly arouse its strength, so the power displayed is almost comparable to that of an adult phoenix.","Seeing the dazzling big phoenix behind Huang Yueli, all the cultivators were completely stunned.","Even powerhouses like Li Shihong and Xuan Jiuling's eyes widened with disbelief.","\"Phoenix! This is... the real Phoenix!!\"","\"The ancient gods and beasts have been extinct for so many years, and there are still people who can contract the gods and beasts? Where did she find a phoenix?\"","\"What's the use of just finding it? You have to have this ability contract! If it were you, I'm afraid you'd be burnt to ashes if you were randomly sprayed by the Phoenix!\"","\"Nonsense, of course I can't do it anymore, but isn't Ms. Huang a god-level genius?\"","\"It's scary, it's really scary! As far as I know, apart from the old monsters in the Mingxuan Realm, only Young Master Li of the Cloudy Qilin Clan and Young Master Jun of the True Dragon Clan have contracted divine beasts!\"","\"That's right. Although Miss Huang is also a god-level talent, she doesn't have the support of her family. She can even contract a divine beast? It's too scary!\"","The stands were completely overwhelmed by all kinds of exclamations and discussions.","If we say that when Huang Beicheng accused Huang Yueli before, some people had doubts, thinking that Huang Beicheng had admitted the wrong person.","It is impossible for a god-level genius of the Sacred Phoenix Clan to be with the Young Master of the Cloudy Qilin Clan.","But now, after seeing the Phoenix beast behind Huang Yueli with his own eyes, no one has any doubts anymore.","Only the god-level geniuses of the Sacred Phoenix Clan can contract a real phoenix!","Huang Yueli's identity is undoubtedly confirmed!","At this moment, Huangbeicheng collapsed to the ground, every muscle in his body was in severe pain, and he couldn't use any strength from his whole body."]},{"number":4241,"title":"Chapter 4241 Stick To One’s Word (1)","paragraphs":["Huang Yueli's aura gradually retreated.","The big phoenix behind her also stopped waving its wings. Its body was suspended in mid-air, its head drooped, and it rubbed against Huang Yueli's face.","Huang Yueli patted it on the head, \"Thank you, let's go rest first.\"","The Phoenix neighed and folded its wings.","With the flash of red light, it also disappeared and returned to the space of Sky Phoenix Ring.","Huang Beicheng stared at Huang Yueli firmly, his eyes were full of shock and fear.","\"You...you...you actually contracted the phoenix beast, how is it possible?! Isn't the phoenix extinct already?\"","Huang Yueli walked slowly to his side and looked down at him, \"Wouldn't it happen that things you think are impossible? Let me tell you, there are many things that you can't think of!\"","Huangbeicheng took a deep breath, and resentment appeared on his face again.","\"Alright, now even the phoenix beast has come out, you can't deny it even if you want to! You are Huang Yueli, and I didn't wrong you at all!\"","Huang Yueli sneered, \"Isn't this obvious? Everyone can see that I am indeed a cultivator of the Sacred Phoenix Clan, but...\"","\"But what is it? How do you want to deny it? You betrayed the family and killed the Patriarch. The crime is extremely heinous, and the heavens cannot tolerate it! Even if I can't kill you, our Patriarch has so many elders, and there are so many elders. Plead guilty and be executed!\"","Looking at his excited and ferocious expression, Huang Yueli couldn't help shaking her head, \"Huang Beicheng, you are really pitiful. You were sold, and you counted the money for others? You will be killed by Huang Sanbai, why don't you Believe his nonsense?\"","\"Wh...what killed him? Elder Sanbai is the backbone of our family, no...you are not allowed to slander...he...\"","Huang Beicheng scolded her excitedly, but in the middle of speaking, he suddenly felt the pain in his chest intensified again.","Moreover, the pain was getting worse and worse, and he couldn't help vomiting several mouthfuls of blood.","His face became even paler, and he couldn't even speak.","Huang Yueli glanced at him, and there was more sympathy in her eyes.","Huangbeicheng's talent is still good, but his brain is really not enough, and he was brainwashed so thoroughly by Huang Sanbai.","She still wanted to say something, but at this moment, a cold and stern voice came from the direction of the private room of the Sacred Phoenix Clan.","\"Huang Yueli! You shameless villain!\"","Huang Sanbai stood up from his seat all of a sudden, with a stern expression on his face, his snow-white beard fluttering in the wind, carrying a kind of tragic aura.","He pointed at Huang Yueli, and said sharply: \"For a man, you betrayed the family, and even murdered the Patriarch. All kinds of crimes are undoubtedly confirmed, and you still dare to quibble?\"","Following Huang Sanbai's voice, the cultivators of the Sacred Phoenix Clan around him were all furious and accused Huang Yueli one after another.","\"Shameless, really shameless! As a god-level genius, actually betraying the family is simply too contemptuous!\"","\"This kind of person must be punished, otherwise what's the face of our Sacred Phoenix Clan?\"","\"Do you think that with the backing of the Cloudy Qilin Clan, we can't do anything about you?\"","\"Kill her, and defend the Patriarch!\"","Listening to these vicious slanders, Huang Yueli did not show any excitement, and the corners of her mouth gradually curled into a mocking arc.","After these people had finished talking, she said calmly, \"Have you finished? Huang Sanbai, I have never seen such a shameless person like you!\""]},{"number":4242,"title":"Chapter 4242 Stick To One’s Word (2)","paragraphs":["\"The one who betrayed the family is obviously you, but you bite me back? Do you really think that so many cultivators present are fools?\"","Seeing Huang Yueli so calm, Huang Sanbai's heart skipped a beat.","I always feel that something is wrong with the situation. Could it be that this damn girl already has some way to deal with it?","However, Huang Sanbai believed that the plan was perfect, so he only hesitated for a moment, and then shook this doubt out of his mind.","Today, this dead girl is definitely doomed. He must accuse her of betraying the family and murdering the Patriarch.","In this way, even if he can't kill Huang Yueli for a while, she will never be able to stand up again!","Thinking of this, Huang Sanbai immediately said, \"You don't have to argue, I will never let you, the murderer who murdered the Patriarch, go!\"","As he spoke, he waved his hand, \"Come on, take down this family traitor!\"","The several elders of the Sacred Phoenix Clan who were present had long wanted to go down and arrest people. When they heard this, they immediately rushed forward.","Several Daoxuan realm fighters shot at the same time, their aura soared to the sky, and the berserk profound energy swept towards Huang Yueli.","Seeing this scene, many cultivators exclaimed.","\"It's over, Huang Yueli is done!\"","\"Why doesn't she run away? Does she really think she is the opponent of so many elders?\"","\"I think it's not that she doesn't want to run away, but that she can't run away, right?\"","No matter what others said, Huang Yueli just glanced at Huang Sanbai lightly, her figure didn't move at all, and the expression on her face didn't change at all.","In the private room of the Cloudy Qilin Clan, Li Moying's expression changed suddenly when he saw this scene.","Even though Huang Yueli had already told him not to interfere, just watch her handle the matter well.","However, seeing such a situation, he couldn't bear it no matter what, he just jumped up and jumped towards the arena.","He hooked Huang Yueli's waist with one hand, and threw her behind him. With the other hand, he pulled out the long sword from his waist. In an instant, a thunderbolt fell from the sky.","However, although Li Moying's speed is very fast, there is someone who is faster than him.","\"Several elders, stop!\"","Huang Sanbai's eyes blurred, and he saw the figures of the Left and Right Protectors appearing between them and Huang Yueli.","Several other elders in Floating Sea also jumped down.","the Right Protector looked at him with displeasure, \"Elder Sanbai, I remember that the Sacred Phoenix Clan has promised in front of the Island Master that they will never do anything to the cultivators of the Cloudy Qilin Clan before they leave the Floating Sea. Do you want to go back on your word after leaving the Floating Sea to settle the matter?\"","Huang Sanbai couldn't help being startled, thinking of this episode.","This is the martial arts arena in the God Realm. He wanted to arrest people on the spot, but in order to maintain the seriousness of the competition, it was impossible for Floating Sea to let them do it here.","And the Island Master is powerful, and he is not someone to be easily provoked. It is not realistic for the Sacred Phoenix Clan to rely on their strength to suppress others.","He thought for a while, then gritted his teeth and said: \"Your Excellency, you heard it just now. What I want to arrest is not a member of the Cloudy Qilin Clan, but a traitor from our Sacred Phoenix Clan! This is an internal matter of our family. It seems a little inappropriate for Hai to intervene in it?\"","\"this...\"","There is some truth to this statement, the Right Protector hesitated for a moment.","Huang Yueli knew that Floating Sea would intervene, so she didn't dodge.","Hearing this, she gently pushed away Li Moying who was protecting her in her arms, and strode up to the Right Protector.","\"Huang Sanbai, you are in such a hurry to kill me, but you don't let me finish my sentence, do you have a ghost in your heart?\""]},{"number":4243,"title":"Chapter 4243 Stick To One’s Word (3)","paragraphs":["\"What did you say? You little bastard...\" Huang Sanbai wanted to repeat the old trick again, and overwhelmed Huang Yueli with his loud voice.","However, the Right Protector couldn't bear to listen to such foul language, and couldn't help frowning.","\"Elder Sanbai, what are you excited about? If you want to reprimand the juniors, you don't need to reprimand them in Floating Sea, right? That's fine, today is the final of the God Realm's Grand Meet, so let's compete first. Your business, wait until it's over...\"","the Right Protector originally wanted to bring this matter to a close, and finish the competition first.","However, Huang Yueli stood up at the right time, and said in a steady but firm voice: \"Your Excellency, and everyone present, there is of course a reason why Elder Sanbai is so excited, because he is the real family traitor. ! The person who murdered the Patriarch is also Huang Sanbai!\"","\"What?! What's going on?\"","\"Didn't you say that the person who killed Huang Tianhao was Huang Yueli? Why did he become Huang Sanbai again?\"","\"what happened?\"","Hearing Huang Yueli's words, the audience who had already calmed down suddenly became excited again.","Huang Sanbai's face suddenly changed, \"Huang Yueli, don't spout blood! It is a fact that you are with the Young Master of the Cloudy Qilin Clan. Everyone has seen it. There is no way to argue!\"","Huang Yueli smiled coldly, \"That's right, I am indeed engaged to Li Moying, but I haven't returned to the Sacred Phoenix Clan after so long, it's not because of Li Moying! It's because Huang Sanbai has been in To hinder me, to chase and kill me several times, made it impossible for me to return to the Sacred Phoenix Clan! I also had no other choice, so I chose to follow Young Master Li!\"","Huang Sanbai became more and more anxious.","If it weren't for the fact that the Right Protector is stronger than him, he would have directly killed the Right Protector and the others together!","It was these people who made it difficult for him to miss the best time to kill Huang Yueli.","Now, how to seal her mouth? !","\"Shut up! What nonsense are you talking about? Why am I chasing you down? Why don't I let you go back to the family? You don't even make a draft when you lie! You are a god-level genius. When you come back to the family, you have a lot of respect for everyone in the family.\" Good, why should I stop you?!\"","Huang Sanbai argued eagerly.","The elders of the Sacred Phoenix Clan also stood by his side.","\"That's right. At that time, who in the family didn't want you to come back? It's impossible for someone to murder you, let alone Elder Sanbai!\"","\"That's right, Elder Sanbai was the first to propose to pick you up from the Sea of Netherness. Will he harm you?\"","\"Your crime was exposed, yet you refused to plead guilty, and you still want to smear Elder Sanbai? How could there be someone like you!\"","The elders were heartbroken, but Huang Yueli still sneered.","\"I see that you have lived hundreds of years, even to the point of a dog, and you can't even see through such a hypocrite! Huang Sanbai wants to kill me, naturally because... he wants to become the Patriarch of the Sacred Phoenix Clan Yes! I have the Sky Phoenix Ring, an artifact of the Sacred Phoenix Clan that has been lost for many years. After he saw it, he became greedy and wanted to take advantage of my lack of strength to kill him secretly. Fortunately, I was lucky enough to escape. , and was saved by Young Master Li...\"","\"What? Heaven... Sky Phoenix Ring?!\"","\"You have the Sky Phoenix Ring on your body? How is it possible?\"","Hearing this, the elders were all shocked.","The Sky Phoenix Ring was shattered in the fierce battle and fell into the lower realm. I don't know how long ago it happened.","During the period, there were countless strong men in the clan who wanted to find Sky Phoenix Ring, but to no avail."]},{"number":4244,"title":"Chapter 4244 Stick To One’s Word (4)","paragraphs":["But now, Huang Yueli actually said that she found Sky Phoenix Ring? !","This news is even more shocking than the disappearance of the Patriarch!","Huang Sanbai saw that everyone was distracted by Huang Yueli so quickly, so she hurriedly interrupted them.","\"Shut up! This is all a story you made up! Even if you have Sky Phoenix Ring, what does it matter to me? I have always been loyal to the family, and all the people in the family can see it! You actually slandered me for coveting the position of Patriarch, and said that I Kill people for this?! You woman is simply too vicious to slander my personality!\"","Upon hearing this, the elders shifted their attention again.","\"That's right, so what if you have Sky Phoenix Ring? How could Elder Sanbai kill someone for this?\"","\"I also don't believe such a thing will happen!\"","Huang Yueli smiled coldly, \"There are still many things you don't know! Huang Sanbai chased and killed me several times but failed. Seeing that he couldn't stop me from returning to the family, he simply murdered the Patriarch! The one who really murdered the Patriarch He is the man! And he has long coveted the position of Patriarch and hoped that Huang Tianhao would die, but he still acted like a sanctimonious person. You people are also blind, and you have been played by him one by one !\"","\"Huang Yueli, you are deceiving people too much! You make up such an outrageous story, do you think anyone will believe it? What about the evidence? Come up with the evidence if you have the ability!\"","Huang Sanbai was so angry that he blew out his beard and stared at his eyes. He pointed at Huang Yueli and roared angrily.","He was indeed very angry, but 70% of his exaggerated movements were intentional.","He had long been convinced that Huang Yueli would definitely not be able to produce any evidence.","Therefore, both sides can only talk and blame each other.","On the other hand, although Huang Yueli is a god-level genius, she has never been in the family after all, and she has a marriage contract with the Young Master of the Cloudy Qilin Clan. Others will think that she is a traitor.","But he, Huang Sanbai, was different.","For many years in the clan, he has always pretended to be an upright gentleman. Who in the clan respects and admires him.","Comparing the two, it is obvious and no suspense on whose side everyone will stand and who they choose to believe in!","If he was a little more exaggerated and played tricks enough, Huang Yueli's charges would be even more difficult to escape.","After Huang Sanbai finished speaking, she glanced proudly at Huang Yueli.","Unexpectedly, Huang Yueli just smiled at him.","\"Alright, it seems that Elder Sanbai is determined to deny it to the end! Since you want evidence, then I... will give you the evidence!\"","\"What evidence?\" The elders all looked over suspiciously.","Li Moying had been standing behind Huang Yueli without saying a word, and only now did she speak: \"Little Li'er's brother has brought witnesses here, please wait a moment.\"","The elders looked at each other, full of doubts in their hearts.","They were already firmly on Huang Sanbai's side, but now Huang Yueli said that there is evidence!","Moreover, seeing that she looks so confident, she seems very confident.","But...how is it possible that Huang Sanbai betrayed the family?","Huang Sanbai was also taken aback by Huang Yueli's words.","However, he quickly calmed down, and a mocking smile emerged from the corner of his mouth.","\"Heh, what evidence can you come up with for the fact that there is nothing at all? I'd like to see how you plan to make it up!\"","The time waiting for Liu Buyan to appear seemed very long.","The cultivators at the scene whispered to each other, discussing this matter."]},{"number":4245,"title":"Chapter 4245 Stick To One’s Word (5)","paragraphs":["?","Unlike the elders of the Sacred Phoenix Clan, the onlookers were neutral, so there were quite a few people who favored Huang Yueli.","\"Hey, today's hustle and bustle is really interesting to watch. It's much more interesting than the God Realm's Grand Meet! This Huang Yueli and Huang Sanbai said something completely different. They both said that the other party was a traitor. Tell me, who should you trust? ah?\"","\"The members of the Sacred Phoenix Clan seem to be on Huang Sanbai's side?\"","\"Isn't that obvious? They definitely believe the clan elders, but I think what Huang Yueli said is more likely to be true.\"","\"That's right, I think so too. She is a god-level genius, how could she deliberately not return to the family and run away with a man? She is not stupid!\"","\"Take a step back, even if she really communicated with Young Master Li secretly, as long as they communicate in private, no one will know. Why should she give up family resources for this?\"","\"I think there must be something wrong with this old man Huang Sanbai! The other elders of the Sacred Phoenix Clan are also extremely stupid. If Huang Yueli is really labeled as a family traitor, they will not be able to kill people in Floating Sea, but they will completely kill Huang Yueli. Pushing it to the side of the Cloudy Qilin Clan, when the time comes, the Cloudy Qilin Clan will really have two god-level geniuses, isn't it the Sacred Phoenix Clan who are unlucky?\"","\"Now that you've said that, I understand now. There's obviously something wrong with the cultivation technique that Huang Beicheng used just now to stimulate potential. He forcibly raised his cultivation level and used sneak attacks to kill Huang Yueli. Jiucheng was brainwashed by Huang Sanbai! It's a pity that his god-level genius is extremely powerful, so there is nothing wrong with it.\"","\"This time, the Sacred Phoenix Clan must be in great trouble. No matter who is right or wrong, they will suffer heavy losses.\"","This is not only noticed by the onlookers.","Even those elders who were bewitched by Huang Sanbai were aware of it.","With things like this happening today, no matter whether Huang Yueli is a family traitor or not, they will not be able to keep this god-level genius.","For a moment, several elders had the urge to stop.","I want to suppress this matter first, and wait for a period of time to calm down before making any fuss.","However, it is too late to regret it now.","On the other side, the Left Protector and the Right Protector are also discussing in private.","It stands to reason that, as the organizers of the God Realm's Grand Meet, they would absolutely not allow all ethnic groups to use this opportunity to resolve their grievances.","A competition is a competition, and grievances and grievances should be resolved in private.","Because of this, just now when Huang Sanbai rushed down and wanted to take advantage of the chaos to kill Huang Yueli, they would suddenly jump out to stop him.","But now things have come to such a point.","Not only were the two parties involved in this matter arguing, but the cultivators and major forces at the scene wanted to know the truth of the matter.","At this time, it is no longer realistic to call a stop.","the Left Protector looked helpless, \"What should we do now? The finals of the God Realm's Grand Meet haven't ended yet, should we just let them argue like this?\"","The the Right Protector took a deep breath, shook his head and said, \"We can't stop them now, and I'm afraid there will be even bigger troubles later! We have only one way now, send someone to tell the island what happened here Lord, please make a decision. Otherwise, it will be too late when something bigger happens.\"","Hearing this, Zuo Xiang also became serious.","\"Exactly! Thanks for reminding me. Let's send someone to the Island Master's mansion!\"","at the same time.","A voice came from the entrance of the square.","\"Junior Sister, I brought you someone.\""]},{"number":4246,"title":"Chapter 4246 Stick To One’s Word (6)","paragraphs":["Hearing this voice, the chaotic scene suddenly fell silent.","Everyone's eyes turned to the direction of the sound in unison.","Huang Yueli also showed surprise, and looked towards the entrance of the square.","Two figures slowly walked towards the center of the arena.","One of them was Liu Buyan.","Although he became famous because of his recent treatment of Li Moying and became a new famous doctor in the God Realm, few people have seen him. To most cultivators, he is a new face.","In contrast, Huang Tianhao beside him looked even more eye-catching.","Huang Tianhao's face and body were covered with obvious scars, even half of his nose was cut off, completely disfigured.","It looked really miserable.","After the cultivators were quiet for a while, they discussed again in shock.","\"This... who is this person?! Could this be the witness Huang Yueli mentioned just now?\"","\"What's the situation? Which one is the witness?\"","\"What are the backgrounds of these two people? One of them seems to be a beggar on the street. Can this also be a witness?\"","Compared to the comments of the onlookers who had nothing to do with him, the moment Huang Sanbai saw Huang Tianhao's appearance, his face suddenly turned pale, and he almost jumped up.","He never dreamed that he would see Huang Tianhao here!","When Huang Yueli said that there were witnesses just now, he thought it was some kind of inconspicuous guard in charge, so he didn't take it to heart at all.","In the end, who knew that Huang Yueli was able to find Huang Tianhao? ! He also brought people to the arena of god-level martial arts!","How is this possible?","He obviously locked Huang Tianhao in the mechanism of the cellar, so no one can easily find him, right?","Could it be that Huang Yueli had seen through his plan, so she deliberately found someone to pretend to be in order to scare him?","Just now, such a thought flashed across Huang Sanbai's mind, and when he turned his head, he met Huang Tianhao's eyes full of resentment, and his whole body shuddered!","This person... must be Huang Tianhao himself!","But, how could this happen?","What should he do now? !","Just when Huang Sanbai panicked, Liu Buyan had already led the people to Huang Yueli's side and stopped.","\"You... Huang Yueli, who is this person you brought?\"","The elders of the Sacred Phoenix Clan felt that this person looked familiar, and they were puzzled.","Someone couldn't help but asked directly.","Huang Yueli looked at them and smiled slightly, \"What? Elders, don't you even recognize the Patriarch of the Sacred Phoenix Clan?\"","\"What?!\"","\"What did you say?\"","\"How can it be?\"","Amidst the crowd's exclamation, Huang Yueli said calmly, \"Can't you detect the aura of the Patriarch? Oh, yes, the Patriarch was tortured by Huang Sanbai in every possible way, so most of the meridians have been destroyed. , the current strength is already inferior to that of a martial artist in the Heart Profound Realm, so it's normal for you to not be able to sense it.\"","After hearing this, Huang Sanbai couldn't help but yelled before everyone could react.","\"Huang Yueli, stop spitting blood here! Do you think everyone is a fool? Just find a beggar on the side of the road, and want to pretend to be the Patriarch? It's really ulterior motives!\"","Huang Yueli smiled and said, \"Oh? How do you know this person is a fake?\"","Huang Sanbai said straightforwardly: \"Nonsense, the real Patriarch has already been murdered by you! How could he be the Patriarch?\""]},{"number":4247,"title":"Chapter 4247 The Youngest (1)","paragraphs":["Huang Sanbai raised his head and straightened his chest, looking confident, with a slight sneer on the corner of his mouth.","At first glance, people really think that what he said is the truth, that's why they are so sure.","Many cultivators were deceived by his performance, and they turned their heads to look at Huang Yueli with doubts.","\"That's right? Didn't you say that Huang Tianhao has disappeared?\"","\"If Huang Tianhao is still alive, then how can he say that he is also a powerhouse at the peak of the Dao Profound Realm? How could he be reduced to this level? This is... too miserable, right?\"","\"Besides, who can recognize what he looks like in this appearance? Even if you just find someone to pretend to be, you won't be able to tell?\"","\"The cultivation bases of the two are completely out of line...\"","Huang Sanbai raised his head high, and finally heaved a sigh of relief when he heard everyone's discussion.","Although he looked calm, in fact, he was still a little uneasy.","Because, the person Huang Yueli brought was really Huang Tianhao himself!","However, until now, he has no other choice but to grit his teeth and refuse to admit it. Anyway, Huang Tianhao has been completely destroyed by him, and it is impossible to recover his strength. The impact of the profound energy of heaven and earth, the fragile meridians will not be able to bear it, and it is estimated that he will die suddenly on the spot in a short time.","As long as he delays a little longer, Huang Tianhao won't be able to hold on anymore.","Huang Sanbai thought so in his heart, but after looking at Huang Tianhao a few more times, he couldn't help feeling a little uneasy.","Because, Huang Tianhao's condition is much better than he imagined, no matter how he looks at it, he doesn't look like a dying person.","What exactly is going on?","Seeing Huang Sanbai's reaction, Huang Yueli couldn't help but sneer, \"Elder Sanbai, you think everyone else is a fool! Although the Patriarch's tongue was cut off by you, he couldn't speak, but he You can still write down what happened!\"","As she spoke, she turned to the Right Protector, \"Your Excellency, can I ask you to be an intermediary, and I will trouble you to read it after the Patriarch writes down what happened, so that no one will say that I forged evidence on purpose!\"","the Right Protector hesitated for a moment, but still nodded, \"Yes.\"","Although it's not like being involved in the family affairs of the Sacred Phoenix Clan, Huang Tianhao disappeared in the Floating Sea, and they must find a way to investigate the matter clearly.","Otherwise, there is no way to explain to the cultivators from the God Realm who came to participate in the martial arts.","So, this time, he can only choose to participate.","Huang Yueli had someone prepare a pen and paper and handed it to Huang Tianhao, then stepped back a few steps and stood aside.","Huang Tianhao took a deep breath, grabbed the pen, and began to write quickly.","This time, his writing speed was even faster than when he was in Li Moying's carriage just now.","Because after taking the elixir that Liu Buyan gave him to replenish essence, his energy has recovered a lot. Although his injury will not heal so quickly, his spirit has improved a lot.","Seeing this, Huang Sanbai was extremely anxious, but he couldn't think of any reason to stop him from writing.","the Right Protector stood behind Huang Tianhao, and immediately saw what was written on the paper, and the astonishment on his face became more and more obvious.","The elders of the Sacred Phoenix Clan urged impatiently.","\"Your Excellency, what did that beggar write? Please tell me quickly!\"","\"That's right, don't be fooled!\""]},{"number":4248,"title":"Chapter 4248 The Youngest (2)","paragraphs":["\"I want to see how this guy is going to pour dirty water on our Elder Sanbai!\"","After hearing these words, Huang Sanbai almost didn't cry!","The elders who spoke were all his buddies, and they usually believed in him the most.","At this moment, they are urging the Right Protector, in fact, they want to speak for Huang Sanbai, so that they can expose Huang Yueli's true face as soon as possible.","But to Huang Sanbai, this was a disservice!","the Right Protector frowned slightly, glanced at Huang Sanbai, and then said: \"This person wrote the following testimony: I am Huang Tianhao, the former Patriarch of the Sacred Phoenix Clan...\"","After reading the first sentence, the Right Protector paused.","The cultivators at the scene all had the same question in their minds: What is \"predecessor\"? Isn't Huang Tianhao the Patriarch of the Sacred Phoenix Clan?","However, since Huang Tianhao couldn't speak now, it was obviously impossible for him to answer them.","The the Right Protector could only continue reading, \"Today, I exposed Huang Sanbai, the traitor of the Sacred Phoenix Clan, in front of the majority of fellow martial artists! She became greedy and tried to kill Huang Yueli, a god-level genius of our clan, to snatch the treasures, so far she has made repeated mistakes...\"","Huang Tianhao wrote down all of Huang Sanbai's actions during the recent period.","The Right Protector read out one by one, and the scene suddenly became a mess.","Huang Sanbai couldn't listen to Huang Tianhao halfway through writing, and couldn't help jumping out, wanting to interrupt him.","\"It's nonsense! This is simply nonsense! Huang Yueli, where did you find this beggar and make up such a story, just like the real thing! What a scheming! Don't you still have the face to continue acting? Hurry up Let this guy go!\"","Huang Sanbai took a step forward and was about to rob someone.","Huang Yueli didn't stop him, just stood aside, and said calmly: \"Elder Sanbai, since you said I was making up a story, what are you so anxious about? Seeing how excited you are, I don't know People, thought you were a guilty conscience!\"","Hearing this, Huang Sanbai secretly retracted the profound strength that had been gathered.","Indeed, if he killed Huang Tianhao here now, it would be too eye-catching!","Anyone can see that he has a guilty conscience!","But, if he doesn't act now, Huang Tianhao will tell the truth, right?","Just when he had been advancing and retreating for two years and was having difficulty making a decision, Huang Tianhao's testimony had already come to an end.","Seeing his last sentence, the Right Protector was obviously stunned again.","\"What happened? Why did it stop?\" the Left Protector asked strangely.","Only then did the Right Protector cough lightly, and said: \"Patriarch Huang said that when he escaped from the cellar where Huang Sanbai imprisoned him, he was seriously injured. The Patriarch's seal was forced out and passed to Huang Yueli.\"","\"What?!\"","As soon as these words came out, all the cultivators on the scene were shocked, and many even stood up excitedly.","\"Patriarch Huang really passed the seal to Huang Yueli?\"","\"Isn't there such a thing? If it's true, wouldn't Huang Yueli become the youngest Patriarch of the ancient god clan in the history of the God Realm?\"","\"Yeah, I don't believe it! Huang Yueli is only less than twenty years old! This... is this too hasty?\"","As for the Sacred Phoenix Clan, whether it was Huang Sanbai or the other elders, they were completely shocked by this news.","Everyone stared at Huang Yueli, speechless."]},{"number":4249,"title":"Chapter 4249 The Youngest (3)","paragraphs":["No one would have thought that Huang Tianhao would actually make such a choice!","After a while, the warriors calmed down.","Some powerful fighters, especially the elders of the major protoss, felt that something was wrong again.","\"However, I heard that merging the patriarch's seal is very dangerous! It requires a lot of expert guardians, and there is a chance of failure. But according to this person, he succeeded in getting the seal in less than half an hour in the carriage. To Huang Yueli? Is... is this possible?\"","\"That's right, I'm also thinking about this issue. Could it be that people from the Yunlin clan helped?\"","\"But according to this person, the Yunlin Clan doesn't seem to know Huang Yueli's identity?\"","\"Then it doesn't make sense? Could it be that this person is lying?\"","Everyone looked at Huang Yueli with suspicion.","The succession of each patriarch to the throne is a major event for the ancient gods, and many experts in the clan participated.","Naturally, one knows how dangerous it is to inherit seals.","Therefore, it is inevitable to have doubts about Huang Tianhao's understatement.","An elder of the Holy Phoenix Clan frowned and looked at Huang Yueli.","\"Miss Yueli, since you insist that this is the patriarch, and he passed on the position of patriarch to you, then...can you show the patriarch's seal so that we can verify the authenticity?\"","Huang Yueli nodded calmly but firmly, \"Yes.\"","As soon as these two words were uttered, Huang Sanbai's face instantly turned pale.","Just now, the reason why he dared to insist that Huang Tianhao was a fake, and acted confidently, was because after Huang Tianhao appeared, he did not immediately reveal the patriarch's seal.","The seal letter of the patriarch of the Holy Phoenix Clan, this is the most proof of his identity, logically speaking, Huang Tianhao should have displayed it immediately.","However, he was obviously the patriarch himself, but he didn't do this.","Huang Sanbai immediately guessed, thinking that Huang Tianhao's meridians and primordial spirit were severely damaged under his various tortures, and he might even be unable to mobilize the profound energy in his body to manipulate the patriarch's seal.","After all, using such a Magical Artifact-level Spiritual Artifact requires a huge amount of profound energy to be used once. Even if the cultivation level is not close, even if the fusion is successful, it will not be able to exert the power of the Seal.","He thought it was a sign that Huang Tianhao's time was running out.","Never dreamed that he didn't show this seal because he had already given it to Huang Yueli!","He had no doubts that Huang Yueli had the strength to integrate Yinxin.","Because, no one knows better than him how perverted a god-level talent really is!","However, it is too late to realize that the situation is wrong.","Surrounded by so many elders and a lot of masters of the Hanging Sea, it was completely impossible for him to stop Huang Yueli.","Standing in the center of the arena, Huang Yueli slowly stretched out her right hand and made a formula under the gaze of hundreds of thousands of fighters.","Almost at the same moment, a red halo appeared between her eyebrows.","This halo quickly brightened, and soon people couldn't open their eyes.","On the contrary, the surging fire attribute energy also poured out with the appearance of this halo, making all the warriors present feel an unspeakable sense of oppression.","After the strong light receded, a small seal was suspended in mid-air not far from Huang Yue.","She stretched out her hand and with a light stroke, she squeezed the seal in her hand."]},{"number":4250,"title":"Chapter 4250 The Youngest (4)","paragraphs":["\"This... is this the legendary Patriarch's seal? Is this the case with our family?\"","\"It's too far away, I really can't see clearly? But, looking at it from a distance, it looks somewhat similar...\"","\"The profound energy of the heavens and the earth leaked out just now, and only when the magic weapon is in the world, can such a scene appear. I think it's probably enough.\"","\"Although that's the case, whether this seal is true or not, we can only wait for the members of the Sacred Phoenix Clan to judge for themselves, right?\"","In the stands, the cultivators were discussing endlessly.","But the elders of the Sacred Phoenix Clan were already stiff all over, their eyes widened, they stared at the seal in Huang Yueli's hand without blinking, not even daring to breathe.","They have all seen the Patriarch's seal, and standing very close, they can see it much more clearly than others.","They can almost determine that this is the Patriarch's seal handed down from generation to generation by the Sacred Phoenix Clan.","It's just that all of this happened so suddenly and unexpectedly that they couldn't come back to their senses no matter what.","In the bottom of my heart, countless questions were still circling over and over again.","Why is this seal in Huang Yueli's hands, and why has she successfully recognized the Lord with a drop of blood?","Could it be that the miserable-looking beggar beside her is really Huang Tianhao?","Could it be that what Huang Tianhao said is true? Was he really tortured into this state by Huang Sanbai? Is Huang Sanbai the family traitor?","But...how is it possible? !","All of this was so bizarre that they couldn't figure it out. They all seemed to have been petrified.","At this moment, Huang Yueli's expression suddenly changed.","The temperament on his body also changed suddenly.","The originally elegant and calm girl suddenly became cold and severe, and a cold light flickered in her big beautiful eyes.","She sneered coldly: \"What are you all doing in a daze? The Patriarch of the Sacred Phoenix Clan is here, why don't you hurry up and see him?\"","As soon as the words fell, several elders around Huang Sanbai were shocked.","Immediately afterwards, they all knelt down and fell to the ground.","\"Old Huang Likai, elder of the Holy Phoenix Patriarch, pays homage to the new Patriarch.\"","\"Subordinate Huang Changdong...\"","\"Subordinates...\"","These elders themselves did not expect that they would be subdued in front of Huang Yueli so quickly.","However, at that moment just now, they were all overwhelmed by Huang Yueli's eyes and aura, and completely forgot that they were all dignified Dao Profound Realm experts, and Huang Yueli was just a little girl under twenty years old.","With a buzz in his mind, he knelt down on the ground.","The elders couldn't help but secretly startled.","They knew very well that there was not only the coercion of the Patriarch's seal in Huang Yueli's hand, but more importantly, Huang Yueli's own strong aura.","She... is destined to exist as a superior!","Huang Sanbai was also stunned by the scene in front of him, but instead of kneeling down, he subconsciously jumped up and turned around to run away.","Now, Huang Yueli has proven her identity, and has even been easily recognized by other elders in the clan.","His crimes can no longer be concealed.","Escape!","He can only run away!","Huang Yueli has been paying attention to Huang Sanbai's movements. Seeing his figure swaying, she immediately shouted: \"Come on, stop Huang Sanbai, a family traitor, he wants to escape!\"","Only then did the elders come to their senses, and quickly stood up."]},{"number":4251,"title":"Chapter 4251 The Youngest (5)","paragraphs":["The elders rushed forward, wanting to take Huang Sanbai down.","However, it was all for naught.","Huang Sanbai did get up, and was indeed preparing to escape, but his actions were unexpected.","He didn't turn around and run towards the entrance, but rushed towards Huang Yueli.","Huang Sanbai suddenly attacked Huang Yueli with a palm strike. Although his palm strike was sudden, it had been accumulated for a long time, and the concentrated profound energy was very strong, using more than 80% of his skills.","Huang Yueli hurriedly raised her hand to defend. Although it was still in time, there was still a gap in cultivation between the two of them, so she was forced to take a few steps back.","Huang Sanbai did not continue to chase, as he quickly turned around and reached out to grab Huang Tianhao!","He knew early on that he was surrounded by masters, and with his own strength, it was impossible to contend with so many elders in the Dao Profound Realm. Even if he wanted to escape, it would not be so easy.","Therefore, his plan from the beginning was to take Huang Tianhao down first, hold him hostage, and force Huang Yueli to let him go.","Although the elders of the Sacred Phoenix Clan obeyed Huang Yueli's order, they planned to arrest Huang Sanbai.","However, most of them still can't believe that Huang Sanbai can do such a thing as murdering the Patriarch and a god-level genius.","After several times of hesitation, they still couldn't react at all.","Huang Sanbai forced Huang Yueli to retreat. Seeing that no one was following, he was overjoyed, knowing that there was hope for his escape today.","Huang Tianhao also realised at this time that Huang Sanbai was coming for him.","However, his current strength is not even at the peak. Under Huang Sanbai's ferocious attack, he had no room to resist at all.","Seeing that he was about to be taken away, Huang Tianhao closed his eyes almost in despair.","At this moment, a sharp lightning flashed in front of him.","Huang Sanbai was caught off guard, under this powerful attack, he was forced to take a few steps back!","He widened his eyes in horror, and looked at Li Moying in disbelief.","Huang Yueli's identity has been completely exposed, this Young Master of the Cloudy Qilin Clan has yet to draw a line with her, and dares to fight for her blatantly!","Li Moying's expression was cold, but the attack did not stop. One after another thunder and lightning repeatedly lit up, and the attacks became fiercer in succession!","The thunder attribute was the most powerful attack attribute, even the fire attribute was not as good, Huang Sanbai could only turn around in a hurry to avoid Li Moying's attack.","However, with this, he missed the best timing to capture Huang Tianhao.","Huang Yueli had already adjusted her breathing, turned around and rushed over, and joined hands with Li Moying to attack Huang Sanbai.","Huang Sanbai wasn't able to take advantage when he was facing Li Moying alone. Now that Huang Yueli had joined in, he found it even harder to hold on.","Seeing that it was impossible to hold Huang Tianhao hostage, Huang Sanbai decisively chose to give up, turned around and wanted to escape.","However, in the net that Huang Yueli and Li Moying jointly set up, escape was impossible.","As soon as his body swayed, Huang Yueli saw his plan.","\"Huang Sanbai, do you still want to escape? Leave it to me!\"","Huang Yueli let out a cold snort, and the fire dragon rushed towards Huang Sanbai's back!","Huang Sanbai quickened his pace, using all his strength to display the profound movement technique, but at this moment, a dazzling light curtain flashed in front of his eyes.","Before he could stop in time, he bumped into Li Moying's power grid!"]},{"number":4252,"title":"Chapter 4252 The Youngest (6)","paragraphs":["\"Boom...!!\"","A deafening loud noise resounded.","Huang Sanbai was directly sent flying as the thunder and fire radiated each other.","After a while, he finally fell from the sky and landed on the ground with a resonating bang.","The gravel on the ground was blown up by his falling weight, and there was even a human-shaped pit on the field.","\"My Goodness...\"","It wasn't until then that the audience in the stands came to their senses.","Just now, from Huang Yueli intimidating the Elders of the Sacred Phoenix Clan, to her ordering everyone to capture Huang Sanbai, to Huang Sanbai's intention to hold Huang Tianhao hostage, until his plan failed to escape and was injured by Huang Yueli and Li Moying.","This series of changes happened too fast.","In just one stick of incense, every breath seems to be filled with various twists and turns.","The surrounding cultivators were all stunned. Everyone stared at the group of people from the Sacred Phoenix Clan, fearing that they would miss something important, so they couldn't even talk about it.","Now, Huang Sanbai had landed on the ground, apparently unable to run away, so everyone let out a long breath.","\"It turns out that Huang Sanbai really did it! I never expected that he would be such a person. When I met him before, I still felt that he was an upright person, worthy of deep friendship!\"","\"Hey, we know people's faces but not their hearts. We are all outsiders, so how do we know how he behaves in daily life?\"","\"However, he is so respected in the Sacred Phoenix Clan, and the Patriarch Huang also respects him very much. Who knew that he would actually betray the Clan! Why is there such a shameless person in the world? He even poured dirty water on Young Master Li and Young Miss Huang!\"","\"If it weren't for her outstanding strength and fate, she was able to escape from birth. I'm afraid this traitor would really become the Patriarch of the Sacred Phoenix Clan!\"","Even cultivators from other forces were so excited, let alone cultivators from the Sacred Phoenix Clan.","All the clansmen at the scene, led by the elder Huang Likai, walked up to Huang Yueli and saluted her.","\"Meet the Matriarch!\"","Huang Yueli raised her hand, \"No need for formalities everyone, a few people are to tie up Huang Sanbai, and bring him back to the Clan. His crimes will be officially announced in front of the Clan altar and then he will be executed. However, you still have to be careful. Be extra vigilant, Huang Sanbai is insidious and cunning, don't let him take advantage of the loopholes and escape.\"","Huang Likai hurriedly said: \"Don't worry, Matriarch, we absolutely dare not neglect.\"","He personally brought a few young cultivators there and tied Huang Sanbai up.","Huang Sanbai was hit hard by Huang Yueli and Li Moying just now, and was seriously injured. Until now, he was unconscious, tied up and dragged down.","Huang Yueli glanced at the remaining Elders.","Several people lowered their heads in panic, and said with apologetic smiles: \"Matriarch, we were deceived by the traitor Huang Sanbai just now, please forgive us for offending you!\"","\"I blame Huang Sanbai for being too shameless, to dare to pour dirty water on you, he's simply incorrigible!\"","\"It's all right now. You exposed his true colours and saved the former Patriarch. What a blessing for the Clan!\"","Huang Yueli glanced at their faces one by one, and smiled noncommittally.","Just now, when she confronted Huang Sanbai, she had already seen it.","There were several of them here who had a good relationship with Huang Sanbai.","Although, now that Huang Sanbai has been accused of being a traitor, it was impossible for anyone to dare to get involved with him again.","However, it doesn't mean they will be convinced by Huang Yueli."]},{"number":4253,"title":"Chapter 4253 The Championship Belongs To You, You Belong To Me (1)","paragraphs":["But in the final analysis, she, the Matriarch, suddenly appeared, at such a young age. Not to mention, she had never been to the Clan.","These people must have reservations about her.","Maybe, some people still have their own schemes in mind.","It's just that, under the common attention of all major forces in the God Realm, even if they had any thoughts, it was not suitable to show them on such an occasion. That's why these Elders chose to submit to her so quickly.","However, such loyalty was probably only temporary.","If she was reassuring these people now, she would be so stupid, she would not make such a mistake!","At this moment, the farce of the Sacred Phoenix Clan had finally settled.","Huang Yueli was going to leave with the members of the Sacred Phoenix Clan.","But at this moment, an extremely powerful coercion descended from the sky and landed in the middle of the competition field.","All the cultivators present were affected by such a powerful force, and they couldn't breathe.","Even the Elders of the Dao Profound Realm from all the major forces blushed and felt quite uncomfortable.","The Left Protector and the Right Protector showed a horrified look on their faces, and hurriedly led a group of stewards behind them to kneel down on the ground.","\"We have met the Island Master. Welcome the Island Master!\"","Huang Yueli and Li Moying looked at each other, and only then did they react.","It's no wonder that the visitor has such an astonishing aura. The coercion of profound force was both strong yet mellow, like a mountain pressing down on the top, slowly suppressing but it made people completely powerless to resist!","This... was a realm that only those who were strong in the Life Profound Realm could achieve.","The figure of the Island Master fell from mid-air and stood in the middle of the arena, looking around at the crowd.","Luo Chenxi and Li Moying felt something in their hearts, and they also bowed in salute.","\"My Lord, I have long admired your name!\"","Although they were not Floating Sea's people, a peerless powerhouse like the Island Master was an existence worthy of incomparable respect for any cultivator.","They bowed to him, and they were also convinced.","What's more, before the God Realm's Grand Meet, the Island Master sent the Right Protector to send Huang Yueli an array pattern, which made Huang Yueli have a good impression of him.","This time they were able to see this legendary Life Profound Realm expert with their own eyes, which made the two feel a little excited.","The Island Master glanced over Huang Yueli and Li Moying, his eyes showed some approval, and he nodded secretly.","He turned to the Left and Right Protectors, and said, \"Didn't you just send someone to send me a message, saying that the situation on the field is urgent and out of control? Now it seems that this is not the case?\"","The Right Protector hastily stepped out and reported: \"Island Master, please hear us out. Just now, Huang Sanbai and Huang Yueli of the Sacred Phoenix Clan accused each other of being traitors to the Clan. Now Young Miss Huang has taken control of the situation, and has also been confirmed by the previous Patriarch, and has officially become the Matriarch of the Sacred Phoenix Clan.\"","\"This subordinate failed to report to you in time, causing you to make a trip in vain. It really deserves death!\"","The Island Master raised his eyebrows, looked at Huang Yueli, and thought to himself.","Unexpectedly... at such a young age, she became the Matriarch of the Sacred Phoenix Clan! Huang Sanbai was so scheming yet he couldn't hurt her at all... It is said that all the god-level geniuses are the children of heaven, and their luck was extremely high. No matter what kind of tribulations they encountered, they could save themselves from danger. Looking at it now, is it really the case?","Being stared at by such a powerful Fate Profound Realm expert, Huang Yueli's back started to tingle."]},{"number":4254,"title":"Chapter 4254 The Championship Belongs To You, You Belong To Me (2)","paragraphs":["In the competition held by others, she blatantly shot, not only interrupted the normal schedule, but also fought with Huang Sanbai!","If the Island Master was less generous, he might really be unhappy about it.","Thinking of this, Huang Yueli stood up and bowed to the Island Master.","\"Island Master, what are your orders?\"","Only then did the Island Master come back to his senses, and said calmly, \"Ordering... that's out of the question. However, the God Realm's Grand Meet finals are not over yet, and now, your personal grievances have also been resolved. Shouldn't it be time to release the venue? \"","\"Ah... that's right, it's still the God Realm's Grand Meet!\"","\"Oh my gosh, I... I forgot about this!\"","\"Me too...\"","Many spectators only woke up like a dream at this time, remembering why they were sitting here.","The internal strife of the Sacred Phoenix Clan just now was so exciting that they had long forgotten the unfinished competition.","In the past, the ranking of the champion and runner-up in the God Realm's Grand Meet was one of the most important news in the God Realm, and people could talk about it for a year or so.","But this year's competition was unparalleled. Everyone didn't even care about who the final winner was, and they were all focused on staring at Huang Yueli and the others.","Huang Yueli hurriedly said: \"Yes, I was negligent. Let's leave the arena right now so that the competition can continue.\"","She led a group of people from the Sacred Phoenix Clan and stepped back.","Li Moying stayed in the middle of the arena.","Although the finals are not over yet, in fact, there were only two competitions left.","One of them was the semi-finals.","Among the top four, the match between Huang Yueli and Huang Beicheng ended long ago, and ended with Huang Beicheng being seriously injured.","The competition between Li Moying and an earth attribute genius of the Jade Toad Clan did not take place in time.","When they decide the winner, the winner will compete with Huang Yueli in the championship and runner-up finals.","These were the only two competitions left.","Following the referee's order, the cultivators of the Jade Toad Clan jumped down from their seats.","However, he didn't really want to compete with Li Moying, but directly chose to abstain from the competition.","Once, before the start of the semi-finals, he also thought that if he had to compete seriously with Li Moying, even if he couldn't win, his ability to enter the semi-finals showed his strength. He could at least compete with Li Moying for a while, just like the cultivator from the Primordial Chaos Clan just now, showing his face in front of the major forces in the God Realm present.","However, after seeing the scene where Li Moying and Huang Yueli teamed up to severely injure Huang Sanbai just now, he decisively decided that it would be safer to abandon the match.","A god-level genius was simply too strong!","That's the strength engraved in the blood, and the gap can't be bridged by hard work.","Besides, Li Moying just went through a big battle, so he definitely won't be as patient as he was at the beginning of the finals, maybe he will be sent flying with a slap.","When the time comes, he will be ashamed and lose face, it won't be worth it!","After a thorough consideration, the cultivator of the Jade Toad Clan resolutely chose to give up.","\"In the second round of the semi-final, the winner is Li Moying from the Cloudy Qilin Clan.\"","\"Next, there is the most exciting... the finals!\"","As soon as they heard the word 'finals', the audience in the stands became excited again, and turned their attention to the arena.","Every final of the God Realm's Grand Meet was a wonderful performance presented by a peerless genius.","However, this time, everyone was actually not interested in the performance of both sides in the competition."]},{"number":4255,"title":"Chapter 4255 The Championship Belongs To You, You Belong To Me (3)","paragraphs":["What everyone wants to know more is, between Li Moying and Huang Yueli... who can become the champion of this God Realm's Grand Meet?","\"In terms of strength, Young Master Li should be stronger, right? He is already at the late stage of the Heart Profound Realm, while Matriarch Huang is only at the middle stage of the Heart Profound Realm.\"","\"It's hard to say, but Matriarch Huang is also a god-level genius! As far as I know, god-level geniuses can burst into strength several times stronger than their own cultivation level. Just looking at the cultivation level is obviously inaccurate. It is difficult to say who is stronger.\"","\"I don't think it's possible. After all, Matriarch Huang is younger, but with the same talent, the older one must be stronger, right?\"","\"No, no, you don't understand. Let me tell you, the possibility of Matriarch Huang's victory is 100%! Didn't you watch the rematch a few days ago? At that time, Young Master Li took the initiative to allow Matriarch Huang to advance smoothly. Let her beat him away and give up his first position.\"","\"I remember it too! Young Master Li is a saint of love, and he loves his wife as much as his own life! Not to mention that he may not be able to defeat her, even if he is really stronger, he will not compete with Matriarch Huang.\"","Even the Island Master had a playful smile on his face, looking back and forth at the pair of beautiful ladies standing opposite each other on the field.","\"Haha, that's interesting. Who will win?\"","\"Now, let's enter the long-awaited finals of the God Realm's Grand Meet and runner-up! The moment to determine the strongest genius in the God Realm of this generation is coming, so don't blink!\"","\"On both sides of the battle, one is the young master of the Cloudy Qilin Clan, Li Moying, a well-known god-level genius. Within two years, his reputation has spread throughout the God Realm. Being in the early stage of the Heart Profound Realm, here is someone who has killed a Sky Devil mid-phase. This is the record of a strong man! Now, his cultivation has entered the late stage of Heart Profound Realm, and he has never lost in battles between his peers.\"","\"And the other one is the new Matriarch of the Sacred Phoenix Clan, Huang Yueli! Before today, Matriarch Huang was not well-known, but today, shocking news broke out one after another. It turns out that she is also a god-level genius! Although she doesn't have such a record as Young Master Li, but her talent and age are enough to shock people.\"","\"Who will be the champion?\"","\"Now...championship begins!\"","The referee signalled for them to start.","However, he two people standing opposite each other did not make any movement.","After pausing for a few breaths, Li Moying suddenly said: \"I give up...\"","At the same moment, Huang Yueli suddenly moved.","She was extremely fast and her movements were very secretive. She was fully prepared now.","Therefore, even Li Moying, who knew her very well, did not react for a while.","He subconsciously took a few steps back and dodged his wife's attack.","But with such a move, he couldn't finish what he said when it came to his mouth.","Huang Yueli had a plan in advance. After forcing her husband back with one move, she immediately shouted loudly: \"I give up!!!\"","As soon as this statement came out, the audience was in an uproar.","Although many people had doubted it just now, would this loving young couple really fight to the death for the title of champion when they get to the arena?","However, most people don't actually think that the two will make concessions to each other.","Because, for most cultivators, competition was competition and friendship was friendship.","When the brothers arrived on the field, they had to decide the winner. This was for the sake of their dignity as cultivators!","As a cultivator, especially a god-level genius that everyone admires, how could he not even give up face?"]},{"number":4256,"title":"Chapter 4256 The Championship Belongs To You, You Belong To Me (4)","paragraphs":["However, the two people on the field were just different from what they thought.","No one expected that not only did they not fight, but they even rushed to admit defeat!","Everyone calmed down for a while before finally accepting the fact and quickly looking towards the arena again.","This glance rendered the spectators dumbfounded once more.","Huang Yueli, who lost the competition, was not at all depressed, sad, or entangled as a runner-up should be. Instead, she looked at her husband with a triumphant smile on her face, like a little fox.","\"This time, I finally took the lead!\"","She was also very depressed because she can't win her husband every time, alright?","But Li Moying, who had clearly won, looked annoyed and glared at his wife several times unwillingly.","\"Little Li'er, do you want to compete with me for this? You obviously didn't lose, but you just admit defeat. Isn't this appropriate?\"","Huang Yueli pursed her lips, blinked her big eyes, and said matter-of-factly, \"You are indeed stronger than me, right? Even if we compete, I will definitely lose, so I might as well throw in the flag earlier to save some face. Tell me, do you really care about me?\"","Li Moying gritted his teeth, \"What are you talking about? You clearly know that even if we have a serious fight, you will not lose!\"","\"How is it possible? Do you want me to do it? What's the point of that? We can't ignore the rules of the game and we can't fake the game, you know?\" Huang Yueli tilted her head and educated her husband with a smile.","Li Moying became even more annoyed and glared at her, \"You obviously know...\"","\"What do you know?\" Huang Yueli raised her chin and asked deliberately.","She clearly knew that it was really impossible for her to lose.","Because, the moment the two of them met, he lost. From the past to the present, it was impossible to win.","Huang Yueli looked at Li Moying's eyes and instantly understood what he meant, with a faint smile overflowing from the corner of her mouth.","She knew that with so many people present, it was impossible for the arrogant Young Master Li to speak out. Let alone here, even if they were alone, he might not be able to say such disgusting words of love.","But it would be good if she knew in her heart.","Huang Yueli raised his head and said with a smile: \"Do you think I am such a kind person that I would give up the championship to others casually? To tell you the truth, I am making a deal with you! The championship belongs to you, and you... belong to me! Do you agree?\"","Li Moying was startled, then laughed, \"Can I not agree?\"","\"No, you can't!\"","The intimate conversation between the two on the stage was only briefly heard by the referee, the Island Master and others who were closer.","The audience was so far away that it was impossible to hear.","However, just seeing the two of them so close and the expressions on their faces when they spoke made people feel a stomach ache.","What are these two people here for? Show affection?","To be able to turn the venue of the God Realm's Grand Meet's into a place to show affection, they were really not ordinary people!","God-level geniuses... were indeed extraordinary!","The referee was so stuffed with so much public display of affection and it was so sweet which made his teeth ache. He reluctantly stood up and announced: \"Well... the winner of this God Realm's Grand Meet is... Li Moying from the Cloudy Qilin Clan! The runner-up is from the Sacred Phoenix Clan . Huang Yueli! Congratulations to both of you! After the competition, the rewards will be sent to the two clans by a dedicated person.\"","Huang Yueli waved her hand and said with a smile: \"Don't send them wrongly, both prizes will be sent to the Sacred Phoenix Clan!\""]},{"number":4257,"title":"Chapter 4257 The Championship Belongs To You, You Belong To Me (5)","paragraphs":["The referee was stunned for a while and then nodded, \"Uh... I understand.\"","Huang Yueli smiled, took the initiative to hold her husband's hand, and prepared to leave.","Liu Buyan followed behind.","Seeing that everything had settled, the game was over, and the dispute between the Sacred Phoenix Clan had come to a conclusion, everyone let out a long breath.","At this moment, a scream suddenly came from mid-air.","\"Moying, stop! Where are you going? You are not really fascinated by the beauty of the Sacred Phoenix woman and want to leave with her, right?\"","Li Shihong suddenly jumped down from the private room, with an anxious look on his face.","Behind him, the elders of the Cloudy Qilin Clan and ordinary clansmen also landed on the ground, blocking Li Moying's way.","\"Yes, Young Master, how can you go with the people of the Sacred Phoenix Clan ? Have you forgotten? The Sacred Phoenix Clan is the feud of our Cloudy Qilin Clan!\"","\"Young Master, let go of that witch from the Sacred Phoenix Clan! She is clearly trying to take advantage of you, you must not fall for her!\"","\"Witch, why don't you get out of here! We were so blind that we believed you. Unexpectedly, you are actually a spy of the Sacred Phoenix Clan!\"","\"Let go of the Young Master, otherwise, we will not be polite!\"","The cultivators of the Cloudy Qilin Clan from all around spoke out frantically, talking about everything, but the central idea was to keep their Young Master!","Just now, when Li Moying suddenly descended from the sky to help Huang Yueli deal with Huang Sanbai, these cultivators were already nervous.","The Young Master of their Cloudy Qilin Clan was actually helping a woman from the Sacred Phoenix Clan!","This was simply unreasonable!","However, the situation changed too quickly at that time. Later, the Left and Right Protectors also intervened, and they had no chance to make trouble.","Initially, they thought that after the Sacred Phoenix Clan's matter was resolved, the Young Master would eventually come back, right?","But in the end, what they saw was Li Moying being held by Huang Yueli's hand, about to take him back to the Sacred Phoenix Clan !","How incredulous was this?!","This was the Young Master of their Cloudy Qilin Clan, a peerless genius with god-level talents!","The clansmen became anxious.","As the leader of the clan, Li Shihong couldn't stand still and immediately rushed down to stop them.","Li Moying looked at the sincere faces in front of him and frowned slightly.","He was not completely emotionless towards the Cloudy Qilin Clan.","In the past two years, everyone in the clan, from the Patriarch to ordinary clan members, have treated him very well.","If possible, he naturally does not want to be an enemy of the family.","However, if he had to choose between the Cloudy Qilin Clan and Little Li'er, he would definitely choose Huang Yueli without even thinking about it!","Besides, they actually called Little Li'er a witch...","No matter who said this, he couldn't stand it.","If he hadn't remembered that these were his people, he would have been tempted to teach them a lesson!","He remained silent, and Huang Yueli did not urge him.","She knew that her husband was in a difficult situation now.","Although she just said, \"The championship is yours, and you are mine,\" she would not blame him if Li Moying was reluctant to leave his clan now.","My husband has greater pursuits and values love and justice, which is a good thing.","As long as he doesn't look at other women.","However, Huang Yueli didn't express anything, but the people of the Sacred Phoenix Clan around her became excited.","\"Hey, guys from the Cloudy Qilin Clan, what are you doing here? Are you planning to rob someone by force?\""]},{"number":4258,"title":"Chapter 4258 The Championship Belongs To You, You Belong To Me (6)","paragraphs":["\"That's right! Isn't this too funny? Young Master Li is a living person, not a thing. He goes wherever he wants. Why do you stop him?\"","\"Haha, when our Patriarch was in the Cloudy Qilin Clan, why didn't we see you say that there was a feud between the two clans and send people back to us?\"","\"That is, you are only allowed to take advantage of having two god-level geniuses, but we, the Sacred Phoenix Clan, are not allowed to have two?\"","\"It can only be said that our Patriarch is too charming. Young Master Li just can't live without her. Why?\"","To be honest, the cultivators of the Sacred Phoenix Clan were quite reluctant to see Li Moying and Huang Yueli together at first.","Li Moying was indeed very strong, but he was also from the Cloudy Qilin Clan!","Let the Young Master of the Cloudy Qilin Clan become the husband of their Patriarch? This is simply unimaginable!","Besides, he was probably just pretending to be deeply in love with Huang Yueli, but he was actually working as a spy for the Sacred Phoenix Clan !","If such a powerful expert is allowed to enter the Sacred Phoenix Clan, if any secrets are leaked, it will be too late to cry!","However, just when they were about to make a sound to drive away Li Moying, the cultivators of the Cloudy Qilin Clan appeared.","Seeing that they wanted to snatch people back, the mentality of the cultivators of the Sacred Phoenix Clan suddenly changed subtly.","His attitude towards Li Moying was completely reversed.","If someone grabs it, it means it is popular!","Regardless of whether it's useful or not, let's grab first!","Being able to see the frustrated expressions of those guys from the Cloudy Qilin Clan, at least it feels good now!","With this mentality, the cultivators of the Sacred Phoenix Clan jumped out one after another and started to fight with the cultivators of the Cloudy Qilin Clan.","The situation got so out of control that the two sides almost started fighting.","Fortunately, this was on the territory of Floating Sea.","Moreover, the Island Master was still at the scene.","He just coughed lightly and released 10% of his profound power to control the situation and silenced both sides immediately.","The Island Master turned to Li Moying and said, \"Young Master Li, can you give me an accurate answer? Otherwise, the two clans will continue to argue, which will inevitably leave hidden dangers in the future, which will not be a good thing for you and Miss Huang.\"","As soon as the Island Master spoke, everyone fell silent.","Li Moying was also flattered and bowed to him.","\"Thank you, Island Master, for taking care of me. I'll explain it to them right now.\"","Li Moying took a few steps forward, walked to Li Shihong, and bowed in salute.","\"Patriarch, I'm very sorry, I have to leave with my wife today.\"","Li Shihong's eyes showed a look of astonishment, \"You... what are you... what are you doing? Is there anything wrong with you from the Cloudy Qilin Clan? You actually want to leave the family for a woman? Do you think, When you get to the Sacred Phoenix Clan , will they really let you marry Huang Yueli? Don't be too naive!\"","\"The Sacred Phoenix Clan will never accept a son-in-law from the Cloudy Qilin Clan. Do you know that your end will be miserable?\"","He really wanted to shake Li Moying awake and listen to the sound of water in his head!","Is there any mistake? How could someone actually ignore the great future of becoming the leader of the ancient God Clan and risk their lives to follow a woman and work for her?","Maybe there really is such a love saint in the God Realm, but before today, Li Shihong never thought that Li Moying would make such a choice!","How could such a calm, self-possessed and steady genius boy become like this?"]},{"number":4259,"title":"Chapter 4259 The Championship Belongs To You, You Belong To Me (7)","paragraphs":["Li Shihong's regret and annoyance were beyond words.","However, Li Moying still looked very calm and shook his head gently.","\"Patriarch, you misunderstood. I have no intention of leaving the family. There is something I haven't mentioned to you before. In fact, Little Li'er and I are not an unmarried couple, but a real couple! We were already married when we were in the lower realm.\"","\"What?!!\"","Hearing this, everyone present was surprised.","Not to mention the cultivators from the Cloudy Qilin Clan and the Sacred Phoenix Clan , even the eyeballs of ordinary cultivators in the stands almost fell out.","\"So, they ascended from the same lower realm!!\"","\"A low-level plane actually produced two god-level geniuses at the same time? Did I hear wrongly?\"","\"It's crazy! It's ridiculously incredible!\"","Li Shihong was even more stunned and couldn't come back to his senses for a long time.","He always thought that Li Moying should have rescued Huang Yueli who was being chased by Huang Sanbai on the way back from the Soul Connection Ocean. The two god-level geniuses both ascended from the lower realm and were not aware of the hatred between their clans.","In addition, both parties have equal talents and strengths, and they were a pair of outstandingly talented and beautiful people. Sparks flew the moment they met and fell for each other.","As a result, who would have known that the fate between the two was much deeper than he imagined!","If they had only known each other for a few months, it would be easy to break them up.","However, now it seems that the two of them have known each other for such a long time and were even officially married. This... it was very difficult to separate the two of them!","\"You...but...but, she is from the Sacred Phoenix Clan!\"","\"When I met Little Li'er, she was not from the Sacred Phoenix Clan nor was I from the Cloudy Qilin Clan. We were just two ordinary cultivators in the lower realm. At that time, we loved each other and vowed to stay together no matter what happens in the future. , we will always be united and we will never be separated in life or death. Now, in the God Realm, it is still the same. No matter how our identities change, the vows we made will not change.\"","Li Moying's voice was calm. When he spoke, he didn't even look at Huang Yueli, and there was no expression on his face.","It seems that what he said was completely irrelevant.","However, every cultivator who heard his confession showed a stunned expression.","Some young female cultivators even had tears in their eyes, obviously very moved.","Huang Yueli squeezed her husband's hand, blinked her big eyes, and blinked back the tears.","She also stood up and said: \"This is the fact, so I also want to make it clear to the people of the Sacred Phoenix Clan that if you don't accept my husband, I will not return to the Sacred Phoenix Clan .\"","There were several elders of the Sacred Phoenix Clan who actually reject Li Moying.","However, now that they were arguing with the Cloudy Qilin Clan, they couldn't bear to disagree with everyone on the spot, so they held it in for a while.","Originally, I had planned to make it clear to Huang Yueli before leaving the arena.","But now, after hearing Huang Yueli's words, these people looked at each other and felt a little nervous.","Li Moying turned his head and smiled at his little fox, then turned his head and faced Li Shihong again.","\"Patriarch, you don't have to think about things too complicated. I'm just accompanying my wife back to her parents' home once to support her. If you can accept her, I will naturally return to the clan after I handle the matters with the Sacred Phoenix Clan. I'll do what I should do and fulfill my responsibilities.\""]},{"number":4260,"title":"Chapter 4260 The Championship Belongs To You, You Belong To Me (8)","paragraphs":["Having said this, Li Moying paused.","\"But if you can't accept it...then I won't go back.\"","\"That's all I have to say. I don't want to embarrass my fellow clansmen, so please don't embarrass me either.\"","The cultivators of the Cloudy Qilin Clan were completely shocked by the news just now.","For a moment, no one was able to react as they stood there stumped. In fact, they did not even know how to react!","If the person who betrayed the clan now was an ordinary member of the clan, Li Shihong would have not even bothered with any words by now and would have expelled the person from the clan, and it was possible that he might even order the traitor to be hunted down.","But the problem is, the person who was going to the Sacred Phoenix Clan with his wife now was Li Moying!","It takes tens of thousands of years for a clan to produce a god-level genius!","After returning to the clan for two years, he has been showing amazing talents and abilities, and was about to become the backbone of the clan!","If he was really expelled from the clan, he might turn around and really concentrate on being the son-in-law of the Sacred Phoenix Clan wholeheartedly.","If that really happened, it would truly be an unbearable and heavy loss for the Cloudy Qilin Clan!","The Sacred Phoenix Clan had two god-level geniuses for no reason, crushing the Cloudy Qilin Clan.","Why?","Unwilling! That was definitely the thought that crossed their minds!","If things reached this point, it would really be a dilemma for the Cloudy Qilin Clan.","Not to mention how proud the Sacred Phoenix Clan was, some young cultivators could no longer laugh.","\"Oh my goodness, I was depressed before. Why did the Cloudy Qilin Clan have two god-level geniuses and we didn't have one? Now in the blink of an eye, two god-level geniuses belong to us. This is really a turn of events! \"","\"The people of the Cloudy Qilin Clan are so ignorant. Instead of hurrying to support a god-level genius, they actually care about who the genius is going to marry. Hah! I really wonder what they are thinking?!\"","\"That's right, I will support Young Master Li with all my hands and feet in joining the Sacred Phoenix Clan!\"","These were young people who enjoy watching the excitement and don't take it too seriously.","Of course, the older generation of clan members would not accept Li Moying so easily.","However, in this situation, they will definitely not jump out and sing the opposite.","The faces of everyone on the Cloudy Qilin Clan's side became increasingly ugly.","Li Moying secretly sighed, \"Anyway... I will never ignore clan matters. Little Li'er and I... will have a wedding in the God Realm in a while. If you can accept it, come and participate. If you can't accept it, then forget it...\"","He didn't say anything further, but everyone present understood.","If any of the two families cannot accept his marriage to Huang Yueli, then none of these two god-level geniuses will be available!","The scene suddenly fell silent.","Li Moying didn't say anything more, but turned to look at his wife.","\"Little Li'er, let's go back first? I think the injuries of Senior Huang and Huang Beicheng can't be delayed for too long.\"","\"Ah!\" Huang Yueli came back to her senses, \"Yes, you are right, let's go back first. If anything happens, we'll talk about it after we settle down.\"","She glanced at Li Shihong, who was looking dull, and her mood was a bit complicated.","Huang Likai was the first Elder to express his loyalty to the new Matriarch.","At this time, he was also very discerning, and immediately stood up and said: \"Matriarch, Young Master Li, our Sacred Phoenix Clan's rest area is not far from the arena. Please come with me and to rest before talking about anything else. \"","Huang Yueli nodded, \"That's very good.\"","Huang Likai led the way, and the two of them followed slowly.","Liu Buyan looked around, followed the Sacred Phoenix Clan's team, and left together."]},{"number":4261,"title":"Chapter 4261 Forming an Alliance (1)","paragraphs":["The finals of the God Realm's Grand Meet have finally come to an end.","Until Huang Yueli and others disappeared, many people still couldn't come back to their senses and were still reminiscing about the scene that had just happened.","In this competition, too many things happened, and the audience witnessed countless amazing scenes.","For a long time in the future, these will become the topics of conversation for them outside.","Huang Yueli and Li Moying followed Huang Likai and others, left the arena and boarded the Sacred Phoenix Clan's carriage.","Just as he was about to leave, he heard a familiar voice coming from behind.","\"Young Master, Young Madame, please stay!\"","Li Moying was startled for a moment, then turned around and saw Li Tianyi rushing over with his other personal bodyguards.","He frowned, \"Why are you here?\"","Li Tianyi bowed and clasped his fists in salute, and said respectfully: \"Young Master, you and the Young Madame are going to the Sacred Phoenix Clan. There was no point in us staying in the clan, so please take us with you!\"","Hearing this, Li Moying was a little surprised, and asked curiously: \"Why are you following me? If you are going for training or something, I will naturally take you with me, but this time, I am going to the Sacred Phoenix Clan! Did you get it right? Are you really planning to go to the Sacred Phoenix Clan with me?\"","Li Moying never considered taking Li Tianyi and the others there.","Even in order to prevent these guards from being embarrassed in the clan, he did not even look at the guards after Huang Yueli revealed his identity, and deliberately distanced himself from them and broke off the relationship.","After all, the Sacred Phoenix Clan and the Cloudy Qilin Clan had a feud.","Although Li Tianyi and others respected him as the Young Master, they also accepted Huang Yueli, who was from the Sacred Phoenix Clan, as their mistress and treated her with great respect.","But asking them to follow the Sacred Phoenix Clan was another matter.","Li Moying was not willing to force others into trouble.","However, the attitude of Li Tianyi and others was extremely determined.","He cupped his hands and said: \"Young Master, I know your concerns, but you are so kind to us, and the Young Madame has been cultivating us. We are not ungrateful villains, and we will follow you to the death. Young Master and Young Madame! As for these people from the Sacred Phoenix Clan...\"","Li Tian paused for a moment, his face still showing a bit of confusion.","\"In short, my subordinates will not betray the clan, so they can only run errands for the Young Master and the Young Madame. Please forgive me, two masters.\"","Although Li Moying did not explicitly say that he would leave the Cloudy Qilin Clan, his and Huang Yueli's usual behaviours could not be hidden from their personal guards.","The guards had been secretly guessing when the Young Master would leave with the Young Madame.","They had already agreed that no matter where Li Moying and Huang Yueli were going, they would definitely follow them.","Huang Yueli couldn't help but laugh after hearing what they said.","\"Alright, let's see how nervous you are! I didn't mean to cause trouble, so why would I let you deal with the Cloudy Qilin Clan? Since you are willing to follow Moying, we will naturally not refuse. We will all remember your loyalty. Now, Moying and I won't make things difficult for you.\"","Li Moying did not interrupt his wife's speech as his gaze turned tender.","It wasn't until she finished speaking that he nodded to the side, \"Little Li'er is absolutely right. If you want to follow, just come. However, I want to remind you in advance that the cultivators of the Sacred Phoenix Clan will definitely not be friendly, so if there is any conflict, you must not take action privately.\"","\"Yes, I understand!\""]},{"number":4262,"title":"Chapter 4262 Forming an Alliance (2)","paragraphs":["Li Tianyi and others agreed and quickly followed Li Moying's footsteps.","The cultivators of the Sacred Phoenix Clan became a little nervous when they saw so many talented cultivators of the Cloudy Qilin Clan appearing.","They never expected that Li Moying was not the only one from the Cloudy Qilin Clan who came to the Sacred Phoenix Clan!","This was a very rare thing, and many people were secretly sizing up these Cloudy Qilin Clan cultivators.","Huang Yueli and Li Moying got on the carriage, and not long after, they arrived at the Sacred Phoenix Clan's headquarters.","After getting out of the carriage, she asked Huang Likai to arrange a room for the guards and Liu Buyan to stay.","Huang Likai nodded hurriedly in agreement, \"Yes, Matriarch, my subordinates will make arrangements right away.\" He paused and then asked: \"Then...where would Young Master Li's room be arranged?\"","Hearing this, Huang Yueli was stunned for a moment, and then said: \"There was no need to arrange it, he can live with me!\"","\"Live with you... cough cough!\"","Although there had been such a guess for a long time, when Huang Likai and the Elders around him actually heard this, they all looked constipated, as if they had been severely hit!","\"Matriarch, this isn't very good? it would be better for you and Young Master Li not to live together, right? Isn't this... a bad influence?\"","Huang Yueli gave him a strange look and said disapprovingly: \"It isn't very good? What do you mean by bad influence? Didn't you listen to what my husband just said? We were married in the lower realm! We've been married for three years now! How can there be any bad influence?\"","\"But...but...\"","Huang Likai was speechless. He always felt that something was wrong, but he didn't know how to refute.","Although they have been married for a long time, they did not hold any wedding in the God Realm!","Besides, they finally got a god-level genius, and she got married before they even got over it?","Moreover, many people in the Sacred Phoenix Clan simply do not want to accept Li Moying as the husband of the Matriarch. Many people were secretly thinking about driving Li Moying away and finding a husband for Huang Yueli.","As a result, the two of them now have to live in the same room!","In this way, if you want to use evil tactics to drive people away, you will never find a chance!","As soon as Huang Yueli saw the expressions of these people, she knew what they were thinking, and a sneer could not help but escape from the corner of her mouth.","Wanting to separate her and Li Moying was simply a daydream!","\"Alright, hurry up and make arrangements! Also, which room does the former Patriarch Huang Tianhao live in? Please take me there to see him first.\"","Huang Tianhao, Huang Beicheng and Huang Sanbai were all seriously injured.","Except for Huang Tianhao, who could barely walk a few steps, the other two couldn't even move freely.","The cultivators of the Sacred Phoenix Clan found three stretchers and carried the three of them back.","Upon arriving at their clan's residence, Huang Sanbai was imprisoned, while Huang Tianhao and Huang Beicheng were sent back to their rooms to recuperate.","Hearing Huang Yueli's question, Huang Likai was stunned for a moment, and then said: \"Matriarch, you just finished participating in the God Realm's Grand Meet, why don't you take a rest first?\"","Huang Yueli shook her head, \"No, let's go and see him first. Patriarch Tianhao was persecuted by Huang Sanbai and suffered serious internal injuries. I'm afraid that delaying time will further affect the treatment. I'd better go and see the situation first so that I can rest assured. \"","Hearing this, the Elders of the Sacred Phoenix Clan were touched and their expressions softened.","For a moment, their impression of Huang Yueli was much better than before.","As a Matriarch, she was so concerned about the injuries of her clan members. Such behaviour was very popular with others."]},{"number":4263,"title":"Chapter 4263 Forming an Alliance (3)","paragraphs":["However, Huang Yueli had a deeper reason for doing this.","She knew it very well, even though she now had the title of Matriarch.","However, no matter her age, her strength, or her qualifications, in fact, they were not enough to serve as the leader of the Sacred Phoenix Clan.","If she wanted to secure the position of Matriarch, in addition to thunderous methods and exquisite skills, there was also a very necessary condition, which was that you must obtain the support of the Elders with high prestige in the clan.","Now it seems that the Elders of the Sacred Phoenix Clan were obviously scheming against her. Except for Huang Likai, no one else has taken the initiative to show good intentions to her.","Even Huang Likai, who seemed to be diligent and sincere, was not a person she was sure that he was completely on her side.","Therefore, the person most likely to fully support her now was Huang Tianhao.","On the one hand, Huang Tianhao personally passed the Patriarch's seal to her. Regardless of whether he did so because of the emergency and desperation, but now that it has become a fact, Huang Tianhao must stand by his chosen successor.","On the other hand, Huang Tianhao's meridians were now damaged, his strength had dropped to a huge level, and his body was disabled. Judging from his current situation, the possibility of him controlling the Sacred Phoenix Clan again was extremely close to zero.","If he wants to gain the right to speak in the clan, he can only rely on external force, that is, Huang Yueli.","Therefore, it was very easy for the two of them to reach an alliance.","As soon as Huang Yueli arrived at the clan headquarters, she went to see a doctor for him. In addition to showing her sincerity in forming an alliance, she also really wanted to find a way to treat him.","If Huang Tianhao can be cured, it will be equivalent to getting extra insurance.","When the two of them cooperate, she will be in an absolutely dominant position.","Huang Yueli was very clear-headed. From the moment she burst into flames and attacked Huang Sanbai on the field, she had been distractedly observing the Elders and geniuses of the Sacred Phoenix Clan.","Following the carriage of the Sacred Phoenix Clan all the way back, she decided on this strategy after a few words of communication with Li Moying in the car.","Huang Likai and a group of Elders led Huang Yueli to Huang Tianhao's room.","When Huang Tianhao saw her, he seemed quite moved.","For the half-disabled person, what he was most worried about now was that he would become a has-been former Patriarch and be forgotten by the clan.","Huang Yueli saw him and said sincerely: \"Senior, thanks to you today, otherwise, I wouldn't have been able to get Huang Sanbai to plead guilty so easily. Don't worry, as long as I stay in the clan for one day, I will treat you as my own and I will respect you as I would to my master.\"","With that said, she turned her head and looked at Liu Buyan behind her, \"Senior Brother, could you please give me another diagnosis and treatment for my senior?\"","Liu Buyan nodded, walked over, sat on the edge of the bed, put his fingers on Huang Tianhao's wrist, and took the pulse seriously.","Although, before the start of the God Realm's Grand Meet, he also diagnosed and treated Huang Tianhao.","However, the situation was urgent at that time, and he could only make a rough judgement on the injuries in Huang Tianhao's body, and then gave him a tonic elixir that Huang Yueli had obtained from the Saint Iniquitous Shadow Realm.","Such a kind of elixir has limited benefits in healing injuries, but it can improve the cultivator's endurance, reduce pain, and at the same time replenish the consumed profound energy and physical strength.","In this way, Huang Tianhao could go to the arena to testify.","Now, Huang Tianhao needs to be treated seriously, and things were much more complicated."]},{"number":4264,"title":"Chapter 4264 Forming an Alliance (4)","paragraphs":["Liu Buyan sat quietly by the bed as he took his pulse, concentrating hard and stayed motionless and silent for more than half an hour.","Huang Yueli and others didn't dare to disturb him, so they just waited by the side.","Only after a long time had passed did Liu Buyan let go of Huang Tianhao's wrist.","Huang Tianhao immediately became excited, grabbed his sleeves, opened his mouth and shouted \"Ahhh\".","He now has no tongue and can't make a sound, but everyone can guess what he means, that is, he wants to inquire about his condition.","Liu Buyan glanced at him and said: \"Senior Huang, your situation was mainly due to your fundamental injury. Although the injury is not very complicated, it is very difficult to recover. Moreover, your strength may not be back to your peak again.\"","Upon hearing this, a hint of disappointment flashed in Huang Tianhao's eyes.","Liu Buyan added: \"However, there's still hope to restore the bout 80%, but it requires a large amount of heavenly materials and earthly treasures to refine and nourish. These heavenly materials and earthly treasures are very rare and difficult to obtain, and I don't know if they are available in the Sacred Phoenix Clan's warehouse. We can only wait until we return to the Sacred Phoenix Clan.\"","As soon as he finished speaking, Huang Yueli seemed to have thought of something and suddenly interrupted him.","\"I have some elixirs here that are also nourishing and effective. Senior Brother, take a look and see if they are useful?\"","She took out a few medicine bottles from her arms and handed them to Liu Buyan.","Liu Buyan opened the bottle cap and smelled them one by one, and then showed a surprised smile, \"Junior Sister, you...where did these elixirs come from? These are all heaven-level elixirs! Moreover, they even have the miraculous effect of stimulating potential and reshaping bones and meridians! This is very rare and too precious, isn't it? Aren't you going to keep it for yourself to save your life in an emergency?\"","Huang Yueli smiled and said: \"It doesn't matter, I am in the Sacred Phoenix Clan now, it's pretty safe? Where do I need help? However, this pill is very important to the senior, so let's give it to him first. \"","After hearing this, Huang Tianhao's eyes showed some emotion.","Li Moying watched from the side, secretly amused.","His little fox was pretty good, but Liu Buyan's acting skills are really too exaggerated!","Fortunately, Huang Tianhao was seriously injured at this time and his mind was a little unclear. Otherwise, would he still be able to see that the two of them were acting?","When Huang Yueli left, Huang Tianhao wished he could drag his half-broken body to see her off in person.","Huang Yueli waved her hand hurriedly, indicating that she didn't need it, turned around and left with Li Moying and the others.","Her second stop was to Huang Beicheng's room.","Huang Beicheng was once the number one genius of the Sacred Phoenix Clan, and ranked very high among the number one geniuses of the twelve major Ancient God Clans.","If Huang Yueli and Li Moying hadn't appeared out of nowhere, he would have had a good chance of competing for the first place in the God Realm's Grand Meet.","But now, he ended up half-dead because he believed Huang Sanbai's lies.","Huang Yueli felt deeply sorry for this.","\"Senior Brother, what do you think of the situation in Huang Beicheng? Can this...can it still be cured?\"","Liu Buyan's expression was obviously more solemn than before.","\"This... to be honest, his situation was much more troublesome than Huang Tianhao's. Huang Tianhao's meridians are only severely damaged. With your powerful tonic pills, even if he can't be cured, he won't die. However, the situation in Huang Beicheng is extremely dangerous. The kind of skills he practises are so overbearing. Every time he activates his potential, it not only overdraws his profound strength, but also overdraws his energy and blood!\""]},{"number":4265,"title":"Chapter 4265 Retribution (1)","paragraphs":["Hearing this, Huang Yueli couldn't help but frown.","Huang Beicheng was also very important to her.","Among the younger generations of geniuses in the clan, Huang Beicheng was the only one who can achieve such strength.","In comparison, the top geniuses in the clan are even more important than the Elders!","She thought for a moment, \"Then... Senior Brother, do you think there was any way to treat Huang Beicheng like this?\"","Liu Buyan sighed and said: \"I don't know yet. It's alright to try to treat him. However, I estimate that even if he's cured, he will probably become a useless person. His cultivation may be relegated and it'll be pathetic. It is even more impossible to return to his peak strength.\"","\"What?!\"","Although she had expected it, Huang Yueli was still shocked when she heard this.","If Huang Beicheng cannot regain his strength, it will be the same as death.","Not only was it a huge loss to the clan, it was absolutely unacceptable even to himself.","No one can accept the huge psychological gap if a genius like him, who has always had a smooth life and was superior to others, becomes a useless person who cannot practice.","It was estimated that after waking up, the first thing to do was to seek death!","Huang Yueli frowned, \"How could this happen? Senior Brother, can you still think of a solution?\"","Liu Buyan said: \"Of course I will check the medical books again, but Junior Sister, you'd better visit the famous doctors in the God Realm, maybe there will be a solution. I don't know much about the medical skills in the God Realm, although I learned from the Saint Iniquitous Shadow I learned a lot from the classics left behind by the doctor, but I still can't compare with a real miracle doctor.\"","Huang Yueli nodded, \"Oh, that's all we can do.\"","She felt disappointed for a while and was about to turn around and leave.","Li Moying suddenly stood up and walked to the bed.","\"It's better... let me take a look.\"","Hearing this, Huang Yueli and Liu Buyan were both startled.","\"You want... to treat Huang Beicheng? No way?\" Liu Buyan's eyes almost popped out.","Li Moying has never bothered to spend time on these skills. Although he was well-informed, it cannot be said that he knows nothing about medical skills. However, it was a bit unreasonable to show people such difficult and complicated diseases, right?","Li Moying didn't answer. He stretched out his hand and pressed on Huang Beicheng's pulse.","However, he was not diagnosing his pulse, but injecting evil qi from his own body into Huang Beicheng's meridians.","The evil qi flowed slowly along the veins in Huang Beicheng's body and surged toward his Dantian.","Li Moying closed his eyes slightly, said nothing, and concentrated.","Huang Yueli seemed to feel something, showing a hint of surprise, staring at Li Moying's side face without saying anything.","Liu Buyan was still chattering, not wanting to miss this rare opportunity to mock Li Moying.","\"I have to say, Young Master Li, I know that you are very talented and strong, but we still have to do things like treating people, such as elixirs. You are not a professional, so you can just treat people on the side. If you want to actually diagnose his pulse, that is absolutely not possible!\"","At this moment, Li Moying suddenly opened his eyes.","\"Alright, I know how to treat him. If you're lucky, Huang Beicheng might be able to return to his current strength. But... this may be risky, so you have to think about it carefully.\"","He looked at Huang Yueli.","Before Huang Yueli could speak, Liu Buyan screamed."]},{"number":4266,"title":"Chapter 4266 Retribution (2)","paragraphs":["\"What? What did you say? You actually know how to heal Huang Beicheng? How is that possible? You've got to be kidding!\"","Is there anything Li Moying can't do?","Even if he was strong, now he says that he can actually heal?","Moreover, even though he was usually so cold and indifferent, he was a ladies magnet!","It's simply unreasonable!","Li Moying ignored him and waited quietly for his wife to answer.","Huang Yueli frowned, \"What do you mean...\"","Li Moying used his spiritual consciousness to explore the surroundings and confirmed that no one was eavesdropping nearby. Then he lowered his voice and said, \"Huang Beicheng's body has been destroyed by devil skills, but I can feel that there was a trace of it in his body. The aura was very similar to the evil qi we refined!\"","Huang Yueli was startled, \"Evil qi? What's going on? Didn't many people see before that Huang Beicheng's technique was probably related to the devils? Could it be that you got it wrong?\"","Li Moying shook his head, \"That's not the case. According to my guess, this so-called evil qi has a very weird origin. Some time ago, the poisonous gas we came into contact with on Paradise Island was very close to evil qi, but the purity was not high. Today, I fought against the Primordial Chaos Clan's cultivator in the ring, and I also felt that the so-called dark energy and evil qi were compatible with each other. And then this time...\"","\"I just deliberately imbued the evil qi in my body into Huang Beicheng's dantian, and as expected, it successfully merged with the remaining evil qi in his body. This means that the devil qi and evil qi should also come from the same source...\"","\"What? How could this happen? So, in essence, evil qi and devil qi should be the same thing?\" Huang Yueli looked shocked.","Li Moying slowly shook his head, \"Just because we are close, it doesn't mean we agree. There was a big difference between poisonous gas and dark energy. However, I can basically confirm that these energies are all emitted from the same source. But now we don't know what the source is.\"","Huang Yueli frowned and fell into deep thought, \"I believe you can't be wrong, but if that's the case, why are there no relevant information recorded in the various classics of the God Realm? Moreover, the Devil Clan and the gods who practice evil will be suppressed and hunted by the ancient gods!\"","\"I'm afraid this involves the unknown secrets of the God Realm.\" Li Moying said thoughtfully: \"In the future, if there was a chance, we can find a way to explore...\"","The two looked at each other and saw excitement in each other's eyes.","Exploring such secrets often means danger.","However, among dangers, there are also various opportunities hidden.","The more dangerous it is, the more opportunities there are!","Therefore, for peerless geniuses like them, this opportunity to improve themselves cannot be missed.","\"It's a pity that we still have a lot of things to deal with now, and we can't get away from it.\"","Huang Yueli said regretfully: \"By the way, according to what you said, can't we use the \"Iniquitous Shadow Secret Manual\" to save Huang Beicheng? As long as the devil qi in his Dantian is refined, he can recover at least half of his cultivation. \"","\"That's what I think.\" Li Moying nodded.","Huang Yueli said thoughtfully, \"However, if you want to practice the \"Iniquitous Shadow Secret Manual\", you need a certain amount of talent. Otherwise, Saint Iniquitous Shadow would have found a successor long ago, and it would not be our turn. I don't think that Huang Beicheng has such talent.\""]},{"number":4267,"title":"Chapter 4267 Retribution (3)","paragraphs":["Li Moying said: \"This problem is easy to solve. Huang Beicheng does not need to practice to become a master of the evil way. He only needs to refine a few traces of evil qi. Therefore, he only needs to practice the first two pages of \"Iniquitous Shadow Secret Manual\" Yes, we can make some changes. The real trouble is...\"","He paused and then said: \"If Huang Beicheng notices that the technique we passed on to him is used to refine evil qis, it might arouse his suspicion and expose our practice of the \"Iniquitous Shadow Secret Manual\". It's a secret. So, it's up to you to consider whether you want to teach it to him or not.\"","After hearing what he said, Huang Yueli nodded solemnly.","\"You are right. If we expose ourselves because of this, the gain will outweigh the loss. Now, I can't see whether Huang Beicheng can be trusted. I should first find a famous doctor to treat his injuries, save his life, and teach him the skills. I have to think about it for a while.\"","After the two discussed it, they left with Liu Buyan who looked confused.","They were about to go back to their room to rest, but when they were passing by a corridor, they suddenly heard a \"bang bang bang\" sound coming from a certain room.","Huang Yueli paused and looked at a clansman on the roadside.","\"What happened?\"","When the members of the Sacred Phoenix Clan heard the new Matriarch's question, they suddenly became excited and couldn't help but look at Huang Yueli several times.","At this time, Huang Yueli had removed all her disguises, revealing her true face.","Everyone who saw her true appearance was shocked.","They had originally thought that her face in disguise was already beautiful enough, and no woman could be found more beautiful than her in the entire God Realm.","But who would have known that after she washed off the disguise, her real face would be even more beautiful than the disguise!","It's simply beyond everyone's imagination!","Huang Yueli saw the man in a daze, frowned and urged, \"Speak?\"","\"Yes, Matriarch!\" The clansman came back to his senses and hurriedly reported: \"Huang Sanbai is locked in that room.\"","Huang Yueli raised her eyebrows in confusion, \"What? He's already injured like that, and yet he's still struggling violently?\"","\"No, it's not! The news about Huang Sanbai's betrayal of the clan has been spread among all the clan members. Some clan members were so angry that they couldn't help but run to the room where he was detained. That... ahem...\"","The young clansman did not finish speaking, but the meaning of his words was quite obvious.","Those clansmen who were filled with righteous indignation must have tortured Huang Sanbai to vent their anger!","Huang Yueli blinked and let this person lead the way, followed to the room where Huang Sanbai was imprisoned.","When they opened the door, the room was full of people.","Huang Sanbai was hung on the wall, his hands and feet were tightly locked with iron chains, unable to move.","And there was not a good piece of meat on his body at this time. He was dripping with blood and looked extremely miserable.","Huang Sanbai lowered his head, his gray hair spread out, covering his face so that no one could see the expression on his face clearly.","No matter how others tortured him, he never made a sound or moved at all, and it was not known whether he had lost consciousness.","The cultivators of the Sacred Phoenix Clan surrounded him, all with angry faces.","\"Damn old thief, we really misjudged you! All these years, we have really regarded you as a respected Clan Elder. We were so blind!\"","\"When I think about how I saluted such a person before, I regret it terribly!\"","\"How can you be so shameless? A person like you still dreams of becoming a Patriarch? Bah!\""]},{"number":4268,"title":"Chapter 4268 Retribution (4)","paragraphs":["Everyone was yelling at each other and spitting on him in turn.","At this time, how could Huang Sanbai still have the immortal spirit of the Elder of an Ancient God Clan when they first met?","He has completely become a street rat that everyone shouts to beat!","Seeing this, Huang Yueli couldn't help but secretly said, \"You deserve it!\"","Huang Sanbai plotted against her many times. If she hadn't been lucky, the grass on the grave would be one metre high now.","What's even more shameless was that this insidious and cunning old man didn't say anything about what he did and did such a disgusting thing, but he also hit the target and poured dirty water on her and Li Moying.","First, it was said that Li Moying secretly murdered her and provoked hatred between the Sacred Phoenix Clan and the Cloudy Qilin Clan.","Later, he secretly tortured Huang Tianhao and blamed her for the incident, portraying her as a shameless slut who would do anything for a man!","In order to ascend to the throne of the Patriarch, Huang Sanbai did almost all the bad things he could do.","It can only be said that he deserved the end he received today.","She watched at the door for a while, seeing Huang Sanbai's body swaying, as if he was about to die.","\"Cough! Cough! Cough! Please stop for a moment!\"","She coughed heavily several times before attracting the attention of the cultivators in the room.","\"Who is it? Who is yelling?\"","\"That's right, there won't be anyone who sympathises with this traitor, right?\"","\"Damn it, to actually sympathise with Huang Sanbai, what kind of idiot is this!\"","The anger in everyone's hearts has not yet been vented, so they are all reluctant to be suddenly told to stop.","However, when they turned their heads and saw the girl standing at the door, everyone was shocked.","\"Huang... no, clan... Matriarch!\"","\"Subordinates, greetings to the Matriarch!\"","\"Greetings to the Matriarch!\"","After the cultivators reacted, they bowed their heads and saluted.","However, when the words \"Matriarch\" were called out, several people hesitated for a moment.","It's not that they are unconvinced by Huang Yueli. In fact, most people can't accept it. To think that they had to call a little girl who was less than twenty years old the leader of the clan and salute her...","You know, this was in the God Realm!","In the lower world, twenty years old was also very, very young, and the first impression given to people was that they were not able to do things well.","In the God Realm, one was considered an adult at the age of fifty.","That twenty-year-old... was simply a little girl!","Many twenty-year-old young cultivators were still the clan's key protection targets, the kind who have never even left the clan gate once!","After all, they are still young and not suitable for such dangerous experiences...","Well now, a little girl under twenty years old has actually become the Matriarch?","No matter how they think about it, it feels a bit weird.","Huang Yueli's gaze swept over everyone's faces, taking in all their expressions.","She was good at observing words and expressions, so she can naturally guess what they were thinking.","However, it was normal to have such thoughts. Convincing them will not happen overnight, so she doesn't care much.","Huang Yueli paused deliberately for a while, and waited until everyone felt a little uncomfortable before she spoke.","\"Alright, I know you all hate this clan traitor deeply, but with things like this now, your anger should be almost gone, right? You can't beat someone to death, right? To execute Huang Sanbai, you must return to the clan and do it in front of all the clan members, he publicly declares his crime! So, let's stop here today.\""]},{"number":4269,"title":"Chapter 4269 Return to the Sacred Phoenix Clan (1)","paragraphs":["Everyone was startled when they heard this.","Looking back, everyone realised that Huang Sanbai was really dying.","No matter how reluctant they were, they could only admit that Huang Yueli was right.","A group of people retreated without saying a word.","Seeing Li Moying standing not far from the door waiting for Huang Yueli, everyone looked sideways.","Li Moying seemed to feel nothing. He didn't even look at them and just waited quietly.","After everyone left, Huang Yueli walked up to Huang Sanbai and forced a pill into him.","This elixir was a life-saving elixir. Giving it to this old guy was indeed a waste.","However, she still had to give Huang Sanbai a break. At least, she must not let him die midway before returning to Ice Moon Summit, the base of the Sacred Phoenix Clan.","She was too young and had difficulty convincing the public.","If Huang Sanbai died suddenly in the middle of the road, it would be inevitable that some people with ulterior motives would discuss it in secret, speculating that she killed Huang Sanbai secretly to silence him.","After giving the medicine, she carefully arranged some arrays and mechanisms.","On the one hand, it was just in case to prevent Huang Sanbai from escaping.","On the other hand, it can also block those Sacred Phoenix cultivators who secretly come to vent their anger.","After doing all this, she turned around and came out.","When he looked up, he saw a tall and handsome man in the corridor.","Li Moying stood in the yard with his back to her. The afterglow of the setting sun outlined his tall and straight figure. Even if he was just standing casually, he still exuded a strong kingly aura.","Huang Yueli's eyes instantly softened, she walked over quickly and hooked his arm.","\"Dear Husband, have you been waiting for a long time?\"","Li Moying lowered his head, looked at the sweet smile of the girl next to him, and curled his lips, \"Not too long.\"","Although he said it lightly, Huang Yueli felt guilty in her heart.","Li Moying was a dignified god-level genius, the Young Master of the Cloudy Qilin Clan. Even without these titles, he should be a peerless strongman standing at the pinnacle of the God Realm, able to do whatever he wants without being restricted by anyone.","However, just because he married her, he now has to return to the clan with her.","It was completely conceivable what attitude the cultivators of the Sacred Phoenix Clan have towards the Young Master of the Cloudy Qilin Clan.","Even in front of her, those people did not hide their disgust for Li Moying.","Her Husband was so good and powerful, there was no need to bear this...","Li Moying watched the little fox's face darken little by little, easily guessing what she was thinking, and couldn't help but sigh secretly.","He reached out and gently lifted Huang Yueli's chin, making her look at him.","\"Little Li'er, are you thinking too much? I don't think there's anything wrong with it.\"","\"But...\" Huang Yueli bit her lip.","Li Moying interrupted her, \"Nothing! Didn't you also stay anonymous and stay with me in the Cloudy Qilin Clan? At that time, you couldn't even reveal your true identity, and my clan was also very unfriendly to you. How can I endure it?\"","\"That was because...\"","Just as Huang Yueli was about to speak, he stretched out a finger and pressed it on her lips.","\"I know, because you are my woman. As long as you can be with me, you will do anything you want. And I... am also your man. Of course I can do anything you can do.\"","As Li Moying spoke, the corners of his mouth couldn't help but curl up, \"Don't worry, no one can hurt me. I'm still waiting... to be your clan's Patriarch's Wife[1]!\"","[1] There is no gender differences for the chinese, it's more generic like the Clan's Leader. Hence in this context, it was meant to be the 'Patriarch's wife'"]},{"number":4270,"title":"Chapter 4270 Return to the Sacred Phoenix Clan (2)","paragraphs":["Huang Yueli was moved in her heart.","After he finished speaking, he couldn't help but laugh, \"Why do you still want to be the Matriarch's wife? You are not virtuous at all! Can you cook? Can you wash clothes? Can you take care of children? None, what do you want from you? use?\"","Li Moying grabbed her slender waist and brought her into his arms.","\"I really don't know how to do laundry and cooking, but why do you say that I don't know how to take care of children? It's a complete slander! Let's have one first and I'll show you!\"","Huang Yueli blushed and couldn't help but step on him.","\"Hey, what are you talking about! You're still outside now!\"","\"So... we can talk when we get back to the room, right? Then let's go back quickly!\" Li Moying's voice showed a bit of urgency.","Huang Yueli glared at him, \"If you dare to talk nonsense again, sleep in a separate room!\"","Li Moying raised his hands and said, \"Alright, alright, I'll listen to you, I won't say anything.\"","At times, actions speak louder than words.","...","The next day, Floating Sea sent people to deliver the rewards for the first and second place in the God Realm's Grand Meet.","The Island Master was still very generous. The rewards he gave out include elixirs, spirit armaments, various heavenly materials and earthly treasures, and even a book of skills.","Huang Yueli was rummaging through it with a beaming smile on her face.","\"Wow, this seems to be the legendary Dao Tribulation Pill! It was said that when you break through to the Dao Profound Realm, taking one pill can increase the chance of success! The Island Master is such a good person, this pill is of heaven level, the materials are hard to find, and even Senior Brother can't refine it.\"","Although she and Li Moying have grown, they don't know what it feels like to fail to advance.","However, if they could take some pills, they will definitely feel more at ease.","Even if they don't eat it, they could still sell it for money. Ifthis top-quality elixir was taken out, she didn't even know how many precious materials she could exchange for it.","\"This set of armour is a top-grade treasure, and it's very rare! At least I can't refine it now. You can try it on.\"","Huang Yueli took out a set of armour and signalled for Li Moying to try it on.","Li Moying let her do what she wanted without any resistance. He frowned in displeasure when Huang Yueli told him not to take off his clothes casually.","\"Little Li'er, I don't like this style.\"","Huang Yueli was startled, \"Don't like it? No way? This armour is pretty good-looking! It's not that weird type. Besides, you can also wear a coat outside!\"","Li Moying looked at her and spoke more bluntly.","\"I only like to wear what you make.\"","Huang Yueli blinked her eyes, looked at his unfazed expression, stood up on her tiptoes in a funny way, and kissed him on the face.","\"You put it on first! Aren't I not good enough now? When my level of spirit armament skills improves, I will definitely make a set for you. By then, you can change it even if you don't want to!\"","Li Moying nodded with reluctance.","Huang Yueli counted all the prizes and picked out the ones they could use in the near future. The rest were thrown into the Sky Phoenix Ring.","Li Moying sat aside, looking at the money-loving smile on his little fox's face when he was cleaning up the house, and secretly shook his head.","...","The team of the Sacred Phoenix Clan stayed in the Floating Sea for another three days, and finally decided to set off back to Ice Moon Summit.","In fact, most of the forces set out to return the day after the God Realm's Grand Meet ended.","After all, Floating Sea was a secluded holy land. It was not a prosperous big city, and there was nothing interesting to see. After finishing their business, not many people were willing to stay here.","In the end, only the Sacred Phoenix Clan and the Cloudy Qilin Clan were left."]},{"number":4271,"title":"Chapter 4271 Return to the Sacred Phoenix Clan (3)","paragraphs":["Huang Yueli was originally afraid of embarrassment and wanted to wait for the Cloudy Qilin Clan to leave first before they left.","Now, the other party refuses to leave, obviously waiting for Li Moying to regret.","This would make it even more embarrassing.","So, she thought about it and decided to leave first.","The airship of the Sacred Phoenix Clan stayed at the edge of the Floating Sea.","When they were about to board the ship, people from the Cloudy Qilin Clan arrived.","Li Yuntao and others looked at Li Moying who was closely following Huang Yueli with expressions of sorrow.","\"Young Master, do you really want to go with this woman from the Sacred Phoenix Clan? You must not be deceived by her. There is no good person in the Sacred Phoenix Clan ! Now she is just using her beauty to win over you. When you arrive at the Sacred Phoenix Clan, you'll become her puppet and slave! She just wants to use you!\"","\"Young Master, please wake up quickly!\"","The cultivators of the Sacred Phoenix Clan were so proud that they fought back one after another.","\"I think you, the Cloudy Qilin Clan, don't have any good people! Young Master Li abandoned the dark side and turned to the bright side. He has vision and has a bright future!\"","\"Quickly give up this idea, he won't leave with you!\"","\"You bastard of the Cloudy Qilin Clan, if you don't get out, don't blame us for being rude!\"","Some cultivators were a little excited when they saw the Cloudy Qilin Clan, and some even wanted to rush forward with their weapons on the spot.","Seeing this, Huang Yueli coughed quickly and her face darkened.","\"That's enough. Who dares to attack the cultivators of the Cloudy Qilin Clan? Come on board the airship quickly!\"","Over the past few days, Huang Yueli has gradually established prestige among the clan.","At least, for the younger generation of clansmen, the scene where she teamed up with Li Moying to defeat Huang Sanbai in the God Realm's Grand Meet was too shocking and enough to shock them.","Therefore, these people did not dare to say any more and could only board the ship obediently.","Although the Elders were not in awe of her to this extent, they knew the importance and understood that it would not be a good thing to cause trouble with the Sacred Phoenix Clan in Floating Sea, so they decisively chose to board the airship.","Li Moying glanced at Li Shihong, then said nothing and followed his wife on the boat.","The airship of the Sacred Phoenix Clan gradually took off and quickly disappeared from everyone's sight.","On the Cloudy Qilin Clan's side, several Elders were so angry that they almost fainted.","\"Patriarch, what should I do? Looking at the Young Master like this, I'm afraid he really can't live without that witch. In a few days, the wedding invitation will be sent over. What should we do? \"","Li Shihong was also depressed here, but he needs to calm down.","\"Forget it, I want to see, can the Sacred Phoenix Clan really let the two of them get married? I don't believe it! Let this evil man be taken care of by the Sacred Phoenix Clan. When Moying was driven out by them, he will know that the Sacred Phoenix Clan are all a bunch of scum!\"","Li Yuntao and others suddenly realised, \"That's it! Yes, the Patriarch is wise!\"","...","The return trip went smoothly.","Half a month later, the Sacred Phoenix Clan's airship arrived at Ice Moon Summit.","This was Huang Yueli's first time in Sky Moon City. She took Li Moying to the bow of the airship and watched curiously.","As the Sacred Land of the Sacred Phoenix Clan, Ice Moon Summit has a completely different style compared to the Amethyst Paramount Palace of the Cloudy Qilin Clan.","Although Amethyst Paramount Palace was also built on the mountain, it looks like a majestic palace.","On Ice Moon Summit, there were undulating peaks. Each peak has an independent palace, which is connected by corridors to form a whole.","These corridors are all built in mid-air. Looking down from the sky, they seem to be buried in the clouds, like a dream."]},{"number":4272,"title":"Chapter 4272 Return to the Sacred Phoenix Clan (4)","paragraphs":["\"I didn't expect that Ice Moon Summit would be so beautiful!\" Liu Buyan couldn't help but sigh.","These days, Liu Buyan was actually having the best time.","Huang Yueli spent a lot of time trying to solve the headaches of these clansmen all day long.","After all, Li Moying and others were cultivators of the Cloudy Qilin Clan. Although the Sacred Phoenix Clan members did not dare to do anything to them under the eyes of the Matriarch, they were not very free to move after all.","But Liu Buyan was different.","He was a well-known Spirit Medicine Master in the God Realm, and he was from the White Fen clan with the most popular blood.","Wherever he goes, he was welcomed.","By the way, he gave the Sacred Phoenix Clan cultivators a few pills to see if they were suffering from headaches and fever, and soon became close to the young cultivators.","Many gossips and rumours about the Sacred Phoenix Clan reached Huang Yueli's ears through him.","Huang Yueli originally had no feelings for the Sacred Phoenix Clan, but when she actually stood above Ice Moon Summit, overlooking the Sacred Land of the Sacred Phoenix Clan.","Feel the strong fire attribute energy below, constantly surging up.","Her mood changed subtly.","This sudden realisation that she was really from the Sacred Phoenix Clan! Being connected by blood to this clan gave her a sense of belonging.","The airship landed slowly, and Huang Yueli walked down the gangway surrounded by the Elders.","The cultivators of the Sacred Phoenix Clan have already received the news.","At this time, everyone came out of the mountain gate and lined up neatly in the open space at the door.","As soon as they saw Huang Yueli appear, everyone immediately knelt down and greeted her.","\"Greet the Matriarch and welcome the Matriarch back to the mountain!\"","The voices of many cultivators resounded through the sky.","Liu Buyan showed a bit of astonishment and secretly pulled Li Moying.","\"Tsk tsk, brother-in-law, my Junior Sister is so majestic, are you feeling pressured?\"","Li Moying glanced at him with contempt and said nothing.","What do singles know?!","The more powerful the wife is, the more capable her Husband will be, alright?","Huang Yueli looked indifferent, as if such battles were commonplace.","She raised her hand and said, \"You are too polite, please get up.\"","The cultivators then stood up one after another.","The Elders and protectors with higher status in the clan gathered around.","Although the other cultivators could only stand on the side according to the rules, they still couldn't restrain their curiosity and were looking for opportunities to take a peek.","The legendary god-level genius was rare enough.","Now, this god-level genius has become their Matriarch when he was less than twenty years old...","Before Huang Yueli returned to Ice Moon Summit, this news had already caused an uproar in the Sacred Phoenix Clan !","Everyone was guessing what kind of person Huang Yueli was.","When they saw her for the first time today, they were really shocked.","First reaction, beautiful! She's so beautiful!","Although there were many handsome men and beauties among the Ancient God Clans, such stunning ones were really rare to see.","The second reaction was...she was just too calm.","Facing so many powerful cultivators and their deliberately imposing aura, she didn't even show a trace of surprise.","Always calm and indifferent, watching them condescendingly.","She had completely placed herself in the position of the Matriarch.","As a result, many cultivators who were originally reluctant became more alert and did not dare to make mistakes easily.","A god-level genius was afterall a god-level genius. Even Huang Sanbai, a highly respected Elder who has been in the clan for many years, fell into her hands.","This young Matriarch must have some skills."]},{"number":4273,"title":"Chapter 4273 Return to the Sacred Phoenix Clan (5)","paragraphs":["For a time, various thoughts flooded into the hearts of the cultivators of the Sacred Phoenix Clan.","However, no matter how different everyone's positions are, at least one idea was the same.","That was - the god-level genius truly deserves her reputation!","Even if you don't see Huang Yueli take action, you can still feel her aura if you just see her in person.","Huang Yueli left and did not go to the mountain gate immediately. Instead, she waited for a while under the gateway.","Seeing this, the clansmen all looked puzzled.","\"Matriarch, please...\"","A respected Elder was about to urge her when he suddenly saw a tall figure appearing behind Huang Yueli.","The handsome man in a black-gold robe slowly approached Huang Yueli and stopped beside her.","He was extremely handsome, his face seemed to have been chiselled to perfection. Compared with the beautiful appearance of the girl next to him, he was not inferior in the slightest.","The two of them stood together, looking particularly pleasing to the eye.","What was even more shocking was that the powerful aura naturally exuded from his body. Although he tried his best to restrain himself and reduce his sense of existence, it still makes people feel a strong sense of oppression.","The cultivators present raised their heads and looked at Li Moying in surprise.","They didn't react for a while.","\"Who is this man? What a powerful aura!\"","\"Isn't it? Much stronger than Huang Beicheng, the number one genius in our clan, and he looks much younger than him!\"","\"The Matriarch is worthy of being the Matriarch. Even the men around her are so powerful! Which clan's genius is this?\"","Amid the discussion, someone suddenly reacted and couldn't help but scream.","\"This...this is the Young Master of the Cloudy Qilin Clan, Moying!!\"","\"What?!\"","\"Young Master Li?!\"","The young cultivators present were not qualified to participate in the God Realm's Grand Meet, so many of them were unaware of everything that happened in the Floating Sea.","After hearing this, everyone was immediately confused.","\"This was definitely Young Master Li! I just went to Cloudy Qilin Continent last year and saw him at that time. No one can forget the face of Young Master Li!\"","\"If you put it this way... you really look like Young Master Li! Our Matriarch was a god-level genius. Who else can be compared to her in terms of power? Apart from Young Master Li, who else can we have?\"","\"Cough cough... But, isn't he from the Cloudy Qilin Clan? Why did he come to our Sacred Phoenix Clan ?! Is he here to cause trouble?\"","The young cultivators were confused.","Even the Elders standing in the front row couldn't help but look surprised at this time.","They understood the relationship between Young Master Li and their new Matriarch from Huang Likai's letter.","However, no one expected that Li Moying would really follow her all the way to Ice Moon Summit!","After all, this was the Sacred Land of the Sacred Phoenix Clan. Not to mention the young god-level geniuses of the Cloudy Qilin Clan, even the supreme Elders of the Life Profound Realm would not dare to step in easily.","If besieged by the Sacred Phoenix Clan, one will be in a life threatening situation!","Besides, it was rare for the Cloudy Qilin Clan to produce a god-level genius. I heard that he was very precious, so how can they let him go?","Based on this \"common sense\" judgement, the Elders who stayed behind at Ice Moon Summit did not think that the two of them would really appear together.","Some people didn't even take the message in the letter seriously.","What if two god-level geniuses were attracted to each other?","Since Huang Yueli has joined the Sacred Phoenix Clan, the relationship must be broken."]},{"number":4274,"title":"Chapter 4274 Return to the Sacred Phoenix Clan (6)","paragraphs":["Do you still need to consider this?","But now, Li Moying appeared in front of them alive!","Moreover, it was still in such an arrogant and powerful manner.","Even...","Many people noticed that Li Moying also held Huang Yueli's hand and was intertwined with hers.","Huang Yueli didn't object at all and even turned back to give him a sweet smile.","The cold, arrogant and majestic aura he had when facing the clan members just now was completely gone.","The handsome man and the beautiful woman looked at each other affectionately, and they looked very beautiful, like a painting.","However, when everyone realised who the hero and heroine were, the faces of most of the cultivators present became very ugly.","\"Matriarch, this is...\"","Huang Xindi, the Elder of the Sacred Phoenix Clan, came out and asked tentatively.","He turned out to be the second-ranked Elder in the clan, so he was qualified to be responsible for staying at Ice Moon Summit.","After Huang Sanbai was arrested for betraying the clan, he became the first Elder.","At this time, he had to stand up and ask Huang Yueli.","Huang Yueli glanced at him and said unhurriedly: \"This Young Master Li Moying... is my fiancé!\"","Although they have already been married in the lower realm, since they are planning to have another wedding in the God Realm, it was more appropriate to call them fiancé.","Hearing this, Huang Xindi felt as if he had been struck by lightning!","Huang Yueli actually admitted it and looked so proud...","By the sounds of it, if they didn't stop her, was she really planning to marry Li Moying?","And this Young Master Li was also another peculiar one. He actually followed her all the way to the Sacred Phoenix Clan and planned to marry in?!","Seeing the expressions of Huang Xindi and others, Huang Likai and other Elders who returned from the Floating Sea felt much better.","Finally, someone was as depressed as them!","God knows, they have felt this way every day since they recognized Huang Yueli.","On the one hand, she was happy to have a talented new Matriarch, but on the other hand, she was so angry at the interaction between her and Li Moying that she wanted to vomit blood.","Huang Yueli glanced at the dull-looking people.","Of course she knows what these people are thinking, but it has nothing to do with her. She will never do what they want.","\"What are you doing standing still at the door? Are you... not going to let me in?\" Huang Yueli said coldly.","Only then did Huang Xindi and others react and realised that now was not the time to be in a daze.","He quickly stepped forward and bowed to Huang Yueli, \"Matriarch, please come this way!\"","Huang Yueli nodded and said to the guards behind him: \"The former Patriarch Huang Tianhao is not feeling well. Just carry his sedan chair in.\"","\"Yes!\" The guard responded.","Huang Yueli then took a step forward and walked towards the mountain gate of Ice Moon Summit.","Li Moying stayed by her side calmly, expressionless, seemingly indifferent to the probing glances around her.","Huang Xindi barely suppressed the shock and depression in her heart, and welcomed the people all the way to the top of the largest mountain in Ice Moon Summit, and entered the gorgeous palace on the mountain.","Everyone sat down in the main hall.","The Elders and stewards once again collectively prostrated themselves and saluted Huang Yueli.","Huang Yueli signalled them to stand up and said a few words of encouragement.","\"Elders and seniors, I am very grateful for your contributions to the Sacred Phoenix Clan over the years. Without your efforts, the Sacred Phoenix Clan would not be what it was today. I am always grateful to you.\""]},{"number":4275,"title":"Chapter 4275 Huang Sanbai’s End (1)","paragraphs":["\"I am a junior of the Sacred Phoenix Clan. I have only been cultivating for a few years. I never expected that I would become the leader of the Sacred Phoenix Clan so soon. If the previous leader was not in danger, he had to pass the throne to me. I wouldn't sit in this position. Looking back, I feel a bit scared.\"","\"However, since I am now the Matriarch, I will not shirk the responsibility to lead the Sacred Phoenix Clan and become one of the top forces in the God Realm. The Sacred Phoenix Clan itself is one of the families with the purest blood and the most outstanding talents in the God Realm. With this strength, I also believe I can do it...\"","Huang Yueli kept talking for a quarter of an hour, which shocked the Elders again.","None of them expected that Huang Yueli, who had been living outside the world since she ascended to the God Realm, knew so clearly about the situation in the Sacred Phoenix Clan!","Moreover, she also did some careful thinking and put forward his own opinions on the various shortcomings of the clan's current system.","This was beyond everyone's expectation.","As the leader of a large force, having talent and strength are actually only part of the requirements.","In addition, management ability and overall view was actually more important than strength.","If one doesn't have these abilities, even if one's strength crushes everything, one can only become a superior leader and cannot control real power.","As Huang Yueli was a god-level genius, naturally no one will doubt that her talent and strength was not enough to assume the position of Matriarch.","However, since she was so young, the Elders don't think she really has the skills to gain real power in the clan.","Now after hearing what she said, some Elders with ulterior motives looked quite ugly.","They finally realised that the young new Matriarch in front of them was really not a fuel-efficient lamp!","Seeing everyone's expressions, Huang Likai was filled with emotion.","When he came in just now, many Elders secretly glanced at him. Seeing their meaning, they obviously felt that he had derelict in his duty by failing to prevent Li Moying from entering Ice Moon Summit.","Now, these people should be able to feel the difficulties he faced!","After Huang Yueli finished speaking, she stopped.","Huang Likai immediately took a step forward and took the lead in saluting her, \"What the Matriarch said is absolutely true. I will teach you!\"","\"Subordinates must obey the orders of the Matriarch!\"","Many Elders saluted again.","Huang Yueli nodded and said: \"Then we have a big thing to do next. It's best to complete this matter as soon as possible without any delay!\"","Everyone realised what she wanted to say, and they suddenly became energetic.","Huang Yueli said: \"That is...to publicly punish Huang Sanbai, the sinner who betrayed the clan!\"","\"Not only did this man openly pursue and kill the god-level geniuses in the clan, but he also confused right and wrong and hindered the clan's actions. In the process, he also secretly murdered two Elders including Huang Shuangyu and countless clan members! In the end, he also attacked the former Patriarch Huang Tianhao and tortured him in every possible way in an attempt to obtain the Patriarch's seal and ascend to the throne of the Matriarch!\"","\"Such a crazy traitor to the clan must be punished by everyone! I personally captured him in Floating Sea and brought him back to the clan for trial, just to let everyone see his fate with their own eyes and take a lesson from him!\"","When Huang Yueli mentioned Huang Sanbai, all the cultivators present showed serious expressions.","No matter how many thoughts they had in their minds,they were all suppressed."]},{"number":4276,"title":"Chapter 4276 Huang Sanbai’s End (2)","paragraphs":["In fact, Huang Sanbai has been in the clan for many years, and many of the Elders present have a good relationship with him.","However, Huang Sanbai's crimes have been described in detail in the letters sent back by Huang Likai and others.","The scene at that time was definitely not a one-sided accusation by Huang Yueli, but it happened under the joint witness of hundreds of thousands of elite cultivators from various god-level forces.","What was right and wrong? In front of so many people, there was no possibility of hiding it.","In addition, Huang Tianhao himself appeared to testify.","All factors combined, no one dares to say that Huang Sanbai was wrongly accused.","Although everyone was shocked when they got the news, no one with any brains could question it.","Huang Yueli glanced at everyone and knew that it was a bit hard for everyone to accept.","She coughed twice and added: \"The trial will be scheduled in three days. At that time, all the cultivators in the clan, except for those who are unable to return from training outside, must be present to personally witness Huang Sanbai's confession.\"","Everyone sighed and nodded in agreement.","Huang Yueli didn't say anything more because it was too early to say now.","The first major event when she returned to the Sacred Phoenix Clan was to judge Huang Sanbai.","Only when Huang Sanbai's charges had been completely proven can it be justified for her to inherit the position of Matriarch. The next step must be based on this foundation.","Huang Yueli announced the end of the meeting and left the main hall under the guidance of the guards.","When it was confirmed that Huang Yue was far away, the main hall suddenly exploded.","None of the Elders took the initiative to leave, they all chose to stay.","Most people have extremely anxious looks on their faces.","The first reaction of many people was to rush forward and surround Huang Likai.","Huang Xindi was the first to stand up and asked Huang Likai, \"Elder Likai, what do you mean? How could you do such a thing! How is this any different from betraying the clan!\"","Huang Likai looked disapproving, \"What have I done? Elder Xindi, you should make it clear if you have something to say? You are so clueless that you just label me as betraying the clan. How can I bear such a label?\"","Huang Xindi said angrily: \"Are you still pretending to be stupid here? Let me ask you, what happened to that Li Moying? How did he end up with the Matriarch?\"","Huang Likai stared back unceremoniously.","\"Didn't I make it very clear in my letter to you? The Matriarch and Li Moying were a couple when they were in the lower realm, and their relationship was very good. Now in the God Realm, they still have to be together. What can I do? I am just an Elder!\"","\"What does it mean to be just an Elder? The Matriarch made a mistake, and she just needs the advice of us Elders. Otherwise, what's the use of us? You've been staying by the Matriarch's side, and you just watched that Li Moying taint our Matriarch? It seems like you have bad intentions! Are you thinking of taking Huang Sanbai's place and coveting the position of the first Elder?\"","Before Huang Sanbai made a mistake, his status as the first Elder was generally recognized and unshakable.","However, under him, the status of the second Elder Huang Xindi and the third Elder Huang Likai was indistinguishable.","There has always been a rift between the two, and they often fight openly and secretly."]},{"number":4277,"title":"Chapter 4277 Huang Sanbai’s End (3)","paragraphs":["Originally, with Huang Sanbai around, no matter how hard the two of them fought, the results would be similar. Anyway, they couldn't get past Huang Sanbai, the first Elder.","But it's different now.","Huang Sanbai betrayed the clan and will be executed within three days.","The position of the first Elder was also vacant.","If there was a difference between two people, the one who wins will become the first Elder and have a pivotal position in the clan.","Especially since the new Matriarch was still a little girl under twenty years old.","At her age, let alone being smart, she would be considered good if she could balance all the forces in the clan.","Taking a step back, even if Huang Yueli was extremely talented and had the ability to manage a clan, she was still young and her strength was still rising rapidly.","For a peerless genius like her, she would definitely spend most of her time cultivating and going out for training. She would definitely not be able to stay at Ice Moon Summit all the time and deal with those complicated clan affairs.","Therefore, this first Elder, in a sense, was under one person and above ten thousand people, and has great power.","Even more powerful than Huang Sanbai's power at that time!","It would be strange if someone didn't covet such a position.","Huang Likai was very clever. After he learned that Huang Sanbai had betrayed the clan and Huang Tianhao abdicated, he immediately stood by Huang Yueli and worked for her. This was because he was the first to realise this.","Especially when he found out that Huang Yueli was actually with the Young Master of the Cloudy Qilin Clan and wanted to formally marry him, Huang Likai immediately understood that his opportunity had come!","Most people in the clan are not willing to live in harmony with the Cloudy Qilin Clan cultivators.","However, Huang Likai was different. He had been separated from his clan since he was a child and grew up among the human race. When he was a child and didn't know about his bloodline, he even had a few friends from the Cloudy Qilin Clan.","To him, the so-called clan feud was actually not that unforgettable.","Normally standing on the opposite side of the Cloudy Qilin Clan was just to protect the clan's position and face.","Now, since Huang Yueli insisted on being with Li Moying, he felt that there was nothing wrong with it, and instead gave him a chance to show his face in front of the new Matriarch.","Huang Xindi naturally wanted to become the first Elder.","However, the advantage now has been taken by Huang Likai.","Besides, he thought he was not as shameless as Huang Likai, who actually approved the marriage between the new Matriarch and the Young Master of the Cloudy Qilin Clan.","Therefore, his situation became very difficult.","When I looked at Huang Likai, I was naturally displeased with him.","The two had a big argument in front of many Elders in the clan.","Huang Likai insisted: \"The Matriarch is the Matriarch. No matter what she does, does she need you as an Elder to speak up? Why should the Matriarch make a mistake and ask the Elders to give him advice! Do you really treat yourself as a dish? What was the role of the Matriarch in the clan? The status itself was the most noble, and no one can shake it!\"","\"You...what do you mean? The Matriarch brought so many people from the Cloudy Qilin Clan to the clan today. How shameful it is before our ancestors of the Sacred Phoenix Clan!\"","Huang Likai couldn't help but sneer, \"What's the use of talking to me? If you have the ability, you can tell the Matriarch directly! I want to see if you have such a big face that the Matriarch can do it for you. To abandon her Husband, whom she has been married to for several years!\"","Upon hearing this, the corners of Huang Xindi's mouth twitched."]},{"number":4278,"title":"Chapter 4278 Huang Sanbai’s End (4)","paragraphs":["He was not a fool. Of course he could see that Huang Yueli and Li Moying had a very good relationship, and they could not be separated by just a few words.","But how could the Husband of the leader of the Sacred Phoenix Clan be from the Cloudy Qilin Clan!","Moreover, he wanted to separate the two people for a deeper purpose, which was to demonstrate his influence in the clan.","If Huang Yueli's chosen marriage can be ruined, the Matriarch's prestige will also decrease.","His prestige as an Elder would also increase significantly.","When the time comes, not only will he become the first Elder, but his words may be more useful than what Huang Yueli herself says!","Each of them had their own little calculations and schemes in their heads, and they argued for a long time, but to no avail.","The cultivators of the Sacred Phoenix Clan were also divided into two factions, each supporting the two.","Of course, there were obviously more cultivators supporting Huang Xindi.","Most people couldn't accept Li Moying no matter what, and instinctively opposed the marriage.","Huang Likai was gradually at a disadvantage and was pointed at and scolded by a bunch of people.","In desperation, he could only take a step back, \"Alright, you all say that I'm wrong now! But that's because you don't know how stubborn our new Matriarch is! I want to see what you have. If you have the ability, you can make her change her mind! I wish you success first!\"","After saying that, Huang Likai turned around and left the main hall with his supporters.","Huang Xindi and others were left behind, feeling very upset.","\"Elder Xindi, what should we do now? What Elder Likai said can't be true, right? Will the new Matriarch really not listen to our persuasion?\"","\"If this was really the case, things will be in trouble!\"","\"I think what Elder Likai said might be true! Otherwise, the Matriarch wouldn't have brought Li Moying back...\"","\"Shut up!\" Huang Xindi couldn't listen anymore and interrupted them coldly, \"Stop talking now, Huang Likai is just scaring us! No matter how talented the Matriarch is, she is only twenty. Her cultivation is still at the Heart Profound Realm, so she doesn't have that much capital yet!\"","He paused and then said: \"Everyone go back and get ready. In three days, Huang Sanbai will be executed. After that, there will definitely be a meeting to discuss the Matriarch's inauguration ceremony. At that time, if you have any opinions, please tell the Matriarch in person. Propose it! I don't believe she can really go against so many clan members.\"","Only then did everyone suddenly realise.","\"Elder Xindi still has the foresight!\"","\"That's true. Let's talk together, and we won't be afraid that she won't listen!\"","\"That's it. We must not let anyone break the rules of our Sacred Phoenix Clan!\"","Everyone discussed with each other and left one after another.","...","On the other side, Huang Yueli and Li Moying had already returned to the back bedroom under the leadership of the guards.","Huang Yueli was now the Matriarch of the Sacred Phoenix Clan, and her residence was naturally extremely luxurious.","There were several high-level spirit-gathering arrays around the palace, which continuously gather the profound energy of heaven and earth around Ice Moon Summit.","Huang Yueli and Li Moying sat down. Before they could say a few words, they saw Little Wang Cai flying in from the window.","As soon as it landed, it turned into a little shot and screamed loudly.","\"Female Devil, Female Devil, you guessed it right! None of those Elders have any good intentions. They really all stayed there, trying to figure out how to plot against you!\"","Huang Yueli and Li Moying looked at each other, \"What did they say?\"","Little Wang Cai recounted the dispute between Huang Xindi and Huang Likai."]},{"number":4279,"title":"Chapter 4279 Huang Sanbai’s End (5)","paragraphs":["He has a good memory and completely restored the scene at that time.","After hearing this, Huang Yueli showed no surprise at all and just nodded.","\"Wang Cai, thank you for your hard work! Now you can go play. I have ordered someone to prepare a large plate of roasted chicken legs for you. During this period, if you hear them talking about me and Moying again, remember to tell me. \"","Little Wang Cai cheered, turned and left.","Huang Yueli looked at Li Moying, with a hint of guilt in her eyes.","\"Moying...\"","However, just as she started, she was interrupted by Li Moying, \"Alright, stop talking, I know it all. Didn't I tell you before, I followed you voluntarily, and shamelessly insisted on following you, with It's alright with you. Don't you need to mention these words again?\"","Li Moying held her slender little hand and pulled her into his arms, \"Or am I not trying hard enough at night recently, which makes you dissatisfied, and you want to get rid of me?\"","When Huang Yueli heard him mention the night, a blush bloomed on her face.","Since the God Realm's Grand Meet, Li Moying has been unscrupulous, pestering her to practice double cultivation every night.","It's true that her cultivation level increased rapidly, but she suffered from a serious lack of sleep.","Sometimes, she almost suspected that Li Moying deliberately followed her to the Sacred Phoenix Clan just to make her feel guilty.","In this way, she would be embarrassed to refuse this man's request for dual cultivation. She could only obediently cooperate with whatever request he made.","Li Moying lowered his eyes slightly, staring at the charming little face of the girl in his arms, and his heart moved.","He reached out and gently lifted her chin, and slowly moved closer to her.","Just when the two lips were about to touch each other, Huang Yueli suddenly covered his mouth.","\"What are you doing? I'm talking to you about business!\" Huang Yueli rolled her eyes at him.","Li Moying smiled slightly, pinched her wrist, and licked her palm directly, \"You've said it, wasn't I listening?\"","Huang Yueli was so itchy from his licking that she wanted to stop, but he held her tightly.","She had nothing to do with this man, so she could only say in this posture: \"I am worried whether these Elders will come up with any drastic measures... To put it bluntly, the two of us are only at the level of the Heart Profound Realm, and there are many masters of the Middle Dao Profound Realm, and if they have to fight against us, it will be difficult for us and Senior Brother to resist them.\"","Li Moying paused and raised his eyebrows, \"Do they still dare to attack the Matriarch? As far as I know, the Ancient God Clans have strict rules. If they dare to be disrespectful to the Matriarch, or even attack the Matriarch, they will definitely become a public enemy of all Ancient God Clans. The fate will probably be the same as that of Huang Sanbai!\"","Huang Yueli shook her head, \"It's not what you think. They really don't dare to do anything to me, but I'm worried that they will do something to you...\"","\"How do you treat me?\" Li Moying said nonchalantly: \"Little Li'er, do you look down on your Husband too much? Even if those Elders of the Sacred Phoenix Clan really have bad intentions, they can't do anything to me. Don't worry.\"","\"But...\" Huang Yueli was still slightly uneasy.","Li Moying interrupted her, \"No more buts! As a cultivator of the Sacred Phoenix Clan, if you can practice at Ice Moon Summit for a period of time, it will be of great help to improve your cultivation. Moreover, as the Matriarch, you have access to all the secret skill books of the Sacred Phoenix Clan. Everything is open to you. If you miss this opportunity, you won't be able to make it up in the future. Practice hard and don't think too much.\""]},{"number":4280,"title":"Chapter 4280 Huang Sanbai’s End (6)","paragraphs":["When Li Moying said this, Huang Yueli could only nod.","Seeing that his stubborn little fox finally became well-behaved, Li Moying raised an evil smile on his lips.","He slowly moved towards her again.","\"In that case, Little Li'er, it's getting late and it's time for us to rest. What do you think... eh?\"","...","Over the period of the next three days.","Accompanied by Huang Tianhao and Huang Likai, Huang Yueli visited the entire Ice Moon Summit and gained a preliminary understanding of the power distribution and various aspects of the Sacred Phoenix Clan.","Huang Tianhao was still very weak and sat in a wheelchair the whole time, pushed by Huang Likai.","He looked at Huang Yueli and couldn't help but sigh deeply, \"Yueli, you have seen now that our Sacred Phoenix Clan only has this little wealth left. There are twelve major Ancient God Clans in the God Realm. In terms of ranking, our Sacred Phoenix Clan used to be one of the top two, but now we are down to the bottom three. This was all because I don't know people's hearts well, and I am indeed responsible...\"","Huang Yueli looked at Huang Tianhao's annoyed expression, and for a moment, she didn't know what to say.","After getting to know them in detail during this period, she discovered that the situation of the Sacred Phoenix Clan was actually worse than she had imagined.","No wonder the Cloudy Qilin Clan always talked about the Sacred Phoenix Clan with a bit of disdain.","This was not just because they have Li Moying, a talented future Patriarch.","Even if you ignore the influence of the so-called god-level genius, the gap between the two families was still huge.","The most obvious point was that there are very few cultivators with outstanding strength among the Sacred Phoenix Clan between fifty and two hundred years old.","Logically speaking, this was the golden period after a cultivator reaches adulthood, the period when he was strongest and had the most experience. Whether it was cultivation or achievement, it was concentrated during this period.","However, there were simply too few cultivators of this age group in the Sacred Phoenix Clan who can be named!","Huang Sanbai was already five or six hundred years old.","Huang Likai was considered young, already over two hundred years old.","In contrast, Li Yuntao and others from the Cloudy Qilin Clan were only over a hundred years old, but they had already occupied high positions in the Allied Forces of the Gods.","Because the number of Masters in the clan was gradually becoming scarce, some resources were gradually being squeezed by other forces, forming a vicious cycle.","Although the direct cause of all this was caused by Huang Sanbai.","However, Huang Tianhao, who trusted him to this extent, was obviously not innocent.","Huang Tianhao sighed and looked at Huang Yueli with expectant eyes.","\"I can't do it anymore. I'm half a cripple now, and I can't hold back the people below me. From now on, the whole clan will have to rely on you.\"","After observing during this period, Huang Tianhao had to admit that Huang Yueli was much stronger than him.","The only shortcoming was probably the man she likes...","...","Three days passed quickly.","Huang Sanbai's execution ceremony officially began.","According to Huang Yueli's order, all members of the Sacred Phoenix Clan gathered at the Burning Sky Lake on the northern side of Ice Moon Summit.","Many years ago, Burning Sky Lake was once an important secret place of the Sacred Phoenix Clan.","This was also the reason why Ice Moon Summit was selected as the base of the Sacred Phoenix Clan.","Because the main peak of Ice Moon Summit was once the largest active volcano in the God Realm, it would erupt every few years, and the surrounding fire energy was extremely rich.","However, the flames spouted by Ice Moon Summit were so intense that it was difficult for ordinary cultivators to get close, let alone practice or even live nearby.","For this reason, hundreds of thousands of years ago, when the Sacred Phoenix Clan was at its most glorious, a dozen Life Profound Realm experts took action at the same time to transform the mountain."]},{"number":4281,"title":"Chapter 4281 Huang Sanbai’s End (7)","paragraphs":["The volcano at Ice Moon Summit was suppressed, and a protective array was deployed around it.","This array does not rely on the spirit beast crystal core to maintain its operation, but directly extracts the fire attribute energy from the volcano. Therefore, the power was endless and was much more powerful than the mountain protection arrays of other forces. This was the strong reliance for the Sacred Phoenix Clan to develop safely to this day.","However, although the volcano no longer erupts on a large scale, from time to time, there will still be some gush of magma that breaks through the blockade of the array.","This magma eroded part of the peak, forming the Burning Sky Lake.","The Burning Sky Lake was filled with boiling magma.","Even from a long distance, you can clearly feel the blazing heat and rich fire attribute energy.","The temperature in the center of Burning Sky Lake was so terrifyingly high that even masters of the Life Profound Realm cannot approach it with bare hands.","For this reason, the area near Burning Sky Lake was transformed into an important training place for the Sacred Phoenix Clan.","From far to near, there are hundreds of cultivation locations.","If you want to enter the Burning Sky Lake to practice, you must also arrange your time according to the ranking of the clan, which was exactly the same as the Cloudy Qilin Clan's trial place.","However, these training locations are at least ten miles away from the center of Burning Sky Lake.","Because, if you get any closer, most cultivators will not be able to bear it.","This time, Huang Yueli chose this place to execute Huang Sanbai.","This was not because she was ingenious, but because she followed Huang Tianhao's suggestion.","According to him, the Sacred Phoenix Clan has had this rule for hundreds of thousands of years. To execute the most evil sinner in the clan, one must do so in the flames of the Burning Sky Lake, with everyone watching him being burned by the hot magma. Devour it bit by bit to serve as a warning to others.","The cultivators of the Sacred Phoenix Clan gathered near Burning Sky Lake.","After waiting for a while, Huang Yueli arrived surrounded by all the Elders.","Li Moying was still by her side.","Seeing his handsome face, most of the younger generation of cultivators were a little numb. They had probably seen too much in the past few days and had become accustomed to it.","After everyone saluted, Huang Yueli went straight to the topic without saying any nonsense.","\"Come here, bring Huang Sanbai to me.\"","Several high-spirited young guards escorted Huang Sanbai to the open space next to Burning Sky Lake.","Huang Yueli narrowed her eyes and couldn't help but feel a little sad when she saw Huang Sanbai's current appearance clearly.","Recalling the first time she saw Huang Sanbai in Soul Connection Ocean.","At that time, even she was deceived by Huang Sanbai, thinking that he was an amiable senior member of the clan. If she hadn't been cautious by nature and had more foresight, she might not know where her corpse was now.","When the members of the Sacred Phoenix Clan saw Huang Sanbai, they all began to curse.","Huang Yueli coughed slightly, and everyone fell silent.","\"Alright, the sinner Huang Sanbai has been brought here. Next, Elder Huang Likai will read out his charges, so that all the clan members will know what this seemingly venerable Elder has done behind the scenes!\"","\"Yes, I will obey the Matriarch's instructions!\" Huang Likai immediately stood up.","He took out a red scroll from his sleeve, slowly unfolded it, and read aloud.","\"Clan traitor Huang Sanbai is the13,328th generation Elder of the Sacred Phoenix Clan. He was responsible for assisting the Matriarch and managing clan affairs. However, this person has evil intentions...\""]},{"number":4282,"title":"Chapter 4282 Huang Sanbai’s End (8)","paragraphs":["\"Using the trust of the Matriarch, he repeatedly committed heinous crimes. The specific charges are as follows...\"","\"First, attempting to assassinate the god-level genius in the clan...\"","\"Second, attempted to assassinate, imprison and torture the Patriarch...\"","\"The third ...\"","Huang Likai spoke for a quarter of an hour before finishing the long scroll of crimes.","After hearing what he said, Huang Yueli also exhaled a long breath.","Yesterday, when Huang Likai and the others showed her the prepared charges, she was frightened.","Although Huang Sanbai did commit a mortal crime and was unforgivable, it would be a bit exaggerated to list so many of them!","Even the matter of embezzling a few Cultivating Pills was written down.","As a clan Elder, it seems reasonable to use clan materials, right?","However, Huang Tianhao persuaded her that these were necessary means to strengthen Huang Sanbai's accusation and enhance the prestige of the clan Matriarch.","Huang Yueli listened to these words, so she approved it casually.","After reading out the charges, Huang Likai announced the final verdict against Huang Sanbai.","\"The Council of Elders jointly discussed and decided to sentence Huang San to death by melting into the magma. All clan members are asked to watch it live and take it as a warning.\"","Huang Likai finished the announcement and asked Huang Yueli for instructions.","Huang Yueli raised her hand, \"The Elders' verdict is very appropriate. Just do what you said.\"","The guards then dragged Huang Sanbai to the centre of Burning Sky Lake.","Huang Sanbai kept his head lowered and motionless. Even when Huang Likai wrote him a lot of false accusations, he didn't react at all, as if he thought he was a dead person.","However, as he gradually approached Burning Sky Lake, Huang Sanbai suddenly screamed in terror and struggled desperately to escape.","The guards were all cultivators of the younger generation. In terms of strength, they are actually not as good as Huang Sanbai. It's just that Huang Sanbai's meridians were restrained and he couldn't move.","However, at the last moment of his life, unimaginable power seemed to burst out of his body, and he suddenly broke through the restrictions on his meridians!","Several young cultivators couldn't bear the attack of the Dao Profound Realm exponent's burning energy and blood, and were immediately knocked away by him.","Huang Sanbai turned around and ran away.","However, Huang Likai and Huang Xindi were standing at the edge of Burning Sky Lake to imprison him. How could they let him escape like this?","\"Huang Sanbai, do you still want to escape?\"","\"Where do you think you can run to?! Hmph!\"","The two men shouted sharply and took action at the same time, fiercely attacking Huang Sanbai.","Huang Sanbai's action just now can only be said to be a return to the past. In fact, his own strength has dropped by several levels in the recent torture.","When two Dao Profound Realm masters at their peak joined forces, he couldn't resist at all.","He rushed forward a few steps desperately, but in the end, he was caught by the two Elders.","Huang Likai and Huang Xindi were worried that something would happen if it took too long, so they threw him directly into the Burning Sky Lake regardless of the ceremony.","The moment Huang Sanbai fell into the burning magma, he let out a heart-rending scream.","This sound sounded so terrifying that many of the younger generation of cultivators with less experience were so frightened that their faces turned pale. Some even couldn't even stand firmly and sat on the ground.","Huang Sanbai's body was wrapped in the fiery magma, but it did not melt immediately, but was corroded bit by bit."]},{"number":4283,"title":"Chapter 4283 Two Major Events (1)","paragraphs":["During this entire time, he kept screaming and howling.","Even Huang Yueli found this voice a bit scary when she heard it, and couldn't help but shake her head secretly.","However, although she sighed in her heart, she kept a cold look on her face, as if the tragic scene in front of her had no impact on her.","Her reaction was shocked by the many cultivators around her who saw her reaction.","Although their new Matriarch was very young, she had a heart of stone and was definitely not someone who was easily fooled.","This made many people feel some pressure.","After more than two hours, the execution was finally over.","There were no more screams in the Burning Sky Lake.","However, in the bubbling magma, there was still a group of sparse body parts bobbing up and down.","Some of the cultivators present could not help but vomit after these two hours of torture.","Huang Yueli couldn't stand it any longer. She waved her hand and motioned for everyone to leave with her.","The Elders followed her back to the main hall.","Huang Yueli asked the Elders and stewards present to sit down, and then cleared her throat.","\"Alright, now that the traitor Huang Sanbai has been executed, there are two things that are very important and must be completed as soon as possible in the near future.\"","The Elders looked at each other, and most of them already had some guesses in their minds.","However, they did not interrupt. Instead, they saluted Huang Yueli respectfully and said, \"Matriarch, please give me the instructions.\"","Huang Yueli had been thinking about it carefully for several days, so she said it without hesitation.","\"The first thing. I heard from the former Patriarch Huang Tianhao that the clan still has some Phoenix blood cores that have been treasured for many years, which can be used to improve cultivation. Therefore, I decided to have a blood core initiation in the near future. When the time comes, I will need the Elders in the clan who are at the late stage of the Dao Profound Realm and above to jointly protect me.\"","Upon hearing this, the Elders at the scene spoke out one after another.","\"Don't worry, Matriarch, this matter is of great importance, and subordinates will do their best!\"","\"When a god-level genius accepts the blood core initiation, his strength will definitely increase greatly. I would like to congratulate the Matriarch first!\"","\"This is a great thing! It's a blessing for the clan!\"","In the past hundreds of thousands of years, the ancient mythical beasts have almost become extinct in the God Realm, and the blood cores of the mythical beasts collected by the major clans in the early years are all gone.","There were only four phoenix blood cores left in the Sacred Phoenix Clan.","However, when Huang Yueli proposed to use a blood core initiation, no one expressed any objection.","On the contrary, every Elder felt that this should be the case.","According to the clan's practice, when a god-level genius was born, he can apply for a blood core from the Matriarch for cultivation. The only difference was when to receive the initiation.","For example, when Li Moying first came to the God Realm, he received the Qilin Blood Core Initiation at Amethyst Paramount Palace.","When he ascended, he only had the initial cultivation level of Dream Profound Realm. After receiving the initiation, he directly broke through to Heart Profound Realm.","It can be seen that this practice was not unique to the Sacred Phoenix Clan, but a common practice among all the major Ancient God Clans.","And Huang Yueli has not only become the youngest Matriarch of the Sacred Phoenix Clan, her own talent was also amazing. Judging from her age and cultivation level, she was one of the best among all the god-level geniuses in history.","For such a peerless genius, it was only natural to use a blood core.","The first thing went very smoothly and received support from everyone.","Huang Yueli showed a smile and nodded, \"Next, the second thing...\""]},{"number":4284,"title":"Chapter 4284 Two Major Events (2)","paragraphs":["?","She paused and glanced at the Elders in the audience, her expression becoming more serious.","\"The second thing was about my inauguration ceremony.\"","Although at the God Realm's Grand Meet, the incident between Huang Yueli and Huang Sanbai had caused a stir and all the forces in the God Realm knew about it.","Because of this, everyone now knows that she succeeded as the Matriarch of the Sacred Phoenix Clan.","After so many days, it has probably spread to every corner of the God Realm.","However, the formal inauguration ceremony of the Matriarch was still indispensable.","This was not only as simple as officially announcing Huang Yueli's identity as Matriarch to the entire God Realm, but it was also an opportunity for the Sacred Phoenix Clan to show off their clan's strength.","Any first-rate power would take it seriously.","Hearing Huang Yueli mention this matter, the spirits of the Elders were shocked again.","\"Matriarch, your inauguration ceremony is very important. We have been considering this matter for a long time. We have already started preparations the day the news of your succession as Matriarch came from Floating Sea.\"","Huang Xindi strode out, bowed to Huang Yueli, and at the same time, held a scroll in front of her.","\"There are many traditions that need to be followed in the Sacred Phoenix Clan's inauguration ceremony. This is the first time for me to arrange such a thing. However, I have carefully checked all the relevant books and listed all the precautions. The process has been written on the scroll, please take a look at it.\"","\"If you have any comments, my subordinates will revise it right away. At that time, we only need to send invitations to all major forces, and the ceremony can be held within a month.\"","After hearing Huang Xindi's words, Huang Likai's expression suddenly changed!","The two have been competing for the past few days, each coveting the position of the first Elder.","Huang Yueli saw it and felt like a mirror in her heart. However, she needed the two Elders to check and balance each other to work for her, so she deliberately did not express support for either side.","Huang Likai and Huang Xindi worked harder to show off in front of her.","Huang Likai originally thought that since he had no objection to Li Moying joining the Sacred Phoenix Clan, Huang Yueli would definitely choose him in the end.","But who knew that Huang Xindi would be so scheming!","He had actually guessed that Huang Yueli was going to hold the Matriarch's inauguration ceremony soon, so he made preparations in advance, wrote a plan, and handed it over to Huang Yueli in a public place like today.","If Huang Yueli read his scroll and entrusted him with this important matter, then Huang Xindi would snicker.","Being able to take full responsibility for presiding over such a major ceremony as the inauguration ceremony of the Matriarch, in the minds of the clan members, he was already the de facto first Elder.","No matter how hard Huang Likai works in the future, it will be difficult to surpass him.","When Huang Likai thought of this, he immediately became anxious and said loudly: \"Matriarch, although there are many traditions in the inauguration ceremony, there was no need to do everything in accordance with the traditions! Successive Patriarches, including Patriarch Tianhao, All have made some changes to the inauguration ceremony. What was important was the personal preferences of each Patriarch.\"","\"If everything was done according to tradition, outsiders will think that our Sacred Phoenix Clan was stuck in our ways and does not strive for progress.\"","Upon hearing this, Huang Xindi turned pale with anger.","Huang Likai was mocking him for not being able to change his ways!","Moreover, he was also hinting to Huang Yueli that he was suspected of using clan tradition to morally kidnap her, the new Matriarch!"]},{"number":4285,"title":"Chapter 4285 Two Major Events (3)","paragraphs":["Huang Xindi immediately retorted: \"If you act according to tradition, at least you won't go wrong! The Matriarch is young, and she can't leave an impression of instability in others! Besides, what's the use of talking so much? My plan is already in place Here it is, where's yours? Why don't you take it out and take a look? You have to compare to know whose plan was better, right?\"","This time, it was Huang Likai's turn to be frustrated.","After all, he was not as scheming as Huang Xindi. He has not prepared in advance. How can he come up with a plan now?","Huang Xindi and Huang Likai glared at each other fiercely, and at the same time turned their heads to look at Huang Yueli, waiting for her decision.","\"This matter...\"","Huang Yueli narrowed her eyes slightly and said thoughtfully: \"Tradition is of course very important, but I still have some ideas of my own, and I don't intend to follow the tradition completely...\"","As soon as she spoke, a proud smile appeared on Huang Likai's face.","Huang Xindi suddenly felt a little upset, but he responded quickly and said immediately: \"Matriarch, if you have any ideas, I can also modify the plan according to your request. After all, although tradition is important, it still has space for a little bit of flexibility.\"","Huang Likai despised him in his heart and secretly scolded him for being extremely shameless.","However, it was impossible for him to shut Huang Xindi's mouth, so he could only be secretly angry.","Huang Yueli said slowly: \"Then... you two mean that you can arrange this inauguration ceremony as per my request?\"","Huang Likai nodded hurriedly, \"Matriarch, don't worry, I will definitely satisfy you!\"","Huang Xindi hesitated.","He always felt that something was wrong with Huang Yueli's words, which gave him a very bad premonition.","However, with the huge threat of Huang Likai staring at him, he nodded without thinking, \"Matriarch, just give me your orders!\"","\"Very good! That's good!\"","Huang Yueli nodded, paused again, and scanned every Elder present one by one.","When everyone was feeling uneasy, she slowly spoke: \"I plan to get married at the same time as the inauguration ceremony, and officially marry Li Moying, the Young Master of the Cloudy Qilin Clan.\"","As soon as these words came out, the entire main hall suddenly became quiet.","All the Elders were shocked by the news and couldn't recover for a long time.","After a while, Huang Xindi was the first to regain his senses.","He immediately took a few steps forward, with a look of horror on his face, \"Matriarch, what did you just...just say? Did I hear wrongly?\"","Huang Yueli showed a trace of impatience on her face, curled her lips, and repeated again: \"I want to marry Li Moying on the day of the inauguration ceremony. Of course, in fact, we are already Husband and Wife, and this time it is mainly just a formality to inform the major forces in the God Realm, so there was no need to be too grand.\"","After hearing these words, the Elders finally reacted.","Their young Matriarch... actually has such an amazing plan!","Not only did she really want to marry Li Moying despite everyone's objections, but she also wanted to set the wedding date on the day of the Matriarch's inauguration ceremony!","For a moment, everyone was frightened, and their first reaction was to object desperately.","\"Matriarch, do you know what you are doing? It is absolutely impossible to do so at this time!\""]},{"number":4286,"title":"Chapter 4286 Two Major Events (4)","paragraphs":["\"Yes, Matriarch, you are still young. There is no need to get married so early, right? Besides, the marriage of every leader must be discussed by the Council of Elders. The recommendation for the candidate for the Matriarch's partner is not something you can just say casually that will be recognised.\"","\"Matriarch, you must calm down! If you want to find someone to practice dual cultivation, countless young talents from all major forces will definitely be willing to fall under your skirt. Why do you have to find someone from the Cloudy Qilin Clan!\"","\"There are so many cultivators in the Sacred Phoenix Clan, and almost everyone has an Elder who died in the battle with the Cloudy Qilin Clan. If you really marry Li Moying, what will they think? Then the whole clan will be torn apart!\"","\"Please, Matriarch, think twice!\"","After the Elders calmed down for a while, they immediately refuted vehemently.","Everyone had their own reasons, and they all spoke logically with passion.","It was not uncommon for someone to get married at the same time as the inauguration ceremony.","For most big forces, when the person in charge comes to power, he or she will be over a hundred years old.","At this age, most of the cultivation levels have stabilised, and it was very common to seek breakthroughs through dual cultivation.","The marriages between the major forces are basically concentrated in this age group.","In order to show their respect and attention to the marriage partner, some powerful forces would hold a wedding ceremony at the same time as their inauguration ceremony, which was a good story.","However, the Elders of the Sacred Phoenix Clan could not accept the same thing happening to Huang Yueli and Li Moying!","Just like when Li Moying was in the Cloudy Qilin Clan, many Elders have made up their mind to let their juniors become the dual cultivators of the Patriarch.","To put it bluntly, even if Huang Yueli looked down on their descendants, how could she not find a talented cultivator from any big force but one from the Cloudy Qilin Clan?","It was rare for the Elders to be so united.","Even Huang Likai, who had been standing by Huang Yueli's side and prepared to hug her thigh tightly, did not dare to speak at this time.","If you speak at this time, you will definitely offend the public!","Huang Yueli said nothing and waited for the Elders to express their opinions before she sneered.","\"So? Have you finished talking?\"","She naturally exuded a powerful aura that was natural, which made these Elders secretly frightened and became quiet for a while.","Huang Yueli opened her lips lightly, \"I completely disagree with the reasons you mentioned.\"","\"First of all, I am the one who chooses whom to marry, not you, so please don't try to influence my thoughts about the decisions of the Council of Elders. Although you are Clan Elders and I respect you, my private affairs... are not something you can reach out and interfere! You even care about who sleeps next to me at night, do you really think you are my parents? My parents also like Moying very much, who are you to intrude?\"","\"Secondly, there is indeed some discord between the Cloudy Qilin Clan and the Sacred Phoenix Clan. However, tens of thousands of years have passed since the bloody battle between the two clans. Which ancient book did you read about the Elders who died at the hands of the Cloudy Qilin Clan? It seems like that? Can anyone really tell me which direct clan members in my clan were killed by the Cloudy Qilin Clan? It's been so many years, and they're still here to settle old scores. Do you think it's honorable?\"","\"To tell you the truth, cultivators from other forces are laughing at the Sacred Phoenix Clan and the Cloudy Qilin Clan, saying that we are narrow-minded and cannot achieve great things!\""]},{"number":4287,"title":"Chapter 4287 Two Major Events (5)","paragraphs":["\"Finally, if you say that I am young and that I can find another cultivator to marry, I can tell you that when Moying and I were in the lower realm, we practiced a dual cultivation from a secret manual together. Hence, our strength has improved so quickly. Hence our high cultivation is closely related to this. So, even if it's to improve my cultivation, I have to marry him, and I won't have anyone else!\"","Huang Yueli didn't speak fast, but every word was sonorous and powerful.","The Elders who had put forward opinions just now felt burning pain in their faces when she refuted them one by one.","What Huang Yueli said was such a loud slap in the face, it was like putting the face of these old guys on the ground and stepping on it hard!","Many Elders had extremely embarrassed looks on their faces and felt that they could not get off the stage.","However, despite this, their stance remained very firm.","Seeing that there was no way to refute Huang Yueli, they could only bite the bullet and pretend to be tough.","\"Anyway...anyway, no matter what, I will not accept the Young Master of the Cloudy Qilin Clan to become the companion of the Matriarch!\"","\"That's right, if the Matriarch insists on having your own way, then the entire clan of our branch will refuse to attend the inauguration ceremony!\"","\"If this matter spreads, our Sacred Phoenix Clan will lose all face. This is absolutely not allowed!\"","\"Matriarch, do you really not consider the feelings of your clan members at all?\"","After hearing these words, the sneer on Huang Yueli's face became deeper and deeper.","\"How do the clansmen feel? I think it's you old stubborn mules who never care about the clansmen's feelings!\"","\"According to what I have observed in the clan these days, most of the younger generation of cultivators do not have such deep hatred for the Cloudy Qilin Clan. Many of them even have friends of the Cloudy Qilin Clan in private. However, due to the pressure of you old stubborn mules, under the pressure, they did not express their opinions publicly. Still under your pressure, they even forced themselves to go to war with the Cloudy Qilin Clan.\"","\"Nonsense, you are talking nonsense! There is no such thing! The young clansmen also hate the Cloudy Qilin Clan from the bottom of their hearts!\"","An old man with white beard and hair stood up and retorted angrily.","\"The members of our branch, even a three-year-old child, know that the Cloudy Qilin Clan are all bastards with low moral character!\"","Huang Yueli glanced at him and sneered disapprovingly.","\"Hmmm, this is very interesting. I would like to know, what does a three-year-old child know about character? What kind of person has a bad character? I think most three-year-old children cannot even be a cultivator from any force. Yet you say that they can tell the difference clearly! If they have such thoughts, they must have been deliberately instilled by you Elders!\"","\"I'm sorry I can't understand. For such young children, they are obviously the hope of the clan's future. You don't teach them well and let them practice hard and be kind to others. Instead, you incite hatred in their hearts! Such an act of putting the cart before the horse, no wonder the younger generation of the clan's strength is inferior to every generation!\"","Huang Yueli's words were unceremonious and she had no reservations to retort to this so-called respected Elder.","The old man was so angry that his face turned blue and his body swayed several times, as if he might fall down at any time.","The faces of the other Elders also became very ugly.","They were dissatisfied, but they couldn't find any way to refute Huang Yueli.","Because, although she spoke directly, every word she said hit the point!","Most of the younger generation of cultivators in the clan don't work hard enough in cultivation. Instead, they talk too much and only brag about the past glory of the Sacred Phoenix Clan."]},{"number":4288,"title":"Chapter 4288 Two Major Events (6)","paragraphs":["This situation has long become a worry for all the Elders.","However, they couldn't find the reason themselves. Apart from urging the children in the clan to practice well, there was no other way. The effect... was of course close to zero.","But now, Huang Yueli's words sounded very unpleasant when she said them, but if one thinks about it carefully, they really make sense and cannot be refuted.","The Elders were speechless for a moment, and some even began to reflect on themselves.","Huang Yueli glanced at everyone and said slowly: \"Then the matter is settled. The arrangements for the inauguration ceremony will be made by Elder Huang Likai...\"","\"Wait, no! Matriarch, you can't act so arbitrarily. You must think twice!\"","When Huang Xindi heard this, he couldn't bear it anymore and stood up again.","He has always been firmly opposed to the interaction between the Sacred Phoenix Clan and the Cloudy Qilin Clan.","There was a big reason why he could sit in his current position as the Second Elder, and it was also because he was the most staunch anti-Cloudy Qilin in the clan.","Therefore, he united the various branches that were most extreme against the Cloudy Qilin Clan and gained their support, so he could always occupy a high and important position in the clan even though his own cultivation was not outstanding.","At this time, he must stand up.","Moreover, Huang Xindi also noticed that Huang Yueli left the inauguration ceremony to Huang Likai, which showed that she trusted Huang Likai more, and that if she had to marry Li Moying, it would be impossible to change.","His position cannot always waver. He can only choose between supporting marriage and opposing marriage.","By supporting this marriage, it would be impossible for him to compete with Huang Likai for the position of hosting the ceremony. In this case, he might as well continue to express his opposition in accordance with his original position.","Huang Xindi was still very prestigious in the clan.","With him taking the lead in the opposition, some Elders who were shocked by Huang Yueli and did not dare to express their opinions also stood up to express their support for him.","\"Elder Xindi is right, please think about it again, Matriarch!\"","\"If the Matriarch insists on having your own way, all our branches will refuse to participate in the ceremony!\"","\"No matter what you say, this just won't work!\"","They became a tightrope, and their attitudes gradually became tougher.","The coldness on Huang Yueli's face became more and more obvious, but she did not become furious as they had guessed.","On the contrary, the colder her eyes were, the calmer she appeared on the surface.","With the support of everyone, Huang Xindi felt a little more confident. He raised his head and said, \"Matriarch, this is the public opinion of the clan. As the Matriarch, you must consider the opinions of the clan! Please think twice!\"","Huang Yueli curled her lips and smiled instead of getting angry.","\"Elder Xindi is right. As a Matriarch, it is indeed impossible and inappropriate to completely ignore the opinions of the clan members...\"","Hearing this, Huang Xindi and his supportive clan were overjoyed, thinking that Huang Yueli had been convinced by them.","\"Matriarch, please...\"","\"But,\" Huang Yueli interrupted him coldly, \"I don't have much interest in becoming the leader of the Sacred Phoenix Clan. What I have always pursued was the pinnacle of cultivation! As for the clan power and such, you value it very much. But I just feel like it's a waste of time.\"","Everyone noticed that there was something in her words, and their hearts skipped a beat.","\"Matriarch, what do you mean...?\""]},{"number":4289,"title":"Chapter 4289 I Will Definitely Choose My Husband! (1)","paragraphs":["Huang Yueli looked indifferent and said: \"It doesn't mean anything. But, for me, I would rather be Li Moying's wife than the Matriarch of the Sacred Phoenix Clan. If we can take care of both, of course everyone will be happy. If If I had to choose one among them...\"","She paused here for a moment.","All the Elders' hearts were in their throats, and they all felt that something was very bad.","\"I will definitely choose my Husband!\"","In the end, Huang Yueli said what they least wanted to hear.","The Elders were startled and looked at each other, seeing horror and surprise in the eyes of others!","Being able to become the leader of the Ancient God Clan Clan should be a dream for all young cultivators in the God Realm.","No one expected that Huang Yueli would actually declare that she would rather give up the position of Matriarch!","Just to be with a man from the Cloudy Qilin Clan!","They were all frightened and couldn't wait for Huang Xindi to speak for them, so they all spoke eagerly.","\"This...Matriarch, please don't say such nonsense! The position of the Matriarch is not something that you can just throw away if you say you don't want it!\"","\"Yes, Matriarch, our entire clan is counting on you now. You must not be so willful!\"","\"The previous Patriarch has already passed the seal to you. Now that you are regretting it, who should we find to succeed you?\"","Even Huang Xindi and Huang Likai were shocked.","After Huang Sanbai's death, the two of them became the two most prestigious among the clan members.","However, even if they usually fight each other to get the position, it was nothing more than the position of the first Elder.","As for the position of the Patriarch, they had never thought about it.","Huang Sanbai seriously overestimated himself and had become obsessed with coveting the position of Patriarch.","The other Elders who were still sane knew that they would not be able to become the Patriarch.","Because they can't convince the public at all!","The Sacred Phoenix Clan was a large clan that has been inherited for hundreds of thousands of years. There were countless branches in the clan. The dozen Elders present represent their respective branches. They are all in competition with each other. Under the branches they control, the details are divided up, each can be divided into more than a dozen different forces.","The direct line of the Sacred Phoenix Clan alone can be divided into so many factions, not to mention the side lines that account for more than 90% of the people!","In addition, there were cultivators like Huang Yueli and Li Moying who were scattered in the three thousand lower realms and whose bloodline was relatively thin. They could also be called clan members.","The total number of these people was at least one million.","Moreover, each person represents a different interest group.","It was actually very difficult to convince so many clan members. Therefore, every Matriarch must be absolutely powerful, at least significantly higher than other members of the Council of Elders.","In addition to strength, there must be other irreplaceable advantages to convince the clan.","Otherwise, even if you take the position of Patriarch, you won't be able to sit firmly.","For example, Huang Tianhao was the number one genius in the Sacred Phoenix Clan when he was young, no less than Huang Beicheng now.","In addition, he was also the only son of the previous Patriarch, and he has the foundation laid by his father.","Even so, after he became the Patriarch, he still faced many voices of protest. Even for a long time, no one would seriously implement his orders as they waited to see the young Patriarch's jokes."]},{"number":4290,"title":"Chapter 4290 I Will Definitely Choose My Husband! (2)","paragraphs":["During the period when Huang Tianhao served as the Patriarch, he had no obvious achievements, which was also related to the lack of cooperation among the clan members.","Of course, the Cloudy Qilin Clan also faces the same problem.","Because of this, when these two major Ancient God Clans saw the emergence of god-level geniuses in their own clans, they couldn't wait to welcome them back and train them as future Patriarchs.","Because the title of god-level genius itself was enough to suppress many protests.","Moreover, the strength of god-level geniuses improves very quickly, and it was almost certain that they would be able to enter the Life Profound Realm before they were one hundred years old.","With such strength, there was no room for anyone to protest.","In this way, at least the clan can be united.","As long as she had this advantage, even if the Matriarch was too young, incompetent, or doesn't know how to handle clan affairs, it won't be a problem. The Council of Elders could do it for her.","Thinking of this, Huang Xindi and Huang Likai became like ants on a hot pot.","They hoped that the young Matriarch would listen to them so that they could have greater authority in the clan.","However, if Huang Yueli quits, then the Sacred Phoenix Clan will be leaderless, and it will really be impossible to find another person who can take this position!","Even if Huang Tianhao was allowed to come out again, he was seriously injured by Huang Sanbai after all, and he no longer has the strength to suppress the entire clan.","In this way, at best, one could temporarily take over the position of Patriarch, but being the Patriarch for a long time will definitely not work.","By then, the Sacred Phoenix Clan will definitely be in chaos!","\"Matriarch, you...you must not be impulsive!\"","\"That's right! This is not a small matter. You made such a decision on impulse. What if you regret it in the future?\"","Huang Yueli curled her lips coldly, \"I am not impulsive. Moying and I have not been together for a year or two. We made a vow a long time ago that we will never let each other down. In the past, it was Moying who gave up his clan and status for me. This time, of course I can do the same for him!\"","\"Don't try to persuade me, it's useless. Since you are not willing to accept Moying, we'll leave tonight.\"","At this point, she had almost made up her mind.","Although, she could also stay in the Sacred Phoenix Clan first, take the position of Matriarch, and then slowly find a way to clear Li Moying's name, but it would just take longer.","However, she was not willing to do this.","Because this was too unfair and frustrating for Li Moying!","Huang Yueli could never imagine that Li Moying, who had always been arrogant and strong, could follow her like a little wife, stay in the Sacred Phoenix Clan, and be the man behind the Matriarch!","Even if he wouldn't refuse, she wouldn't be willing to let him make such a sacrifice.","Huang Yueli turned around, looked at the man behind her on the right, and slightly curled her lips, \"Alright, Moying, let's go.\"","Li Moying hadn't said anything yet and the Elders became extremely anxious and restless.","They didn't care about anything else and hurriedly swarmed up and surrounded Huang Yueli, as if they were afraid that she would run out immediately.","\"Matriarch, calm down, please must calm down!\"","\"This... things need to be discussed, so please speak slowly! We just said that you are still young and don't need to consider marriage so early, but we didn't say that we will definitely not support you?\"","\"That's right! Besides, in a few years you will understand that for a cultivator, whether it is cultivation, power or status, they are actually more important than love! Why do you go to this extent just for the sake of a man!\""]},{"number":4291,"title":"Chapter 4291 I Will Definitely Choose My Husband! (3)","paragraphs":["The Elders tried their utmost to persuade her in all earnest.","This time, their tone of voice was obviously much softer.","However, Huang Yueli's expression showed no sign of softening.","She was not the kind of ignorant girl who was not familiar with the world. It was easy to hear that these Elders just beautified those ugly words to make them sound less harsh, but their attitude was not essentially the same. Nothing has changed!","No one publicly expressed support for her holding a wedding during her inauguration ceremony.","Huang Yueli raised her lips coldly and interrupted everyone.","\"Alright, there's no need to say any more. I've made a decision, you all can get out of my way! Moying and I will leave the Sacred Phoenix Clan today. As for the Patriarch's seal... you can choose the successor of the Patriarch. After that, let me know. I will cooperate with you and help the new Patriarch integrate with the Patriarch's seal.\"","She did not choose to hand over the seal now. On the one hand, she did not know who to give it to for safekeeping. On the other hand, it was also for safety reasons.","With the Patriarch's seal on her body, she can freely control all Ice Moon Summit's mechanisms and arrays, and it will be effortless to leave the Sacred Phoenix Clan.","Hearing this, the Elders were all frightened.","Huang Yueli's tone was very calm, but it was this calmness that made people understand her determination better.","Seeing that the situation was about to get out of hand, Huang Xindi had an idea and hurriedly stood up.","\"Matriarch, don't leave in a hurry. In fact, your subordinates have no intention of going against you. Even if you want to marry Young Master Li of the Cloudy Qilin Clan, it's not something that cannot be discussed! That is, this... ...The inauguration ceremony will be held within a month, and we are preparing for the wedding. Isn't it a bit too hasty?\"","Huang Yueli glanced at him and said, \"Whether it is hasty or not, it has nothing to do with me. I think your next Patriarch will not have similar requirements.\"","\"This...\"","Huang Xindi became even more anxious when he heard that she still wanted to leave.","He gritted his teeth and simply said: \"Well, Matriarch, if you suddenly bring up the matter of your wedding now, it will definitely not be so easy for the clansmen to accept it. You have to give us some time to accept it, right? Otherwise, why don't you first refine the blood core and the inauguration ceremony will be postponed for a while. Together with Elder Likai, I will be responsible for persuading the clansmen of each branch and changing their minds as much as possible.\"","\"If the clansmen can accept it, then of course the wedding will be held. If they can't accept it, it's not too late for you to make a decision, right?\"","His words can be said to have made a substantial concession.","It was equivalent to stating his own position, willing to accept Li Moying, and willing to be responsible for convincing other clansmen!","For a moment, the way the Elders present looked at him changed. Many of them had fierce looks in their eyes and unkind expressions.","In the eyes of most Elders, Huang Xindi was simply a traitor!","Such conditions can be accepted. It was simply unimaginable what the Sacred Phoenix Clan will become in the future!","However, Huang Xindi turned a blind eye to the looks of these people.","He knew in his heart that when he said this, he did not really decide to obey Huang Yueli's instructions, but he was just delaying time.","However, it was impossible to explain clearly in such a situation.","It doesn't matter what others think of him, at least, he will definitely be able to successfully hold Huang Yueli back!","But who would have expected that Huang Yueli glanced at him and revealed a sneer."]},{"number":4292,"title":"Chapter 4292 I Will Definitely Choose My Husband! (4)","paragraphs":["\"Do you think I'm a fool? Stop talking, none of this is possible, I...\"","\"Your Matriarch will stay.\"","At this moment, a deep and young man's voice suddenly interrupted Huang Yueli's words.","Everyone looked at the person who spoke in surprise. After seeing clearly that it was Li Moying, everyone was a little stunned.","Obviously, none of them expected that Li Moying would actually speak out on such an occasion!","As the Young Master of the Cloudy Qilin Clan, it was extremely inappropriate for him to appear at the Meeting of the Sacred Phoenix Clan, and yet he was still talking now!","Who gave him the courage?","However, Li Moying didn't pay attention to other people's gazes at all, and a smile appeared on his handsome face.","He slowly walked to Huang Yueli, leaned over to her, lowered his voice and spoke next to her ears, \"Little Li'er, it's better to stay and receive the blood core initiation first!\"","When Huang Yueli heard this, she was stunned for a moment, and then frowned, \"No, I don't want to stay here anymore. It was a mistake for me to follow them back to the clan! Anyway, Huang Sanbai is dead, and I have taken my revenge. There is no need to stay here anymore.\"","As she said that, she glanced at him with some displeasure, \"Didn't we agree before? If the clan doesn't accept it, we will elope together! Are you lying to me?\"","If it wasn't for the wrong occasion, she would have been ready to pounce on him and bite him.","Hmph, was he just deceiving her feelings?!","Li Moying couldn't help laughing, and his low and sexy voice made Huang Yueli's ears turn red.","\"What are you laughing at?\"","Li Moying put away his smile and said seriously: \"The blood core initiation is very important to improve your strength. After I arrived in the God Realm, my strength improved very quickly because I accepted the Qilin's blood core initiation. As long as you can complete the initiation, your strength will also rise, like me. If you can go one step further, you should be able to advance to the late stage of the Heart Profound Realm immediately! Moreover, it will become much easier to continue to improve your strength in the future. This opportunity... you can't miss it!\"","Huang Yueli flattened her mouth and said disapprovingly: \"I understand everything you said, but...\"","\"Don't think that you can take away a blood core and receive the initiation somewhere else. It's not that simple, the blood core initiation requires a set of arrays and rituals. Otherwise, it is easy to be in danger, and you may even explode and die! Moreover, in Ice Moon Summit, the fire attribute energy is the most abundant, which will help you breakthrough. In short, you must stay here.\"","\"I don't...\"","Huang Yueli wanted to say something else, but Li Moying stretched out a finger and pressed it to her lips.","\"Can you listen to me for once?\"","Facing the man's firm eyes, Huang Yueli lowered her head reluctantly.","Under the gaze of so many Elders of the Sacred Phoenix Clan, the two of them actually started to whisper, and even used their profound energy to form a stance and secretly communicate.","This was simply treating everyone as if they were dead!","All the Elders were so angry that they almost exploded in rage there and then.","Some were impatient and simply took a few steps forward and said, \"Matriarch, the manner in which you are...\"","Only halfway through his words, Li Moying suddenly took two steps back.","Huang Yueli stood up again, and the conversation had obviously changed, \"Since Elder Xindi said it so sincerely, I will believe you for once. Starting tomorrow, I will officially receive the blood core initiation. I hope that when I come out of seclusion, I can get your good news.\""]},{"number":4293,"title":"Chapter 4293 Drastic Measures (1)","paragraphs":["Hearing this, the Elders present were obviously relieved.","What they feared most was that Huang Yueli didn't listen to their opinions at all and just walked away.","If this was the case, they really had no other ideas to make her stay.","But now, Huang Yueli still hopes to improve her clan's strength, so at least they had some hope to keep her.","Moreover, even if Huang Yueli's talent was incredible, it would take at least twenty days to completely complete the blood core initiation.","With this little time, at least they can still discuss it, so that it won't be like now, becoming a mess without even a unified opinion.","Huang Likai quickly stepped out and said loudly: \"Matriarch, don't worry, you don't need to worry about such trivial matters. You just need to concentrate on fusing the blood core and improving your strength. We will definitely work hard to relieve your worries. \"","Huang Xindi saw that his opponent had taken the lead. This time, he did not show any impatience. Instead, the corners of his mouth raised into a sneer.","He immediately fell to the ground and said, \"I will obey the arrangements of the Matriarch.\"","Huang Yueli was about to perform the blood core initiation ceremony, which was what all the clan members were eagerly looking forward to.","Therefore, the Elders were very cooperative on this point.","Back to this topic, the meeting went very smoothly.","The Elders quickly selected the nine strongest people, who were responsible for setting up an array according to the records in ancient books to protect Huang Yueli.","The remaining Elders also received tasks, some were responsible for preparing materials, and some were responsible for cleaning up the venue. Everyone was very active and harmonious.","Huang Yueli was quite satisfied with how they had performed.","After the meeting, she left with Li Moying.","The two walked out of the main hall side by side, and suddenly stopped in the woods not far away.","Huang Yueli snapped her fingers and summoned Little Wang Cai from the Sky Phoenix Ring.","Little Phoenix was now able to skillfully control his body size, and usually maintains his juvenile body state, which saves energy.","It flapped its wings and looked up at Huang Yueli.","\"Female Devil, why did you summon me to come out? Can we eat roasted chicken legs again?\"","\"You only know how to eat!\" Huang Yueli was speechless for a while, \"I'll give you a task. If you finish it, I will roast the chicken legs personally for you later!\"","Upon hearing this, Little Wang Cai immediately became excited and flapped his wings much faster.","\"What's going on? Tell me, tell me! Oh no, I can't wait, I'm drooling!\"","The Female Devil in his clan had no other advantages but her amazing cooking skills.","She was indeed a god-level genius with the fire attribute!","She was really a born cook!","The Big Devil was so lucky!","Huang Yueli lowered her voice and said, \"Fly back to the main hall and listen to what they are saying. Be careful. They will definitely set up arrays. If you are not careful, you will be discovered easily.\"","Little Wang Cai flapped his wings and said indifferently, \"I am an ancient divine beast with fire attributes. In a place with strong fire attributes like Ice Moon Summit, there is nothing I can't do. Just wait!\"","...","At the same time.","As Huang Yueli expected, as soon as she and Li Moying left, the Elders gathered together.","Furthermore, a soundproof array was carefully arranged around the main hall.","After the array took effect, Huang Xindi coughed heavily.","\"Everyone, I have a few words to say.\""]},{"number":4294,"title":"Chapter 4294 Drastic Measures (2)","paragraphs":["\"It's...about the marriage between the Matriarch and Young Master Li.\"","All the Elders looked at him.","Some people were particularly excited and spoke out immediately.","\"Elder Xindi, please stop being so pretentious and tell me quickly, what should we do next?\"","\"Isn't it? If this continues, what should we do? From what the Matriarch said just now, she is determined to be with Li Moying! If we persist in our opposition, she will not really leave the Sacred Phoenix Clan....right?\"","\"I think... this is unlikely, right? Maybe the Matriarch just wants to use this to intimidate us. After all, this is the position of the Matriarch of the Ancient God Clan Clan! Who would be willing to give up such a powerful position and the cultivation resources behind it?\"","\"I don't think so? With the Matriarch's talent, to put it bluntly, even if she leaves the Sacred Phoenix Clan, she can advance to the Life Profound Realm wherever she goes. The clan power was not as important to her as we imagined!\"","\"I don't think...\"","Everyone was very divided on this issue, and they began to argue without knowing it.","Huang Xindi quickly coughed heavily and interrupted them.","\"Ahem, Elders, now is not the time to discuss this...\"","\"Why isn't it the right time? If we can't be sure whether the Matriarch really wants to leave, how can we decide on the next step?\"","This statement was recognized by most Elders.","Huang Xindi said hurriedly: \"Everyone, listen to me first.\"","\"Actually, whether the Matriarch threatens us or really wants to leave, this matter itself is not important, because we cannot afford to take this risk, so now we can only treat it as true!\"","After hearing this, the Elders were silent for a while, and finally, they all nodded.","Huang Xindi added: \"Alright, since it was true, we must consider it carefully. After all, today we used the blood core initiation as bait to retain the Matriarch, but it does not mean that we can keep her in the future. Unless... We really agree that she should get married on the day she takes office as the Matriarch...\"","\"This is absolutely not possible!\"","\"Others can be discussed. Even if she wants to keep Young Master Li in the clan, I can turn a blind eye. But a public wedding...how can our Sacred Phoenix Clan disgrace this person!\"","\"Yes, we must never give in to this condition!\"","Hearing the voices of the Elders, Huang Xindi shook his head, \"It's useless for you to protest like this. Our Matriarch has been completely fascinated by that man and will not listen to our advice. Now, the only way to prevent them from getting married... there is only this way...\"","At this point, he suddenly stopped, with a hesitant look on his face, pacing back and forth, shaking his head from time to time.","\"Oh, doing this... was too risky... and... the Matriarch may be furious. No, no...\"","Seeing his posture, the Elders became even more anxious and hurried over to ask questions.","\"Elder Xindi, please tell me quickly what the solution is!\"","Huang Xindi hesitated for a long time, then lowered his voice, \"The only way... is to take drastic measures! If Li Moying is no longer around, no matter how infatuated our new Matriarch is, it would be impossible to marry him!\"","Hearing this, the Elders were all surprised.","\"What?! was this...is this a bit...too much?\"","\"How will the Matriarch react if she finds out?\""]},{"number":4295,"title":"Chapter 4295 Drastic Measures (3)","paragraphs":["\"After all, he was brought by the Matriarch herself. If we... I'm afraid the Matriarch will be really angry!\"","Huang Xindi was also uneasy at first, but after actually speaking out this shocking idea, he regained some composure.","His thoughts became much clearer.","\"You have to understand that Li Moying and his guards are originally from the Cloudy Qilin Clan. There is a blood feud between us and the Cloudy Qilin Clan! Every time we see the Cloudy Qilin Clan, don't we fight to the death? Even if you kill a few of them, it's normal. How can you say it's too much? It's the fact that they have lived in the Sacred Phoenix Clan for so long, that's weird!\"","\"This...this is true...\"","When they first saw Li Moying and Huang Yueli appear together, the Elders all felt the urge to kill.","However, reality kept them in check. They knew that they weren't strong enough and did not dare to attack Huang Yueli, so they could only endure it.","After a long time, it seems like they became used to it.","Now, Huang Xindi made his words clear, which immediately aroused the murderous intention in the hearts of the Elders.","Huang Xindi continued: \"Now is the best opportunity. Isn't the Matriarch about to perform the blood core initiation? This ceremony was estimated to take about twenty days to complete. Even if the Matriarch is extremely talented, it will only take ten days. It was always indispensable. With such a long time, it was enough for us to plan and kill Li Moying and others on the spot.\"","\"As for the Matriarch, after she comes out and knows the truth, she will definitely be angry with us. At that time, we will hide in the array in the back mountain. The Matriarch is only at the Heart Profound Realm, so she can't kill us. When she calms down, she realises that love between men and women is just a fleeting thing, and only the strength of the clan is truly worth pursuing!\"","The Elders all fell into deep thought after hearing what he said in an orderly manner.","The emotions of the Ancient God Clans were not as rich as those of the human race.","Except for the blood ties between people of the same race,they were relatively indifferent to?other emotions.","The vast majority of cultivators choose dual cultivators based on clan and strength considerations, in order to maximise their own strength and obtain resource sharing.","Emotions and the like were almost never considered.","Therefore, in the eyes of the Elders, the previous relationship between Huang Yueli and Li Moying was really incomprehensible.","Moreover, they always felt that Li Moying had used some underhanded means to charm their new Matriarch.","Once the source of the evildoer was gone, Huang Yueli would most likely be able to wake up on her own.","With this spark ignited from this train of thought, most of the Elders agreed with Huang Xindi's views and expressed their willingness to contribute.","Some Elders felt that this was inappropriate, but they did not come out to strongly object.","Everyone gathered together and quickly came up with a plan to surround and kill Li Moying.","This actually doesn't take much effort at all.","Because this was Ice Moon Summit, which has been run by the Sacred Phoenix Clan for countless generations!","A foreign cultivator, even if he was at the Life Profound Realm, cannot escape from their grasp. What does a god-level genius mean?","The Elders were so focused in their deliberations that they did not notice at all that in the corner of the main hall, an inconspicuous red bird flew away from under their noses.","...","Late at night, Huang Yueli's room.","\"...That's what they said. Hahaha, Big Devil, never would I ever have imagined that you, of all people, would actually have such a day! Ha ha ha, I can't take it, I'm laughing so hard!\""]},{"number":4296,"title":"Chapter 4296 Drastic Measures (4)","paragraphs":["Little Wang Cai repeated the plan he overheard in the main hall in detail.","As soon as he finished speaking, he held his belly in his hands and rolled on the ground laughing.","When he heard in the main hall today that someone was planning to murder Li Moying, he wanted to laugh out loud.","If he hadn't remembered that he still had a mission, he would have been unable to bear it.","Who told the Big Devil to bully him every day!","Not only did he bully him, but his Qilin also bullied him!","Now, he has finally offended this group, his great revenge could finally be achieved!","Li Moying walked over with a dark face, grabbed the clothes on the proud little brat's back, and lifted him up, \"How is it? Is it funny? Huh?\"","When Little Wang Cai looked at the his bottomless black eyes, he realised something was wrong and shuddered.","\"No...no, if you think about it carefully, there is...nothing funny. These people are so abominable! Big Devil, beat these grandsons to death! Let me cheer on for you!\"","He waved its little fist, looking filled with indignation.","Liu Buyan was laughing so much that he couldn't stand up straight, \"I must say, Junior Sister, is this really a Phoenix you are raising? I thought it was a dog!\"","\"You are the dog, and your whole clan is a dog!\"","When Little Wang Cai heard this, he jolted up and immediately retorted.","Huang Yueli shook her head and snatched Little Wang Cai back from Li Moying.","\"Alright, your job is done. You have nothing to do here anymore, go and eat the chicken legs!\"","Little Wang Cai cheered excitedly and ran away.","Liu Buyan put away the smile on his face and became serious, \"Junior Sister, the problem is huge this time. How should we deal with it next?\"","He knew that there was a lot of hatred between the Sacred Phoenix Clan and the Cloudy Qilin Clan, but he never expected that it would reach such an extent that they would kill someone if they disagreed!","Moreover, even if Li Moying was a god-level genius whose strength was several levels higher than that of a cultivator of the same level, it seems impossible to deal with so many Elders of the Sacred Phoenix Clan attacking together on the territory of the Sacred Phoenix Clan... .","Of course, Huang Yueli also knew the seriousness of the matter. She frowned and thought for a moment.","\"If it really doesn't work, of course we still have the best option...\"","The Elders of the Sacred Phoenix Clan would never have imagined that she would sneak away before the blood core initiation. It was definitely safe to leave at this time.","However, as soon as she spoke, she was interrupted by Li Moying.","\"No, we can't leave at this time, and there's no need!\"","Liu Buyan immediately sat up straight and retorted nervously, \"Moying, it's pointless for you to show off like this! I know you want your Junior Sister to fuse the blood core before leaving, but if you risk your life, do you think Junior Sister can survive?\"","Li Moying glanced at him, \"Why do you think I will die?\"","\"Isn't that nonsense? You have a thunder attribute, and you are far from the Life Profound Realm. Do you really think that you are a god-level genius, and you can kill a group of people by yourself? Then you are not from an Ancient God Clan, but a true God!\" Liu Buyan pouted.","Li Moying curled up his lips, \"Of course I'm not a God, but I don't think I need to deal with a group of people alone.\"","Liu Buyan was stunned for a moment and asked blankly: \"What do you mean?\"","Li Moying said nothing, but turned to look at Huang Yueli.","Huang Yueli understood his thoughts and said thoughtfully: \"In that case, let's wait first.\"","Liu Buyan became even more confused, \"What are we waiting for? Hmm? What are we waiting for?\"","As soon as he finished speaking, there was a sudden knock on the door outside."]},{"number":4297,"title":"Chapter 4297 Drastic Measures (5)","paragraphs":["Liu Buyan was startled and almost jumped up from his stool.","He looked at the door nervously, \"What's going on? Who would come here in the middle of the night? Could it be that someone can't wait any longer and wants to kill Li Moying?\"","Li Moying glanced at him with contempt, \"Are you stupid? If anyone wants to deal with me, of course it has to do be done secretly. How could anyone come here at this time?\"","Liu Buyan was startled and suddenly said: \"That's right...but...\"","Halfway through his words, the knock on the door rang again.","This time, the visitors outside seemed to be afraid that they would not open the door, so they immediately announced their door.","\"Matriarch, have you rested? This is Huang Likai. I have something to seek your advise for. This matter is extremely urgent, so I took the liberty to come and disturb you at this time. Please take some time to come out.\"","Huang Yueli raised her eyebrows and looked at Li Moying.","\"It turns out to be Elder Likai, please come in quickly.\"","Huang Likai gently opened the door and walked in.","Seeing that Li Moying and Liu Buyan were both in the room, he was obviously stunned.","Huang Yueli said: \"Elder Likai, I didn't expect you to come here so late? I am discussing with my Husband and Senior Brother about the blood core initiation in a few days. I heard that the blood core initiation process is very dangerous, so I need to prepare some elixirs in case of emergencies.\"","Huang Likai shuddered secretly when he heard the words \"blood core initiation\".","Just now in the main hall, he was forced to hear the plans of Huang Xindi and others, and he suddenly felt extremely nervous and anxious.","He really didn't expect that Huang Xindi would be so courageous that she would even dare to kill the fiancé personally selected by the Matriarch!","Moreover, there were actually so many people supporting him!","Although Huang Likai knew very little about love between men and women, he did know that their new Matriarch was definitely not someone who is so easy to deal with!","Huang Xindi and others thought that because she was young, she could be at their mercy. That was absolutely a big mistake!","Once Huang Yueli was completely angered, he simply couldn't imagine what would happen in the end!","After Huang Likai returned to his residence, he didn't even eat dinner. He stayed alone in his room, thinking about it, and really didn't know what to do.","If he followed Huang Xindi's plan, he was really afraid that something irreversible would happen.","When the time comes, Huang Yueli will give up her position as Matriarch and sever ties with the clan forever, which will have relatively minor consequences.","When it gets serious, no one knows what revenge she can do.","However, Huang Xindi and the others obviously didn't believe what he said.","Huang Likai did not dare to say more and openly opposed their plan.","Killing the god-level genius of the Cloudy Qilin Clan without mercy was a normal thing in the eyes of the cultivators of the Sacred Phoenix Clan.","Those who were hesitant like him can only be regarded as heretics.","Huang Xindi could even insist on labelling him a clan traitor.","If this happens, he will be in big trouble.","Huang Likai felt that nothing he did was right, so he could only remain silent in the main hall.","It wasn't until he was alone at night that he made up his mind and decided to come to Huang Yueli to explain the behind-the-scenes plan of Huang Xindi and others.","Huang Yueli looked at Huang Likai's uncertain expression and already knew his purpose.","However, she did not take the initiative to expose this matter."]},{"number":4298,"title":"Chapter 4298 Drastic Measures (6)","paragraphs":["She personally lifted the teapot on the low table and poured Huang Likai a cup.","\"Elder Likai, let's have some tea. It's rare that you come here so late, why? You also have some precautions for blood core initiation. Do you want to warn me?\"","\"I... this... yes, the blood core initiation is very dangerous. If you don't do it right, you may go crazy. I have read a few related books when I was young. If the Matriarch is interested, I will ask someone to do it when I go back. Send me the classics.\"","Huang Likai followed her words and felt that this topic was a little safer.","Huang Yueli smiled and said, \"That's good, thank you. It's really touching that you can think so thoughtfully.\"","After going around in a circle, she kept the topic on the blood core initiation ceremony, but she didn't bring up a word about Huang Xindi.","Huang Likai remained calm at first and chatted with her.","But the further back he got, the more nervous he became.","Finally, he couldn't hold it any longer and stood up suddenly and said: \"Clan... Matriarch, there is something... I... I must tell you! Please ask Young Master Li and Divine Doctor Liu to stay out of the way. \"","Huang Yueli smiled slightly, shook her head and said, \"No need, my husband and senior brother are both trustworthy people. No matter what you have to say, there is no need to hide it from them.\"","\"But...but...this matter is really important! It affects the future of the entire Sacred Phoenix Clan, and...\"","Huang Likai immediately became anxious when he heard that she was taking it so seriously.","Huang Yueli is still too young and can't distinguish the importance of things. Do you really think that if she becomes the Matriarch, all the Elders under her will obey her?","Things are far from that simple!","Which of these Elders in the clan does not hold real power in their hands, and each stands on the stand of his own branch, each with his own agenda?","Even he himself came here after thinking about it for a long time and thinking that it would be more beneficial for him to expose Huang Xindi.","Huang Yueli looked at Huang Likai who was hesitant to speak, picked up the tea cup, took a sip of tea, and then spoke slowly.","\"Actually, Elder Likai, you don't need to be so nervous. I have already guessed your purpose of coming.\"","Of course Huang Likai would not believe such words and immediately shook his head, \"No, Matriarch, you can't possibly...\"","\"You came here this time to tell me what Huang Xindi was planning behind my back, right? Are he and his Elders planning to attack my husband when I receive the blood core initiation? \"","Upon hearing this, Huang Likai was stunned.","When he reacted, he almost overturned the chair in excitement.","\"This... this... Matriarch, how do you know this? This... how on earth was this done?\"","It has been a long time since the Phoenix Divine Beast appeared in the Sacred Phoenix Clan, so these Elders have forgotten that the powerful ancient divine beast is almost omnipotent in such a rich fire-attribute environment.","In Huang Likai's opinion, Huang Yueli should have absolutely no way of knowing what they were talking about behind their backs.","After all, Li Moying and his bodyguards are all Cloudy Qilin Clan cultivators, and they are too conspicuous in this place, Ice Moon Summit.","Countless pairs of eyes stare at them every day.","It is absolutely impossible to eavesdrop or follow.","As for Huang Yueli, she had just returned to Ice Moon Summit and had not yet had a chance to subdue her loyal subordinates."]},{"number":4299,"title":"Chapter 4299 Drastic Measures (7)","paragraphs":["Under such circumstances, how could she know such secret information?","Seeing how shocked he was, a smile was raised at the corner of her lips.","She deliberately left Huang Likai dry for such a period of time because she wanted the current effect.","\"Elder Likai, you don't need to ask more about who told me this news. I can't tell you. I can only say that I am very happy that you can appear here today. You still have to make a decision. A wise choice.\"","Huang Yueli deliberately made her words ambiguous to lead Huang Likai to think that someone had already informed her before he came here.","Huang Likai looked at her inscrutable beauty, and he really thought wrong.","Thinking that someone has come before him!","Moreover, he was not sure how many people came before him? What are their identities?","Is there just one, or...a lot of people have already surrendered?","When he came today, he was very confident that he was the first to express his loyalty to Huang Yueli. Therefore, he had a lot of chips in his hand and did not plan to take them out immediately.","He thought very well. He planned to shock Huang Yueli with this shocking news first, and then, while the new Matriarch was at a loss, he would show off his own strength to make Huang Yueli look at him with admiration and have no choice but to rely on him. he.","In this way, if the matter can be resolved smoothly, it will definitely be no problem for him to ascend the throne of the first Elder.","But who knows, this wishful thinking has now completely come to nothing.","Huang Yueli actually already knew about this conspiracy!","Moreover, she was so calm, it was obvious that she already had a plan in mind.","And in her plan, one more Huang Likai is not too much, and one less than him is not too much!","This situation immediately aroused Huang Likai's sense of crisis.","All his little thoughts were immediately thrown out of his mind, and he immediately knelt down in front of Huang Yueli.","\"Matriarch, my subordinates are overly worried and underestimated you! I didn't expect that you know everything and have the family's situation under control. Then...then I can rest assured! Huang Xindi, who does not overestimate his abilities, Guy, I dare to confront you, you are really asking for your own death!\"","Huang Yueli smiled slightly, \"It's not surprising that he has these thoughts. After all, before I came, you were all highly respected Elders of the Sacred Phoenix Clan. Now, you have to kowtow to a young cultivator like me, which makes everyone feel uncomfortable... ...\"","She spoke slowly, meaning something.","Huang Likai immediately became excited and said quickly: \"Matriarch Mingjian, there are people like you mentioned, but they are limited to Huang Xindi and his few friends. Most of our Elders support you, let alone Yin and Yang go against each other!\"","Huang Yueli nodded, noncommittal, \"That's good.\"","She paused for a moment, and then issued an expulsion order, \"Elder Likai, do you have anything else to do? I plan to continue practicing, so you should go back early.\"","Huang Likai hurriedly said: \"Matriarch, this subordinate...of course something is wrong with this subordinate! I wonder how you plan to deal with Huang Xindi, a duplicitous guy? Can I help you? Don't worry, subordinate. There are still some forces in the family that can definitely get things done.\"","Under Huang Yueli's repeated psychological hints, Huang Likai was completely led astray by her.","Originally, he had planned to wait until Huang Yueli asked him for help before relenting.","Now that he proposed it, he was afraid that Huang Yueli would not agree."]},{"number":4300,"title":"Chapter 4300 Drastic Measures (8)","paragraphs":["Huang Yueli was amused in her heart, but it didn't show on her face at all.","She had a tangled expression on her face, \"Elder Likai, after all, you and Elder Xindi are colleagues. How can I have the nerve to let you deal with him? Just leave this matter alone...\"","\"No, I must take care of it! If you can serve the Matriarch, your subordinates will never give up! How can you care about personal gains and losses?\"","Huang Likai behaved loyally.","Huang Yueli then relaxed, \"Alright then. In that case, please trouble Elder Likai and make some preparations near Burning Sky Pond...\"","She gave Huang Likai some instructions.","Huang Likai did not hesitate and agreed one by one.","Liu Buyan was on the side, looking at his junior sister's performance, already dumbfounded.","It wasn't until Huang Likai left that he gradually came to his senses.","\"Junior sister, you...the person you said you wanted to wait for is Huang Likai?\"","Huang Yueli smiled and said, \"Yes, but I didn't expect that he would actually come. It was just a guess. But Moying seems to be more sure than me?\"","Li Moying nodded slightly, \"You have just arrived at the Sacred Phoenix Clan, so you may not understand the situation between the two clans. At least in the Cloudy Qilin Clan, not all clan members are so hostile to the Sacred Phoenix Clan.\"","\"What's more, this time, it also involves the struggle for the position of the first Elder. If you are not firm in your position and are driven by such big interests, it is normal for you to do something like informing.\"","Liu Buyan frowned, still confused, \"I still don't understand. Since Huang Likai has this attitude, why did Huang Xindi tell him the plan?\"","Huang Yueli smiled and said: \"Those clansmen who are friendly to the Cloudy Qilin Clan usually don't dare to show it in the family. At most, they only think about it in their hearts. Therefore, Huang Xindi must have thought that Huang Likai also wanted to get rid of him. Get rid of Li Moying. And doing this big thing will definitely anger me. He brought Huang Likai with him because he wanted to support others. It is not impossible to blame Huang Likai afterward. \"","Li Moying also nodded, \"I'm afraid Huang Likai also thought of this. If this thing is done, it is Huang Xindi who will benefit, not him. If it fails, he will most likely come out to top the tank. In this case , it's better to seize this opportunity and surrender to Little Li'er.\"","After listening to their analysis, Liu Buyan finally understood and suddenly looked depressed.","\"You guys are so insidious and cunning! A simple thing, when it comes to your eyes, there are so many twists and turns. No wonder every time I follow you, bad things happen!\"","Li Moying sneered coldly, \"Who asked you to follow us? Get out of here! Little Li'er and I need to rest!\"","He raised his foot and kicked Liu Buyan out.","...","A few days passed quickly.","During this period, several Elders also came to Huang Yueli secretly.","Their idea was similar to Huang Likai's, they all wanted to show their importance while Huang Yueli was isolated and helpless.","As a result, their fate was the same as Huang Likai's.","After being pranked by Huang Yueli, they all decided to work hard to serve the Matriarch.","With these helpers, Huang Yueli arranged everything in secret.","Huang Xindi knew nothing about this.","On the day of the ceremony, he personally went to greet Huang Yueli in front of his residence.","\"Matriarch, please come with me. Several Elders who protect the law are already waiting.\""]}]);
